"","0.4157","This property is being sold as is, and will not have any repairs done.  This is a Probate (Conservatorship) Sale that requires court confirmation.  If you are not familiar with the process of how a court confirmed probate sale works, please ask your Broker or Team Lead, or google ""court confirmation probate sale"" or ""court confirmation conservatorship sale"" in order to get up to speed.  For all offers please include the appropriate Probate Addenda.","","","165 - PV Dr North","Unknown","True","7551005025","","0","","False","3","","","","3","4","","Rolling Hills Estates","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Direct Ph","Agent Pager Ph","Agent Fax","Agent Voice Mail","Agent Email","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","75","2025000","#ERR","09/25/2024 4:26:18 PM","","10/29/2024 4:45:19 PM","12/09/2024 12:00:00 AM","02/11/2025 2:22:19 PM","","","09/25/2024 12:00:00 AM","12/09/2024 12:00:00 AM","09/25/2024 4:26:18 PM","02/11/2025 12:00:00 AM","02/11/2025 12:00:00 AM","","","75","","False","","","","","","","Cash","Living Room","True","","True","Central","True","","True","True","Front Door","Supra","False","","","","33.779413","In Garage","True","False","","","2150000","","","2485000","#ERR","714-333-6407","","mlima@limarealestategroup.com","714-362-2338","Mark","","0","Lima","","SLIMAMAR","","0","","0","H08457","714-362-6407","Lima Real Estate Group","714-333-6407","0","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.327677","","45","18108","Back Yard, Front Yard, Garden, Horse Property","Horse Trails, Storm Drains, Suburban","","Assessor","","","OC24199699","","3","3","","1","Vacant","","","","","","","","","48","","Private","True","","799.76","Are you ready to call the highly sought after and prestigious Rolling Hills Country Club Estates community home?  If so, this is the opportunity that you have been waiting for!  With 2,422 square feet of living space, this amazing home features 4 large bedrooms, 4 large bathrooms, a gorgeous upgraded kitchen complete with granite countertops, rich cabinetry, stainless steel appliances, and plenty of room to cook and entertain, a large entry way that opens up to a large living/family room with vaulted ceilings, a cozy fireplace, and rich hardwood floors, a spacious second living/family room complete with a wet bar, a spacious open dining room, an extremely large enclosed patio with high ceiling, and tons of windows to let in natural light and cool breezes, a lot of storage throughout the home, central air conditioning and heating, an attached 3 car garage with direct access to the home, and much more that you have to come see for yourself.  With a HUGE 18,108 sq ft lot, the outside the home is just as special as the inside.  The front of the home features a large driveway, a gorgeous brick walkway, a large lush lawn, and tons of mature trees and landscaping.   The side yards of the home are HUGE.  One side is large enough to park an RV or Boat and still have plenty of room, while the other is large enough to provide you with many options for use.  The back yard is a large private oasis featuring a large pool and jacuzzi, a fire pit, a covered patio, and endless hardscaping (concrete, pavers, and brickwork) and landscaping with mature trees, plants, and bushes.  In terms of location, it doesn't get any better than this!  This home is located on a cul-de-sac in the highly sought after Rolling Hills Country Club Estates, conveniently close to shopping, dining, entertainment, horse trails, golf courses/country clubs, parks, and freeways. The neighborhood is a true ""pride of ownership"" community filled with gorgeous homes, friendly neighbors, and good vibes.  As if that wasn't enough, the home is located within the highly sought after Palos Verdes Peninsula School District, that is filled with award winning schools!  I'm telling you, this home is the opportunity you have been waiting for to get a prime piece of real estate where you can come and design it to your taste.  Come make it yours before it is too late!","","All Bedrooms Down","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Whit","Prouty","CLW-X48711","CLW-X81461","","","Compass","2025000","False","Full Service","Showings by appointment only.  Please call or text the Listing Agent, Mark Lima, to request a showing.  Please include your name,  brokerage, license # or a picture of your business card.  You will get a confirmation with the CBS code for the Supra Box.  NO CONFIRMATION = NO SHOWING","True","","","","2532","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Bay Mare","","3","Lane","","","Submit","","22688","","Single Family Residence","","","None","False","https://iframe.videodelivery.net/a5b4b797fc11bfb2ef55dce07dbf34ed","","","1971","90274","4203","REA*"
