r Opener","True","Covered, Front Porch, Rear Porch","True","40","","None","False","Close Of Escrow","788.37","***BACK UP OFFERS ACCEPTED** Termite work has been completed and house is ready for new owners to make it home for the New Year! Welcome home! Move right in and start enjoying the harbor and pastoral views in this lovely remodeled 4 bedroom 3 bath home located in the Larga Vista neighborhood of Rolling Hills Estates. This house is conveniently located for commuters who want to take advantage of the rural lifestyle in a friendly neighborhood with great schools in the Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified School District and only a mile away from the Rolling Hills Country Club.  The expansive open floor plan in the living area and backyard were built for entertaining with the opportunity to dine al-fresco under the covered porch with ceiling fan and lighting. The large lot with mature landscaping includes 2 mature avocado trees, a mature Meyer lemon tree and other citrus tree with more room to build an orchard and create sitting nooks throughout the property.  Features include - remodeled kitchen with farmhouse sink, cabinet pullouts/organizing systems, pantry and custom island. 3 remodeled bathrooms (2 with double sinks), inside laundry, large dining room, 2 living areas as follows: living room with fireplace along with room for an eating nook, and large family room with wine bar. Family room has peek-a-boo harbor views and access to the large covered porch with ceiling fan, paver patio, and lawn area for games. Additional upgrades to note are engineered hard wood flooring throughout, custom closets in 3 downstairs bedrooms, primary suite with walk in closet, dressing area and balcony to further enjoy the views. All cast iron and galvanized plumbing were replaced, new tankless water heater with re-circulator, AC, vinyl dual pained windows and sliders throughout.  This house is currently the lowest price per square foot for a newly remodeled single family home without monthly association dues in Rolling Hills Estates. Come see it for yourself so you don?t miss out!","Spanish Tile","Dressing Area, Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Multi-Level Bedroom, Separate Family Room, Two Primaries, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","Palos Verdes Peninsula","","","Andy","McGuire","sbmcguand","S9298","2.5","%","Palm Realty Boutique, Inc.","2075000","False","Full Service","Text Agent 1 - Cindy Bandy at 424-634-0594 to schedule a showing.  Please leave business card and make sure all light are off and doors are locked.","True","None","False","True","2632","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Saddle","","27608","Road","","Ranch, Spanish","Cash to New Loan","","21534","","Single Family Residence","","","Harbor","True","","","Double Pane Windows","1955","90274","5128","RERA20000H*"
