in oranges, and limes-all flourishing in your very backyard. The expansive grounds also offer a level area suitable for a guest house or stables. This charming home comprises 3 bedrooms and 2 baths within its spacious 2,327 square feet. With fabulous curb appeal and a strategically set-back position from the street, the residence captures attention with a circular driveway. Whether you choose to live in it as is or embark on the creation of your dream home, this property promises a lifestyle of comfort and possibilities. Seize the chance to make this distinctive dwelling your own.","","All Bedrooms Down, Family Room, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Stephanie","Heatley","SBHEATSTE","D283","2.5","%","Coldwell Banker Realty","2090000","False","Full Service","Easy to show. Text Rachel (310)872-6358.","True","","","","2327","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Eastvale","","26834","Road","","Ranch","Cash, Conventional","","14114","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Available, Sewer Connected","Trees/Woods","True","https://vimeo.com/905843547","","","1952","90274","4007","LCRA2L"
"2+ Access Exits, Parking","0.5113","Trust Sale: Property is being sold AS-IS and SELLER WILL NOT DO ANY REPAIRS OR RE-NEGOIATE THE PRICE due to any repairs. Broker/Agent does not guarantee accuracy of information concerning the conditions of features of the property provided by the seller or obtained from public records or other sources. Buyer is advised to independently verify the accuracy of all information through personal inspection and with appropriate professionals. The county records show 3 bedrooms 3 bathrooms. However, the downstairs was not completed and now is complete with 5 bedrooms and 3 bathrooms. All offers will be cross qualified with Patricia Lowe at West Shores Financial.","Gas Oven, Gas Range","True","165 - PV Dr North","None","False","7551025005","Hiking Trails, Horse Trails, Clubhouse, Recreation Room, Cable TV, Electricity, Gas, Trash, Utilities, Pets Permitted, Hot Water","225","","False","3","","","","3","5","","Rolling Hills Estates","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","","","","","","None","False","Los Angeles","11","2100000","#ERR","08/07/2023 11:48:59 AM","","","08/18/2023 12:00:00 AM","10/16/2025 2:25:32 PM","","","08/07/2023 12:00:00 AM","08/18/2023 12:00:00 AM","08/07/2023 11:59:07 AM","09/26/2023 12:00:00 AM","09/26/2023 12:00:00 AM","","North","11","","False","Family Kitchen, Dining Room","","Frame, Stucco","Poor Condition","True","","Cash to New Loan","Family Room, Living Room, Gas","True","Carpet, Laminate, Wood","True","Central, Fireplace(s), Forced Air","True","Balcony, Bar, Living Room Deck Attached, Storage, Unfurnished, Wet Bar","False","False","Front door","Supra","False","","","","33.773824","Dryer Included, Individual Room","True","False","","Easements","2199000","Refrigerator down stairs, car in the garage, antique phones","","2199000","#ERR","","","youragentdarrell@gmail.com","","Darrell","","","Benton","","PVBENTJOH","","","","","8481","310-541-8010","West S