isite residence in serene Palos Verdes Peninsula seamlessly blends mid-century modern design with comfort. Situated on a sprawling half-acre lot, this immaculate family haven provides abundant space for relaxation and the creation of cherished memories. Step inside, and be greeted by a flood of natural light pouring through numerous expansive windows, illuminating the inviting interiors. The spacious living area beckons with a cozy stone fireplace, seamlessly transitioning into an additional seating enclave, perfect for intimate gatherings. A generous family dining room effortlessly flows into the elongated kitchen, while a formal dining space awaits those memorable dinner parties with loved ones. Discover convenience at every turn with a designated laundry and storage area, accompanied by a sizable guest bathroom. Two expansive bedrooms boast ample storage and natural light, while the additional primary suite offers a tranquil retreat overlooking the lush backyard oasis and shimmering pool, complete with luxurious fixtures, a standalone shower, and a sumptuous sunken bathtub. A coveted bonus awaits in the form of a dedicated office space, ideal for remote work or creative pursuits. Step outside to an entertainer's paradise, where evenings are spent hosting intimate gatherings or unwinding with loved ones amidst the serene ambiance. Beyond the enchanting pool lies direct access to a private horse stable and trails, adding a touch of countryside charm to this suburban oasis. Nestled within the highly sought-after Eastvale neighborhood, this residence offers proximity to iconic hiking trails, pristine beaches, renowned eateries, boutique shops, and top-tier schools, ensuring a lifestyle of unparalleled convenience and leisure. With its prime location, timeless finishes, and breathtaking outdoor vistas, this is indeed the perfect family home you've been dreaming of!","","All Bedrooms Down, Entry, Jack & Jill","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Maggie","Di