,"853.27","Location, Location ? This Property Has It! Welcome to the top of the highly sought-after Academy Hill neighborhood on the beautiful Palos Verdes Peninsula. Situated on a quiet cul-de-sac, this spacious 4-bedroom, 3-bathroom home rests on a generous and usable 9,878 sq ft lot. Never before on the market, this well-loved home has been cherished by one family since it was built. Step inside to find a bright and open living room with soaring vaulted ceilings with skylights and a cozy fireplace, a formal dining room, and a large first-floor bedroom and full bathroom ? perfect for guests or a home office. The sunny kitchen offers tile counters, lots cabinet space and a built-in desk,  kitchen  opens into a comfortable family room, which flows seamlessly into the private, sprawling backyard. Out back, you?ll find a pickleball court, grassy play area, and a covered patio ideal for outdoor entertaining year-round. Upstairs, the home features three additional bedrooms, including a spacious primary suite with a private bathroom offering a separate soaking tub and shower. Two additional bedrooms share a convenient Jack-and-Jill bathroom, and a large bonus/game room offers the perfect hangout spot for kids or for watching your favorite team. Additional highlights include: 3-car garage, beautiful hardwood floors, plantation shutters, air conditioning, and much more! Academy Hill offers the best of all worlds: a quiet, family-friendly neighborhood, convenient access to shopping and freeways, proximity to award-winning Palos Verdes schools, Chadwick School, parks, golf courses, hiking trails, equestrian facilities, and beaches. This is a rare opportunity to own a home in one of the peninsula?s most desirable neighborhoods. Come make it your own!","Spanish Tile","Bonus Room, Den, Formal Entry, Jack & Jill, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Xingqun","Zheng","PVZHENXIN","V8040","","","K