ek Bosch dishwasher. It opens up beautifully to the spacious family room and dining area, creating the perfect hub for entertaining and everyday living. The generous master suite features abundant built-in closet space and a cozy home office nook. Its en-suite bathroom is bright and elegant, complete with double sinks and a large walk-in shower. Two additional bedrooms are located down the hall and share a full bathroom, while a convenient powder room is situated near the front entrance. Additional highlights include a large mudroom with washer/dryer space and direct access to both the backyard and garage. Situated on a spectacular 22,000+ square foot lot, the property also includes a charming garden shed, horse corrals, and a beautifully finished wood-paneled structure that offers excellent potential as an Accessory Dwelling Unit (ADU)?ideal for a guest house, office, or rental opportunity.","","All Bedrooms Down, Laundry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Brittny","Burford","STACKBRI","S5251","","","Estate Properties","2185000","False","Full Service","Appointment only","True","","","True","2458","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Santa Bella","","5","Road","","Ranch","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","20644","","Single Family Residence","","Water Connected","Neighborhood, Peek-A-Boo","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=surnZQH5AF2&brand=0","","","1957","90274","2435","RERA20000*"
