 spot for family BBQ's, entertaining friends, or just relaxing.  There are steps up the hill inside the fencing of the back yard area, that lead to an old Horse trail, where you could begin your daily hike.  Four (4) Bedrooms on this single level home, featuring a large primary bedroom and private bath.  The primary bedroom enjoys high ceilings and direct access to the back yard pool!  Centrally located powder room bath for guests, as well as a full hall bathroom with tub / shower servicing the other two bedrooms.  The 4th bedroom to the right upon entering the home, would be a perfect guest room, or a wonderful home office.  A separate laundry room is tucked away from all, as you enter the home from the direct access the attached three (3) car garage provides.  A sharp landscaped front lawn area features gentle steps to the front door, concrete and brick driveway, outdoor lighting, and automatic sprinkler system.  Seeing is truly realizing just how great this home will be when you add your final touches and make it your home sweet home.","Tile","Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, See Remarks","","Palos Verdes / LAUSD ? inquire","","","","","Terri","Harkins","SHARKTER","S1092","","","Vista Sotheby's International Realty","2200000","False","Full Service","Please Text or call Steve first, then go direct.  Supra front door.","True","Private, In Ground, See Remarks","True","True","2452","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Peacock","","4","Lane","","See Remarks","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","22688","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Available, Electricity Connected, Other, Sewer Connected, Underground Utilities, Water Connected","Neighborhood","True","","","Drapes, Plantation Shutters, Screens","1971","90274","4224","REA*"
