, a peekaboo view of Santa Monica Bay, and even the iconic Hollywood sign on a clear day.   With its new outdoor cooking area, jacuzzi, and extensive outdoor living space, this backyard is a true oasis, blending relaxation and entertainment seamlessly. Tucked away beneath the deck is newly added storage space, further enhancing the property?s functionality.   In addition to its unmatched views and potential, this home?s prime location offers easy access to the Rolling Hills Country Club Golf Course and the Jack Kramer Tennis Club, providing ample opportunities for leisure and recreation. Situated within the highly sought-after Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified School District, this property offers a rare combination of modern comforts, a tranquil neighborhood setting, and extraordinary development potential.","Shingle","Bonus Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Meagan","Patterson","sbpattmea","S5161","","","BerkshireHathaway HomeServices","2249000","False","Full Service","PLEASE READ ALL OF THE INSTRUCTIONS***** TEXT Questions to 310.622.4819***** ***PUBLIC OPEN HOUSE on SATURDAY, 1/4/2025 from 1-3 PM PRIVATE SHOWINGS BEGIN ON SUNDAY, 1/5/2025***Before a showing is requested client registration is required. Text your clients first and last name to 310.622.4819. ****** To schedule a showing, schedule with ShowingTime 800-SHOWING, (800-746-9464) OR USE THE SHOWINGTIME APP, ONLY. TheMLS users do not use SHOWINGPLUS, CALL SHOWINGTIME.","","Private, Above Ground","True","","2043","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Montecillo","","38","Drive","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","25607","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Golf Course, Panoramic","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=QTejXWYtFTv","","","1962","90274","4249","RERA20000*"
