d single-level, 4 Bed, 4 Bath, home in the heart of Palos Verdes Estates. Originally built in 1955, this residence blends timeless craftsmanship with modern updates. Inside, you'll find gleaming hardwood floors, detailed woodwork, and abundant natural light throughout. The spacious living room features a stone-faced fireplace, raised hearth, and bay window seating. The updated kitchen serves as the heart of the home with a large center island, newer appliances, a second fireplace, open-beam ceilings, and garden views. The flexible layout includes a den and four bedrooms, including a private guest suite complete with kitchenette, bathroom, fireplace, and separate accessideal for multi-generational living or guests. Outdoors, enjoy a lighted pickleball court, large covered patio, and lush grassy yardperfect for entertaining or relaxing under the Palos Verdes evening sky. Thoughtfully updated with recessed lighting, new electrical system, and beautiful landscaping, this home offers both charm and convenience in a coveted coastal setting.","","Living Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","CLW-X83458","Glenn David","Thompson","CLW-X76901","CLW-X72093","","","WILSHIRE REAL ESTATE","2250000","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions: Vacant, go direct. Please contact Tony at (310)-855-3557, or Kristi at (310)-948-3980, with any questions. Showing Information: Go Direct,Supra Lock Box ","True","None","False","","2447","","","CA","Closed","One","","","Eastvale","","27280","Road","","Traditional","","","","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Hills","True","","","","1955","90274","4015","LCRA2L"
