x575","","87916","Horse Property, Horse Property Improved, Irregular Lot, Utilities - Overhead","","","Assessor","","","24435033","","2","2","","","Vacant","","","","Barn(s)","Built-In Storage, Direct Garage Access, Driveway, Driveway - Combination, Garage - Two Door, Garage Door Opener, Guest, Private, Side by Side","True","Concrete","True","40","","Private, Filtered, Gunite, In Ground","True","Close Of Escrow","1041.76","Nestled in the highly sought-after neighborhood known as ""The Lanes,"" this midcentury home is an equestrian haven. Enjoy the peaceful atmosphere of rural living while being just minutes away from convenient amenities. A long private driveway leads to a 2-car attached garage, with additional space outside for guest parking or a horse trailer. This fixer-upper property is a single-level gem offering vintage charm with 3 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, and 2,179 sq. ft. of living space, plus a barn, all on a massive 87,916 sq. ft. lot (over 2 acres). It's located right next to the community riding ring and miles of horse trails. The spacious open-concept floor plan includes a living room with a floating fireplace, an original kitchen with a wood-burning indoor grill and light blue vintage appliances, and an adjacent family room with built-ins and a second floating fireplace. The home features original midcentury touches throughout. Open the glass doors to the pool area and savor the serene views of this private equestrian property, framed by the beautiful Chandler Preserve in the distance, offering optimal privacy at the end of a cul-de-sac. There's plenty of space for outdoor entertaining when you return from riding. A private driveway also provides convenient access to a 2-stall barn, a tack room, and turnouts. Close escrow just in time to experience Halloween in The Lanes, where tree-lined streets close down for neighbors and friends to celebrate the heartwarming tradition of trick-or-treating. Don't miss your chance to be part of this one-of-a-kind neighborhood, where the possibilities are endless to put your magical touch on this fixer-upper on Buckskin Lane. With its unique features and potential for personalization, it's perfect for those looking to create their dream home in a picturesque setting.","","Bonus Room, Center Hall, Dressing Area, Family Room, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Walk-In Closet, Workshop","","","","","","CLW-10010194","Wendy","Sun","VSUNWEN","V7946","","","RE/MAX Estate Properties","2270000","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions: Please call or text Pierre Stooss at 310-699-1143 Showing Information: Agent or Owner to be Present,Call LA 1,Appointment Only ","True","None","False","True","2179","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Buckskin","","89","Lane","","Mid Century Modern","Cash","","","","Single Family Residence","","","Canyon, Hills, Pasture","True","","","Jalousies/Louvered, Screens, Skylight(s), Tinted Windows","1959","90274","4253","RERA2L"
