s the perfect blend of design and comfort. With 5 bedrooms, 3 baths, and 3100+ sqft of generous living space on a large lot, you'll enjoy a perfect setting for relaxing & entertaining. As you enter through the foyer, the formal living room immediately enchants you with its soaring vaulted ceilings, floor-to-ceiling gas fireplace, and skylights illuminating the space with natural light. Enjoy gatherings in your separate dining room or in your light-filled family room, complete with a wet bar and sliding glass doors that lead to your grand entertainer style backyard. Featuring an inground heated pool & jacuzzi, cozy covered deck, open BBQ area, and an expansive terrace where you can enjoy unobstructed views of the Academy Hills Canyon & Santa Bella Trail, this breathtaking outdoor retreat presents an amazing setting to create lasting memories. Envision all the possibilities the spacious kitchen offers with its ample cabinetry and large, bright window seeing into the spectacular backyard. The first level also includes one bed/one bath, ideal for guests or an in-law suite. Upstairs, you?ll discover 4 additional light and bright bedrooms with 2 bathrooms. The master bedroom comes complete with an ensuite, large walk in closet with functional closet system, and an oversized balcony overlooking the backyard to relish the views from your private sanctuary. The master bathroom impresses with its dual sinks, jetted bathtub, separate glass shower, and vanity with considerable storage. You'll love the convenience of your in-home laundry, 3-car garage with direct access, an elevator, and ample guest parking. This home features solar panels (leased), central A/C, and a great neighborhood near it all: Award-Winning Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified Schools, restaurants, shopping, parks, hiking and equestrian trails. Homes rarely come up in this area; don?t miss this opportunity to own your own in the Palos Verdes Peninsula and indulge in spacious country-like living amid the convenience of everything urban &coastal!","","Family Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Arpine","Zamanyan","SBZAMAARP","S4164","2.5","%","Re/Max Estate Properties","2350000","False","Full Service","24HR Notice Required. DO NOT DISTURB OCCUPANTS. Please schedule all showings through the Showingtime. AWAIT CONFIRMATION EMAIL WITH ACCESS INFO. Text Gia/Arpi with urgent questions only. Arpi tel:3104084209, Gia tel:3109083993. When texting, be sure to include your full name and property address. Supra access hours 7:30 AM - 7:30 PM.","False","Private","True","","3104","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Academy","","26633","Drive","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","26545","","Single Family Residence","","","Canyon","True","","","","1972","90274","3964","LCRA15000*"
