Brick, Driveway Up Slope From Street, Garage Faces Side, Garage Door Opener, Off Street","True","Concrete, Covered, Front Porch","True","35","","None","False","Close Of Escrow","1225.11","Located on a quiet cul-de-sac in Rolling Hills Estates.  This property is a beautifully remodeled Ranch style home on a large lot (16,915 sq. ft.) with 80-foot-tall trees.  Four bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms, 1959 sq. ft., with an oversized two car garage and attached workshop (680 sq. ft.).  There is a large, covered patio for outdoor living.  In addition, the home is attached to the garage with a covered breezeway.  The classic Ranch architecture is perfect even now and was custom designed.   The living room and dining room have an impressive cathedral, beamed ceiling.  Both the living room and dining room look directly at the large grassy yard through multiple glass panels and sliding doors that flood the home with natural light. To complete the ensemble, the living room has a grand floor to ceiling brick fireplace.    The kitchen and baths have been remodeled and embody current design trends. New luxury vinyl flooring is throughout, and the home is punctuated with designer lighting and other modern touches.  The huge view lot is part of the Palomino Ranchos subdivision and is widely admired for its peaceful lifestyle.   The yard is ideal for garden parties, fun barbecue cookouts and even wedding receptions!  Come home to your private sanctuary surrounded by super tall trees and a rose garden.  This is the Palos Verdes you?ve heard about!","Flat Tile","Kitchen, Living Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Dapplegray","Palos Verdes","","","Chris","Adlam","VADLACHR","V8107","","","Vista Sotheby's International Realty","2400000","False","Full Service","Please do not use Showing Time. Contact listing agent or listing agent assistant - Helga Brandt - to schedule an appointment.  Helga can be reached via phone/text at (949) 295-4901, or via email at Helga.Brandt@vistasir.com. Easy t