ertaining, which enhances the indoor/outdoor lifestyle.  A conveniently located main guest bedroom and bath, a laundry room and 3 attached garage with direct access complete this level.  Stairs lead up to the second floor, featuring a master bedroom with ensuite bath. three more bedrooms and a full bathroom. Central heating and air. An extraordinary residence surrounded by the loveliest sense of community, Golf course, and Horse trails.  Award winning Palos Verdes School. A home to create memories for years to come.  Destined to win your heart.","","Family Room, Formal Entry, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Holly","Kauffman","SBKAUFHOL","S6107","","","Beach City Brokers","2420000","False","Full Service","Offer deadline is 01/16/25 at 8 P.M. Please email to Shar at  Sharfarrokhsiar@gmail.com. Please call if you have any questions. By Appointment Only. Please call or text Shar at 310-200-7939. Please do not go to the property or walk the grounds without an appointment. Thank you.","","In Ground","True","","2829","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Club View","","14","Lane","","","Conventional","","22688","","Single Family Residence","","","Neighborhood","True","","","","1971","90274","",""
