 storage room, ensuring ample space for all your belongings. With parking for up to seven vehicles, including a 4-car garage, you'll never have to worry about space for guests or family vehicles. Nestled on a generous half-acre lot, the property offers direct access to the scenic Thoroughbred horse trail, perfect for equestrian enthusiasts. Set amidst the serene woodland surroundings of the Westfield community, this property offers a peaceful retreat from the hustle and bustle of daily life. Community features include award winning schools, a tennis court, hiking trails and an equestrian riding ring. This home truly blends modern comforts with natural beauty, creating an ideal sanctuary for any homeowner.","","Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Two Primaries, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Vicki","Leach","SLEAVIC","S5543","","","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","2456000","False","Full Service","Text Greg 310-686-6119 with 4 hour notice. Easy to show. There are two bonus rooms, a mechanical room and a large storage room (total 482 sqft), which are permitted space but NOT included in the listed living square footage.","","","","","4096","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Sunnyridge","","27215","Road","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","17208","","Single Family Residence","","","Trees/Woods","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=8yJN1DNDqr9&brand=0&mls=1&","https://https-www-spotlighthomephotos-com.aryeo.com/videos/01954ed9-b7f7-71cd-8f86-f9bfd93bcaca","","1956","90274","4034","LCRA2L"
