 multiple spaces for entertainment.  And enjoy minimal maintenance required for drought-tolerant landscaping.  The sprawling estate is an equestrian enthusiast?s dream.  A fully functional 560 sq ft barn with water and electricity opens directly to the corral. The turnout area allows horses to roll, exercise freely, and socialize for maximum health. Alternatively, with land being a premium resource in the South Bay, you may consider leasing the barn or building a custom ADU (accessory dwelling unit) or your own pickleball court on this spacious property.  Westfield is one of the best-kept secrets in prestigious Palos Verdes! Homeowners enjoy amenities that include community tennis courts, riding ring and miles of Palos Verdes hiking trails.  Conveniently located near award-winning schools. Do not miss the neighborhood fun at the annual Halloween party and Easter egg hunt!","Composition","All Bedrooms Down","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Amy","Olivares","SOLIVAMY","sb1310590","2.5","%","Strand Hill Properties","2525000","False","Full Service","Please Call or Text Listing Agent:  Kristin Warrick @ 714.914.0900 for showing appointment. Please submit offers to: kristin@kwarrickrealestate.com by Tuesday, April 16th @ 12pm with POF and lender preapproval.  Thank you.","True","None","False","","2445","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Sunnyridge","","27317","Road","","Ranch","Cash to New Loan","","17208","","Single Family Residence","","","Canyon, City Lights","True","https://27317Sunnyridge.com/idx","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=9Chx6yx4evm","","1956","90274","4036","LCRA2L"
