room, dining room and kitchen. Every room is hardwood flooring, except the kitchen, which has tile. Stepping into the backyard is a patio. To one side is the expansive grass lawn and to the other is a private side yard. There is an attached three-car garage. A new owner has the opportunity to remodel the home and enjoy the peacefulness and beauty of Sugarhill Drive. Neighboring parks include Nansen Field and Ernie Howlett Park. Within a five minute drive are: Palos Verdes Golf & Tennis Clubs, Palos Verdes Stables, including the Fern Creek and Valmonte Canyon trails, and quick access to Pacific Coast Highway.","","Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Separate Family Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","David","Keller","SKELLDAV","sb1300260","","","Estate Properties","2565000","False","Full Service","Please contact Listing Agent: Nick Ensbury (310) 503-7574 Nick.e@Lyonstahl.com","","","","","3257","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Sugarhill","","4663","Drive","","","Conventional","","19156","","Single Family Residence","","","Canyon, Hills, Neighborhood","True","","","","1964","90274","1500","RERA20000*"
