,"","Private, Gunite, In Ground","True","Close Plus 1 Day","929.86","Discover an incredible opportunity to own a captivating English Manor style residence nestled in the heart of the coveted Ranchview neighborhood in Rolling Hills Estates. This serene and picturesque community is renowned for its tranquil ambiance, mature tree-lined streets, and convenient access on and off the Palos Verdes Peninsula. This charming home offers 4BR 3Ba that blends timeless elegance and modern comport. From the moment you arrive, the inviting brick facade, lush landscaping, and covered front porch create a warm and welcoming first impression. Step inside to find an elegant interior with rich hardwood floors flowing throughout, enhanced by custom lighting, crown molding, and an open, airy layout. The formal living room features a beautifully carved fireplace and French doors that open to the backyard. Adjacent is a second light-filled sitting area with skylights and  a large bay windows, offering serene atmosphere perfect for reading or conversation. The formal dining room, anchored by a crystal chandelier, flows into a well-appointed kitchen complete with granite countertops, and views of the backyard garden through a charming window above the sink. French doors in both the dining and kitchen areas provide easy access to the outdoors patio for seamless indoor-outdoor living. Downstairs include two versatile bedrooms and two bathrooms-one with a walk-in shower and stained glass window, and another with a soaking tub and granite vanity-generational living. Upstairs, the expansive primary suite boasts soaring vaulted ceilings exposed beams, a walk-in closet, spa like bathroom with double vanities, soaking tub, and seperate shower, plus direct access to a private deck overlooking the backyard. A connected bonus room offers the flexibility for a dressing room, den, or home office with additional attic storage. Outside, the backyard is a true retreat with a resort-style pool, spa, stone waterpool, lush garden, and a redwood color deck nestled among mature fruit trees. A spiral staircase from the upper deck leads down to the patio, completing this perfect indoor-outdoor lifestyle. This home is a rare blend of comfort, charm,and functional luxury. The ranchview neighborhood is highly sought-after for its proximity to award-winning schools, scenic parks, and extensive equestrian and hiking trails. Residents enjoy a close-knit community atmosphere while benefiting from the convenience of nearby shopping, dining, and recreational amenities.","Tile","Attic, Dressing Area, Formal Entry, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Young","Lee","g81767","G6637","","","Dream Realty La Crescenta","2585000","False","Full Service","Showing is easy with appointment. Contact Young lee via call or text at(818)632-8924 to schedule a viewing.","True","Private, In Ground","True","","2780","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Ranchview","","39","Road","","Contemporary","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","19539","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Connected, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Water Connected","Mountain(s), Neighborhood, Peek-A-Boo, Pool","True","","","Blinds, Screens, Skylight(s)","1955","90274","2433","RERA15000*"
