 pool, many fruit trees and lawn that lends itself to relaxation and entertainment. Additionally, there are lots of spaces for all sorts of activities such as putting greens for golf lovers, a playground area, RV parking or other amenities.   Upon entering through the double doors, you are greeted by a grand entrance with soaring high ceilings and marble floorings, leading you into a spacious living room and dining room filled with natural lights. This remarkable home features five bedrooms, three full bathrooms, and a large bonus room, ensuring ample space for comfortable living. The upstairs presents a master suite with a generous balcony overlooking the pool and backyard. The large bonus room boasts city light views and has the potential to become a junior master suite. Convenience is prioritized as one bedroom and a full bathroom are located on the main floor, offering flexibility for guests or a home office. The fully remodeled kitchen showcases custom designed cabinets, granite countertops, top of the line appliances such as Sub-Zero refrigerator and maple wood flooring that flows into a family room with a fireplace. Award winning Palos Verdes schools. Easy access to beaches and urban life that the South Bay offers.","","Bonus Room, Family Room, Formal Entry, Separate Family Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","Palos Verdes Peninsula","","","Raymond","Yu","PWYURAYM","PB20503","2.25","%","CURB 100% Commission Brokerage","2600000","False","Full Service","PLEASE DO NOT USE SHOWING TIME. All showing is appointment only through listing agent. Please text Ann Kim to confirm a showing schedule. 24hr notice is preferable.","False","","","","3028","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Peacock","","3","Lane","","","Cash, Conventional","","22688","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights","True","","","","1970","90274","","REA*"
