True","47","","Private, In Ground","True","Close Of Escrow","864.36","A HUGE $274,000 total price reduction!!.  This custom-built single level home on a mostly flat lot in the highly desirable Montecillo Neighborhood is a true masterpiece.  BUILT in 2005 and situated in a peaceful cul-de-sac, this stunning home boasts immaculate finishes throughout. Upon entering, you are greeted by warm and impressive Brazilian cherry wood floors throughout the home. The great room features soaring and JAW DROPPING vaulted ceilings that flood the room with natural light from the floor-to-ceiling windows and doors that lead to the backyard. The kitchen is a chef's dream with high-end stainless steel appliances, beautiful cabinets, and a grand island. The bedroom wing offers three spacious bedrooms, each with its own en-suite bathroom, an elegant powder room, and a large laundry room with direct access to the two-car garage. The grand master suite is a tranquil retreat filled with natural light from the floor-to-ceiling windows and skylights in the vaulted ceilings. There is a separate formal living room and dining area that can be converted to a FOURTH bedroom or OFFICE. Step outside and you'll find a private oasis in the pastoral-like backyard. French doors from the great room open up to a stunning terrace perfect for outdoor dining, grilling, and relaxing by the pool. The yard is surrounded by mature trees, providing complete privacy.  What makes this neighborhood wonderful are the wide tree lined streets, walking distance to a local Award Winning Palos Verdes Unified School District elementary school, 5 minute drive to an award winning middle school, and close proximity to the 110 Freeway. If your into tennis, horseback riding, or golfing we are also close to many equestrian riding rinks, the Rolling Hills Country Club, and the Jack Kramer Club. This is a rare opportunity to own a true gem in one of the most sought-after neighborhoods in the area.","","All Bedrooms Down, Bonus Ro