 Three Door, Private","True","Patio","True","54","","Private, In Ground","True","Close Of Escrow","1065.09","Views, views, views! Nestled in the charming neighborhood of Marloma, this beautifully maintained ranch-style home exudes character and warmth, reflecting the architectural style that has captivated generations. This one level cul-de-sac home is enhanced by a private gated horseshoe driveway that adds both security and elegance to the property.  Inside, the home boasts an expansive traditional ranch floor plan that flows seamlessly from room to room. Stepping down into the living area provides a cozy atmosphere, anchored by a classic brick fireplace that serves as a focal point for family gatherings. Outside, the expansive backyard is a serene retreat, complete with mature citrus and avocado trees, colorful flower beds, a four-stall barn and a pool area ideal for outdoor entertaining. As the sun sets, the area transforms into a magical retreat, with the city lights twinkling in the background. The home?s history is palpable, and with a few modern updates, it has the potential to be a timeless treasure for a new generation of homeowners. This 60-year-old ranch-style house is not just a place to live; it?s a warm embrace of nostalgia and a canvas for future memories.","Metal","All Bedrooms Down, Formal Entry, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Devin","Jensen","SJENSDEV","Sb1332590","","","Jensen Realty","2700000","False","Full Service","Contact LA  Aly Beck 310-968-0192 Easy to show!","True","None","False","True","2535","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Marina","","26140","Drive","","Ranch","Cash, Cash To Existing Loan, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","13216","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Connected, Sewer Not Available, Water Connected","City Lights","True","","","","1963","90274","1533","RERA20000*"
