a fresh, move-in-ready home that is, for all practical purposes, brand new. This beautifully designed home offers the ease and convenience of single-level living, perfect for anyone seeking comfort and accessibility. With all rooms thoughtfully arranged on one floor, you'll enjoy a seamless flow between the living spaces, kitchen, and bedrooms. Whether you're looking for a family-friendly layout, or simply prefer stair-free living, this home delivers both function and style.Sitting on an expansive 20,000 square foot lot, the property features a vast backyard complete with a custom cooking station and sink, ideal for entertaining. There's plenty of room to add a pool or pickleball court, giving you endless possibilities including room for an ADU. This area is horse property offering that option with numerous trails and the Empty Saddle Riding Club around the corner. Inside, the home boasts soaring cathedral ceilings, creating a sense of grandeur throughout. Recessed lighting adds a touch of elegance and enhances the open, airy feel. The chef's kitchen is a true highlight, featuring a large center island and overlooks the stunning backyard, perfect for both casual dining and entertaining. Every detail in this home has been thoughtfully designed to provide comfort and style. Don't miss out on the opportunity to own this exceptional property in one of the area's most desirable locations with the excellent Palos Verdes schools. This is an wonderful family home designed for comfort and entertainment.","","Laundry, Living Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","AR40644","Elaine","Lai","A38969","30365","","","Pinnacle Real Estate Group","2700000","False","Full Service","Please call or text  Tiana Bisignano-Capper  3105032377 for an appt before showing","True","","","","3020","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Singletree","","4","Lane","","Ranch","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional, Submit","","1","","Single Family Residence","","","None","False","https:/