"912.31","Situated on a large corner lot, this magical home quietly presents itself behind an unassuming gate.  Come, step inside, and feel a sense of tranquility and lushness as you are greeted by lacey trees flanked by an expansive grassy knoll as you approach the entry?.you have found your Palos Verdes dream home!  A home with an open light-filled flowing floorplan, a living room with a fabulous Moorish design-inspired fireplace, and a formal dining room, all opening onto a most wonderful backyard with a mosaic tile salt water pool and spa, a canopied gazebo, outdoor kitchen, and fireplace ??.a total celebration of indoor-outdoor living and entertaining! Chic European Leicht cabinets and other thoughtful appointments and fixtures are found throughout the home.  The kitchen itself is a testimony to beautiful design and function featuring Miele appliances?stove, oven, microwave, steamer, and a warming drawer.  There?s even a built-in Bosch espresso machine ?..how cool is that? Also downstairs are 2 bedrooms?one ensuite?plus a guest bathroom in the hall.  Upstairs you will find the primary suite, another secondary bedroom, a bathroom, plus a media/entertainment room, which could be a 5th bedroom.  The primary suite has city views, a balcony overlooking the pool, and a particularly sumptuous bathroom with heated floors, a steam shower, a jacuzzi tub, and built-in cabinetry.  An unexpected highlight of this special home is an iconic Louis Poulsen Artichoke pendant light shining in the stairwell ?? a visual treat while ascending and descending the stairs! Ideally located with ease of access on and off the hill, minutes away from the beach, shopping, and groceries, and close to some of the finest public and private schools in the nation.  Also to note, the horse-friendly Westfield community has a tennis court and riding ring for residents.  This contemporary home with its timeless design for indoor-outdoor living to its fullest, perfectly embodies the spirit of Palos Verdes ?...get ready for your new fun life!","Tile","Foyer, Kitchen, Living Room, Primary Suite, Media Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","NONE","NONE","none","NONEMRML","","","None MRML","2705000","False","Full Service","Please call listing agent at 310-971-8098 for appointment to show.","","In Ground","True","True","2965","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Eastvale","","26969","Road","","Contemporary","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","17354","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Available, Natural Gas Available, Phone Available, Sewer Connected, Water Available","City Lights","True","https://www.zillow.com/view-imx/d32d72b4-cbf4-4f0e-b8d9-76329600f571?setAttribution=mls&wl=true&initialViewType=pano&utm_source=dashboard","https://www.cbhometour.com/26969-Eastvale-Road-Palos-Verdes-Peninsula-CA-90274/mlsindex.html","Custom Covering, Screens","1955","90274","4057","LCRA2L"
