n BBQ and dining al fresco, or enjoying a meal in the formal dining room, you have multiple options.  When it?s time to wind down, you can enjoy a book by the fire in the beautiful living room, play a game in the den off the kitchen or perhaps watch a movie in the oversized family room.  It truly is a wonderful home!","","Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Matthew","Engle","pvenglmat","v8491","","","Vista Sotheby's International Realty","2850000","False","Full Service","Please TEXT Valerie for an appt. 310.704.5164","True","Private","True","","3205","Appraiser","","CA","Closed","Multi/Split ","","","Harbor Sight","","25","Drive","","","Cash to New Loan","","18395","","Single Family Residence","","","Trees/Woods","True","","","","1955","90274","5115","RERA20000*"
