tes. This residence offers 4 spacious bedrooms, including an office that can serve as a fifth bedroom, across approximately 2,694 square feet of thoughtfully designed living space. Situated on an expansive 18,077 square foot lot, the home exudes comfort, character, and timeless charm with recently updated spring landscaping, fresh exterior paint, stylish finishes. Inside, the living room is a true highlight with vaulted ceilings, a cozy fireplace, and peaceful views of the pool creating the perfect setting for both quiet evenings and lively gatherings. The adjacent kitchen opens to the  family room offering a seamless layout for daily living. The chic kitchen is designed with functionality in mind, and has been newly updated with designer finishes, sprawling counter space with breakfast bar and dual pane windows that stretch across the entire space with views of the lush backyard and patio. Additionally, the beautiful wood flooring and windows throughout were both installed within the past few years.  Step into the backyard and enjoy the secluded pool, fruit trees, a manicured lawn and direct access to the equestrian trails that define this coveted neighborhood. A three-car garage provides ample storage and convenience. Perfectly positioned on a quiet cul-de-sac and just a short walk to Dapplegray Elementary, this home lies within the award-winning Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified School District. You?ll also enjoy close proximity to the Rolling Hills Country Club and all the beauty and tranquility that Rolling Hills Estates is known for. Don?t miss this rare opportunity to own a special property in one of the South Bay?s most sought-after communities.","","Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Dapplegray","","Ridgecrest","","Holly","Kauffman","SBKAUFHOL","S6107","","","Beach City Brokers","2892000","False","Full Service","Vacant - Go Direct. Contact Tony Accardo at (310) 855-3557 text/call for more information or showings - thank you!","True","None","Fa