husiasts. Enjoy top-notch appliances including a wine refrigerator and Thermador stove top and ovens. Stylish Family Room: Entertain in style in the family room featuring a custom limestone fireplace with an inset fireplace screen, high ceilings with LED lighting, skylights, and a custom-designed built-in entertainment center. Natural wood tongue and groove ceilings add warmth and character. Elegant Finishes: Throughout the home, you'll find designer-level engineered wide plank wood floors, solid core wood doors with Baldwin fixtures, and bathrooms adorned with Newport Brass fixtures, imported Italian marble, and Walker Zanger tile and stone. Sumptuous Master Suite: The master bedroom is a true sanctuary with new carpets, soaring 16-foot ceilings, and a captivating city view. The master bath is a spa-like retreat featuring a calcetta marble countertop, a separate tub and shower, a private water closet, and a honed limestone shower with an infinity drain. Additional Amenities: The property includes a library/sitting area with a city view on the second level landing. There is a 3-car garage with solid wood garage doors and ample storage and commercial-grade vinyl flooring. One of the bathrooms is accessed from the pool and has mosaic tile floors and a solid quartz countertop. Outdoor Oasis: Step outside to a recently resurfaced pool with newer equipment, surrounded by meticulously landscaped grounds that enhance the home's curb appeal. The home is situated on 1 acre of land (approx) adding ample opportunity to build a pool house, mother-in-law quarters/ADU, gardens, orchards, etc. This is not just a house; it's a masterpiece of design and craftsmanship. Schedule your private showing today and experience the epitome of luxury living in every detail.","","Formal Entry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Bedroom, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Hong","Dou","OCDOUHONG","OC15678","2.5","%","East West Properties Inc.","2895000","False"