ful, conscientious design with multiple skylights that bring in natural light, high ceilings that maximize air flow, a newer roof for ensured reliability, and premium hardwood flooring from The Garrison Collection. It is a completely one level home with NO STEPS, maximizing accessibility throughout the property. In addition to these parts of the property, the home boasts a chef-centered kitchen design featuring stainless steel appliances such as the Thermador professional gas range and a Bosch dishwasher, all oriented in a configuration that allows you to cook with a view. Cozy up with your loved ones in the family room next to the fireplace or find solace in the primary bedroom suite, complete with two walk-in closets, a connected bathroom with two custom built vanities, and both a shower and a tub. Each walkway, door, tile, and handle in this home has been carefully chosen to craft an image of elegance alongside environmental responsibility. Inquire today for a showing and find your next home!","","Family Room, Foyer, Great Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Cari","Corbalis","SCLAYCAR","S5267","","","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","3098500","False","Full Service","First Showing - OPEN HOUSE 04/19 SAT & Sun 12 - 3 PM.  Please Text ROD @ 213-663-8888 for showings. 24 hour notice required.","True","","","","3579","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Eastvale","","26954","Road","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","14114","","Single Family Residence","","","Bay, Bridge(s), City Lights, Hills, Peek-A-Boo, Trees/Woods","True","","","","2013","90274","4009","LCRA2L"
