his established Rolling Hills Estates neighborhood where homes rarely come on the market. Located in a highly desirable neighborhood, this property offers convenience and tranquility. Nearby, you'll find top-rated schools, shopping centers, dining options, and recreational amenities, ensuring a fulfilling lifestyle for you and your family. Approximately 10 minutes to the ocean, this location offers flexibility to enjoy the local beaches. Don't miss this incredible opportunity to own a 5-bedroom pool house on almost a 1/2 acre with a remodeled kitchen, sport court, and so much more.  Come and envision the possibilities of luxurious living in this remarkable home nestled on a sprawling lot with direct bridal trail access offering the perfect blend of comfort and outdoor paradise. As you approach the residence, you'll be captivated by its striking curb appeal and lush landscaping. Once inside you?re greeted by an open and spacious floor plan with an abundance of natural light. The heart of this home is the recently remodeled kitchen boasting a built in refrigerator, functional pantry, Thermador cooktop and double oven, quartz countertops, and a large butcher block center island for family to gather. The expansive living areas overlooking the pool offer plenty of room for relaxation and gathering and feature large windows and a fireplace.  This home offers flexibility for multi-generational living, a private guest quarters or dedicated home offices featuring 2 bedrooms with private bath in the upstairs wing and 3 bedrooms downstairs include the well appointed primary suite with 2 walk-in closets, private laundry, en-suite bathroom complete with dual vanities, a soaking tub, and a separate shower.  Relax on the covered patio, perfect for al fresco dining and entertainment. It?s the perfect space to retreat and enjoy the backyard features which include the pool, spa, sport court and lawn area for games. Just off the sport court is a bonus room currently used as a workout 