rge island with marble counters, a six-burner Dacor stove, and doors that open to an exterior dining area. The kitchen island provides barstool seating, while a custom-built breakfast nook offers a cozy spot for casual meals. An alfresco kitchen window bar, complete with pull-up seating, connects indoor and outdoor spaces, perfect for entertaining guests while enjoying the unobstructed views. Each bathroom in the home has been meticulously renovated with such details as new vanities, mirrors, sconces and wallpaper. The spacious primary suite has a walk-in closet as well as a bathroom with dual sinks, soaking tub and a separate shower. Downstairs, a sophisticated office with built-in cabinetry provides a quiet space for work, complemented by an oversized wine refrigerator for connoisseurs. An en-suite guest area opens to a casual family room featuring a fireplace and a fully retractable door leading to the expansive outdoor entertaining space. The wet bar downstairs has been beautifully rebuilt with a custom slab, fridge, and integrated lighting. The exterior of this home is equally impressive, starting with a state-of-the-art grill, dual burners, an outdoor refrigerator and sink. The second tier of the backyard has been transformed into a lush, usable space with grass, stairs, planters, and vibrant landscaping. The third tier offers a serene putting green, additional grass, and a raised sitting area for relaxation. Both the lower and upper decks have been thoughtfully rebuilt with Brazilian white flagstone flooring that enhances the beauty of these inviting outdoor spaces. The front yard boasts a complete redesign with a new fence and automatic gate, ensuring privacy and security. For peace of mind, the property is equipped with a custom ADT security system, featuring cameras throughout the premises.","","Family Room, Laundry, Office","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Gary","Ludwig","DLUDWGAR","j00395","","","Gary Ludwig, Broker","3500000","False","Fu