er and jet tub for ultimate relaxation. Additionally, there are 3 comfortable bedrooms with ample closet space, 2 luxury hallway bathrooms, and a laundry room ready to serve your needs. Outside, a charming guest house with a spacious family room, 1 bedroom and 1 bathroom, provides a private haven or extended enjoyment for guests or private use. Indulge in the outdoor entertainment area, complete with a wood deck, sitting area, sparkling pool, and rejuvenating spa overlooking the city and mountain views afar. A sports court is ready for basketball, pickleball, or golf practice, with a spectator bench for added excitement. There is also a secluded sitting area by the firepit for the cozy evenings. The 2-car garage with a pull-through door offers ample space for your vehicles, with the convenience of parking an extra car on the other end. Located near award-winning schools, bridle trails, and with easy access to PV and Torrance, this home offers the perfect combination of modern luxury, comfort, and convenience.","","Great Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Rancho Vista","Peninsula","Miraleste","","Amy","Haw","pvhawamy","V8040","2.5","%","Keller Williams Palos Verdes","3600000","False","Full Service","Property is occupied. Overnight notice is preferred.","","Private, In Ground","True","","3263","Seller","","CA","Closed","One","","","Santa Bella","","17","Road","","Modern, Ranch","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","20644","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","City Lights, Mountain(s)","True","","","Casement Windows, Double Pane Windows, Skylight(s)","2018","90274","2435","RERA20000*"
