rivacy trees on an impeccably landscaped view lot, the home boasts 5 bedrooms plus bonus room, 5 bathrooms, and extensive common living spaces both indoors and out. This is California lifestyle at its finest.  The heart of the home is the main-level kitchen and great room, an airy open space that easily transitions from everyday living to lavish entertaining. Chef?s kitchen includes Viking appliances, generous countertops, walk-in pantry and butler?s hall. The great room welcomes cozy fireside gatherings and large indoor/outdoor events alike. Moving glass walls open to an expansive balcony with pastoral and city lights views. The serene primary suite enjoys natural light and treetop views. A second bedroom suite provides versatility for guests, live-ins or private office. Formal and casual dining areas comfortably seat 20 plus. Also on this level are fully equipped laundry room, walk-in wine storage and powder room. Downstairs entertaining space is complete with wet bar, guest bath, pool table and moving glass walls that open to resort-like outdoor living. One of the three lower-level bedrooms is a suite, while two others share a full bath with double sinks. The home theater (currently used as an office) includes a built-in concessions cabinet and pass-through to the bar. Walking distance to the Jack Kramer Tennis Club and overlooking the recently renovated Rolling Hills Golf Course, fitness options abound. Not to mention the oversized salt-water pool, expansive turf for soccer and games, plus ceiling-installed punching bag and aerial arts swing. The lot itself is just under a half-acre and hosts a varied orchard yielding hundreds of fruits annually, including avocado, peach, plum, citrus, persimmon, pomegranate and more. Homesteaders will further delight in multiple raised beds and a fully contained chicken area with coop. Last but certainly not least, this idyllic retreat is located within the award-winning Palos Verdes School District. Other details include smart security system, Tesla chargers in both garages, tankless water heater, Home Team Pest Defense System and energy efficiency upgrades throughout.","","Family Room, Game Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Dean","Lueck","SLUECDEA","OC06682","2.5","%","Compass","4562500","False","Full Service","Please give at least 1 hour notice for all showings. Please call Listing agent Anne 310.755.9592 or Lynn Potter 310.871.4681.  Very easy to show.","","Private, In Ground","True","","4855","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Casaba","","5","Road","","Craftsman","Submit","","52214","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights","True","","","","2016","90274","4516",""
