te all it has to offer!","","Dressing Area, Entry, Exercise Room, Family Room, Foyer, Game Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Separate Family Room, Two Primaries, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Rachel","Martiens","VTYNDRAC","V7186","2.5","%","RE/MAX Estate Properties","4570000","False","Full Service","Please text Stephanie 310-872-6029 with name, company, DRE#. Property is owner occupied and he would like 24 hour notice if possible. Alarm on property with cameras. Small dogs are kept in one small area of home and need to be taken out for showings.","True","Heated, In Ground","True","True","7189","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Eastvale","","26760","Road","","Modern","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","14114","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","None","False","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=Eu5Q3vvm2p3","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=Eu5Q3vvm2p3","Blinds, Double Pane Windows","2018","90274","4005","LCRA2L"
