,"Private, Filtered, Heated, Salt Water, Solar Heat","True","","1028.39","Nestled in the prestigious Empty Saddle enclave, this exceptional 5-bedroom residence boasts an array of remarkable features. As you step through the front door, you'll be bathed in the soft glow of natural light streaming through 8 elegant French doors, inviting you to explore the myriad facets of indoor-outdoor living. The main level showcases a gourmet open kitchen complete with top-of-the-line built-in appliances. This culinary hub flows effortlessly into a generously sized Great Room, skillfully uniting two distinct dining areas (casual and formal) that surround a cozy fireplace and boast soaring coffered ceilings, recessed lighting & built-in speakers. This space provides direct access to the outdoor amenities, creating a seamless indoor-outdoor experience. On this level, you'll find a secluded primary bedroom suite with an exquisitely designed bathroom. Adjacent to the primary bedroom is a thoughtfully appointed office space with custom-built cabinetry, perfect for working or studying. At the opposite end of the floor, there is a comfortable main floor bedroom, ensuring privacy for both residents and guests. Ascending to the upper level, you'll discover 3 additional bedrooms & 2 tastefully appointed bathrooms. The main level adjacent to the pool offers a private yoga retreat or entertainment center featuring its own entrance, resilient cork floors, an adjoining bathroom, ample closet space, and a compact kitchenette.  Additionally, the convenience of a three-car garage and a spacious laundry room enhances the functionality of this exceptional home. The enchanting backyard entices you with sun-drenched days by the saltwater pool, followed by cozy evenings around the warming bonfire. Enjoy outdoor culinary delights with the built-in BBQ and fireplace, complete with a charming outside dining area.  Embrace the opportunity to cultivate your green thumb in the expansive gardening area, perfect for growing your own vegetables. Additionally, you'll have the chance to nurture your own flock of egg-laying chickens within the custom coop. This remarkable estate also boasts the functionality of solar panels offering both eco-conscious benefits & utility cost savings. Tucked away on a tranquil cul-de-sac street, the property is enveloped by a lush nature preserve to the south, ensuring the utmost in privacy and serenity for its fortunate residents. This home truly represents an idyllic sanctuary for those seeking the ultimate blend of luxury and nature.","","Bonus Room, Dance Studio, Den, Exercise Room, Family Room, Great Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom","","Palo Verde Unified","","","","","Taya","Dicarlo","SASIMTAY","SB1379380","2.5","%","Compass","4600000","False","Full Service","Supra lockbox will be installed after broker open house","","Heated","True","","4473","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Empty Saddle","","48","Road","","","Cash, Conventional","","00000","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Water Connected","Canyon","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=8FyNYv5sciP&brand=0","","Tinted Windows","2010","90274","4124","RERA2L"
