argers. Outside, the saltwater ""spool"" accompanied by a seating around the firepit, create a serene backdrop for relaxation and entertainment. Embrace the dream of indoor/outdoor living in this must-see property for those seeking the epitome of new construction and luxurious living!","Shake","Bonus Room, Great Room, Laundry, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Dapplegray","Peninsula","Ridgecrest","OCPAPITON","Dave","Munday","SMUNDDAV","D283","2","%","Coldwell Banker Realty","4650000","False","Full Service","Shown by appointment only. 24-hour advance notice preferable. Please call to schedule showing: 310-490-0214. Thank you.","False","Private","True","","3890","Builder","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Rancho Elastico","","5","Road","","Ranch","Conventional","","61287","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Connected, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","City Lights, Mountain(s), Neighborhood","True","","","Double Pane Windows, Wood Frames","2021","90274","",""
