Patio Open, Stone","True","3","","Private, In Ground, Lap, Pool Cover, Salt Water, Tile","True","Close Of Escrow","1374.84","Introducing 35 Thorsen Ranch Road, an exquisite must-see property located within the private, gated 228-acre enclave at The Residences of Rolling Hills Country Club. This elegantly appointed four-bedroom home is situated on a custom, corner lot, offering front-row views of the private David McLay Kidd designed golf course, accompanied by awe-inspiring city vistas and mountain scenery.  Built in 2022 and showcasing many builder and owner added upgrades, this captivating Adobe Ranch retreat spans nearly 3,900 square feet and epitomizes the essence of single-story living with three en suite bedrooms and all main living areas thoughtfully positioned on the first floor. Ascend to the second floor, where the fourth bedroom suite and a bonus room await. As you first step inside, a breezeway leads you to a private en-suite casita bedroom boasting its own entrance, chevron oak floors, and an inviting firepit and patio, presenting endless possibilities as a bedroom, office/library, or guest room.  Upon entry into the main home, you'll be greeted by beautiful European Oak hardwood floors and soaring beamed ceilings that guide you into the Great Room, featuring an elegant fireplace and floor-to-ceiling stacked sliding glass doors that seamlessly blend indoor and outdoor spaces. The gourmet chef's kitchen delights with top-of-the-line Sub-Zero Wolf appliances, a walk-in pantry, soft-close cabinets, wine fridge and a second dishwasher. The first-floor master suite is bathed in natural light, commanding breathtaking views of the 16th and 17th fairways and the city lights. The master walk-in closet has been exquisitely customized by California Closets, while the master bathroom offers an oversized Kohler soaking tub and custom-tiled flooring and shower. Smart home upgrades abound, featuring a 7-camera exterior package along with a Door bird Camera, a comprehensive security system, and built-in speakers throughout. The garage is equipped with an Epoxy sealant and two electric vehicle chargers. Outside, the saltwater pool and spa, accompanied by a firepit and pergola, create a serene backdrop for relaxation and entertainment. Embrace the dream of indoor/outdoor living in this must-see property for those seeking the epitome of new construction and luxurious living!","Spanish Tile","Bonus Room, Great Room, Laundry, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Los Angeles Unified","","","","","Young","Gill","VGILLYOU","V7946","2.5","%","RE/MAX Estate Properties","5300000","False","Full Service","Shown by appointment only. Please contact Katharine Meier: (310) 490-0214/ km@kdmrealtygroup.com","True","Private, In Ground","True","","3855","Builder","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Thorsen Ranch","","35","Road","","Ranch, Spanish","Conventional","","61287","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Connected, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","City Lights, Golf Course, Mountain(s), Panoramic, Pond","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=6jqvb4F2jTi&mls=1","","Double Pane Windows, Wood Frames","2022","90274","",""
