piring 63 Chandler Ranch Rd, nestled within the prestigious Residences at Rolling Hills Country Club. This remarkable home, completed in 2019 by The Chadmar Group, renowned for their development of high-end luxury enclaves, boasts 5 bedrooms plus an office/library and 5.5 baths, covering an expansive 5634 square feet of breathtaking living space. Calling all wine connoisseurs! The formal dining room is graced with a stunning wall of wine refrigerators, perfect for housing your cherished collection. Step into the immense great room, where panoramic city and golf course views await, seamlessly blending with the grand, yet low-maintenance backyard, sprawling over the expansive 14,000+ square foot lot. Re-energize in the refreshing ""spool"", a combined pool and spa, so versatile for a quick cool dip or a relaxing hot soak. The floor-to-ceiling stacked sliding glass doors create a harmonious indoor-outdoor living experience, quintessential to the California lifestyle. The kitchen is a chef's dream, featuring not only quartz countertops and top-of-the-line Wolf and Subzero appliances but also a convenient second ?messy kitchen? and a generously-sized pantry room, adding both style and practicality to this culinary haven. Ascending to the upper level, you'll discover all 5 bedroom suites, including the master suite also boasting picturesque views of the city and golf course. The master bath is a spa-like retreat with upgraded tile and flooring, offering an unparalleled sense of luxury and relaxation. Adding to the allure of this remarkable estate, a two-level casita with a kitchenette and a separate entrance provides versatility for multi-generational family living or accommodating guests with the utmost comfort and privacy. The motor court, complementing the 3-car garage, is ideal for hosting gatherings and events. Embracing modern technology, the home is thoughtfully outfitted with smart home upgrades, ensuring enhanced security and seamless living. As you drive into the private, guard-gated 228-acre community, you'll experience the true essence of Palos Verdes living at its finest. Don't miss this opportunity to immerse yourself in the splendor of 63 Chandler Ranch Rd and discover the pinnacle of luxurious living in this exclusive haven.","","All Bedrooms Up, Kitchen, Primary Suite, Office","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Emily","Xing","sbxingxia","s5747","2","%","The Realestate Group","6300000","False","Full Service","By appointment only. Please text/call Stephanie at 310-200-1419. Thank you for showing!","False","Heated","True","","5634","Builder","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Chandler Ranch","","63","Road","","","Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","61287","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","City Lights, Golf Course, Panoramic","True","","","Double Pane Windows","2019","90274","3301",""
