njoy the members only club house amenities.  This home has tons of upgrades both from the builder, and by the current owner.  The well-equipped kitchen is complete with dual islands providing ample counter and cabinet space.  Spacious and bright primary bedroom is located on the first floor, accented by a relaxing sitting area, generous walk-in closet upgraded with fixtures imported from Italy.  The deluxe primary bath includes dual-sink vanity, large soaking tub, luxe shower, and private water closet.  Also on the first floor are two secondary bedroom suites, each feature roomy closets and private full baths. Secluded on the first floor is a sizable bonus room that could be an office or gym room.  Up the contemporary staircase, a glass and steel railing bridge leads to the family room upstairs that has an elevated view of Downtown Los Angeles and the mountains in the backdrop.  A cozy one bedroom suite has its own balcony facing the front of the house.  An outdoor kitchen with contemporary flares has marble counters and full set of stainless steel appliances.  The spacious backyard has multiple highlights including the panoramic view, a fire ring for intimate gathering, putting green that echoes the theme of the golf course, and a pond with water fall and stream.  It is located in the award-winning Palos Verdes Unified School District.  Must see to appreciate.","","Atrium, Bonus Room, Den, Entry, Family Room, Formal Entry, Foyer, Great Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Emily","Xing","sbxingxia","s5747","2","%","The Realestate Group","6350000","False","Full Service","Showings By Appointment Only.  Contact Anabelle at 310.408.5091 to schedule showing appointment. Thank you.","","","","","4879","Builder","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Phillips Ranch","","11","Road","","","Cash