"","2.1397","Please note owner peacefully passed at the property. Offers to be reviewed as they come in. Offer guidelines and reports available on: https://app.disclosures.io/link/5-Caballeros-Road-6zyuqur2  Please send a complete offer package with proof of funds to the website: https://app.disclosures.io/link/5-Caballeros-Road-6zyuqur2 . Please note, all offers must be submitted through: https://app.disclosures.io/link/5-Caballeros-Road-6zyuqur2. Offer deadline is Monday 9/8 by 12pm.","Dishwasher, Refrigerator","True","166 - Rolling Hills","","False","7567018034","","2652.16","","False","3","0","0","0","3","2","","Rolling Hills","#ERR","(626) 714-6808","","cynthia@cynthiacohn.com","","Cynthia","","","Cohn","p785796","","","","","","ITC-PF5333","(626) 568-8120","Berkshire Hathaway Home Servic","(626) 440-5100","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Preferred","Agent Email","Co-Agent Cell Ph","Preferred","Co-Agent Email","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","12","2500000","#ERR","09/03/2025 10:19:43 PM","","","09/09/2025 12:00:00 AM","09/15/2025 7:22:11 PM","","","09/03/2025 12:00:00 AM","09/09/2025 12:00:00 AM","09/15/2025 6:59:29 PM","09/15/2025 12:00:00 AM","09/15/2025 12:00:00 AM","","","12","","","","","","","","","","Family Room, Living Room","True","Carpet, Wood","","Central","True","","True","True","","","","","","","33.751725","Dryer Included, Washer Included","True","False","","Trust/Conservatorship","2450000","","","2450000","#ERR","213-935-0050","","letty@aspirelosangeles.com","","Letty","","","Vermeulen Hernandez","","CLW-X92342","","","","","CLW-X8212004","","Aspire Los Angeles","213-935-0050","","Seller Reserved","-118.341402","152x585","","93204","","","Gated with Guard","","","","25585033","","","2","","","","","","","","Paved, Garage - Two Door","True","","","45","","Private","True","","1085.07","Built in 1958, this single-level Mid- Century Ranch style home features 2 bedrooms, 3 baths, and a spacious family room with wet bar, spanning over 2,300 square feet poised perfectly on a 2.14-acre view lot. Tucked within LA's stunning Palos Verdes Peninsula, Rolling Hills is an exclusive gated rural enclave that perfectly balances privacy, natural beauty, and sophisticated living. This serene community is known for its sweeping estates, open landscapes, and a lifestyle centered on tranquility, security, and refined comfort.  Properties in Rolling Hills sit on expansive multi-acre lots, offering generous separation between neighbors and the freedom for you to create lush gardens and outdoor entertaining areas. Combined with gated entrances and top-tier security, the neighborhood provides an unmatched sense of privacy, seclusion and peace. This residence offers an exceptional opportunity to modernize and make it your own. Vaulted wood ceilings and gleaming hardwood floors bring warmth and light into the home. The living and dining areas are breathtaking, anchored by a striking floor-to-ceiling stone fireplace and hearth, with multiple glass sliding doors that open out to the pool, patio, and expansive grassy backyard - perfect for entertaining. The primary suite provides a calming private retreat. This home is tailor-made for an outdoor-focused lifestyle, offering direct access to 25 miles of trails for horseback riding, hiking, and biking. Community amenities include tennis and pickleball courts, and the grounds provide a stunning backdrop for enjoying sunsets, alfresco dining, and social gatherings. Just a short drive from the Pacific Ocean, residents can easily enjoy nearby coastal beaches along with the convenience of nearby shopping, dining, and cultural destinations. The property also provides access to highly rated Palos Verdes schools, making it perfect for families. 5 Caballeros Road presents a rare opportunity to embrace a quintessential ranch lifestyle: combining natural beauty, luxurious potential, panoramic views, and a seamless blend of indoor and outdoor living, all designed for comfort, privacy, and entertaining.","","Family Room, Living Room, Walk-In Closet","","","","","","CLW-253337875","Devin","Jensen","SJENSDEV","SB1332590","","","Jensen Realty","2500000","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions: Call listing agent 1 for access to show, this is a private community and visitors need to be added to the gates for access. Showing Information: 24-hr Notice,Call LA 1,Call First ","False","None","False","","2304","","","CA","Closed","One","","","Caballeros","","5","Road","","Mid Century Modern","","","","","Single Family Residence","","","Hills, Mountain(s), Trees/Woods","True","","","","1958","90274","5285","RHRAS2"
