Garage Access, Paved, Garage Faces Front, Garage - Single Door, Oversized","True","","","57","","Private, In Ground","True","Close Of Escrow","960.9","Welcome to 2900 Palos Verdes Drive North - an excellent opportunity to make Rolling Hills your next home! This picturesque Rolling Hills Ranch Home is located on a private residential lane off of Palos Verdes Drive North. Thoughtfully landscaped with mature gardens and Palos Verdes stone walls and walkways, the home is oriented to take full advantage of a magnificent City and Mountain Views. Flat and usable site with extensive lawns, a pool and patios wrapping around the home for entertaining. Great connection and flow into the main rooms of the home which welcomes guests and family for casual or formal meals. A unique country kitchen connects to a wet bar and casual dining. As you enter the home there is a library or music room and a high ceiling living room with a stone fireplace. All rooms add to the open and spacious feeling of this property. The primary bedroom also faces the view and features a fireplace, spacious bathroom, walk in closet and attached study or office: it is a completely private wing of the home. There are three other bedrooms and two additional bathrooms and a large laundry room. Also on the property is a very big usable corral with the potential to build a barn, along with room for an ADU.Please check with the City regarding their requirements. Rolling Hills additionally offers three tennis and pickle ball courts, two riding rings and 26 miles of dedicated riding and hiking trails, for which the City is famous. Rural and wonderfully safe, Rolling Hills a great place to live. Award winning school district as well as many community activities and opportunities to meet other residents of the Palos Verdes Peninsula. All Rolling Hills Residents are responsible for Annual HOA fees at .20 cents per $100 of home value.","Concrete","All Bedrooms Down, Den, Dressing Area, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, L