"","2.2939","Sellers are motivated and may be willing to carry a portion short term at a low rate! Call LA1. Showing with at least 24 hours notice, please. Buyers and Agents must be registered at the gate to enter. Please provide all names prior to showing. No public open houses allowed. Property can be delivered furnished, with some exceptions. Furniture negotiable with owner. Buyer to do their own due diligence on all aspects of the property and satisfy themselves. Neither owner, broker or agent shall be held responsible.","Dishwasher, Disposal, Microwave, Refrigerator","True","166 - Rolling Hills","","False","7567007022","Tennis Court(s), Other Courts, Hiking Trails, Horse Trails, Security, Controlled Access","3890","","False","4","0","0","1","3","4","","Rolling Hills","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Preferred","Agent Email","Co-Agent Cell Ph","Preferred","Co-Agent Email","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","133","3200000","#ERR","04/08/2025 12:43:53 PM","","07/07/2025 12:56:37 PM","07/26/2025 12:00:00 AM","09/09/2025 6:04:21 AM","","","04/08/2025 12:00:00 AM","07/26/2025 12:00:00 AM","09/07/2025 9:26:19 PM","09/05/2025 12:00:00 AM","09/05/2025 12:00:00 AM","","North","133","","","Breakfast Counter / Bar, Family Kitchen, Dining Room, In Kitchen","","","","","","","Den, Family Room","True","","True","Central","True","Open Floorplan","True","True","","","","","","","33.758937","Dryer Included, Individual Room, Inside, Washer Included","True","False","","Homeowners Association","3688000","","","4095000","#ERR","310-428-7724","","jbtrealty@gmail.com","","Jodi","","","Bell Ticknor","","CLW-C108458","","","","","CLW-X81461","","Compass","310-230-5478","","Seller Reserved","-118.341172","247x400","","99924","Horse Property, Horse Property Unimproved, Landscaped","","24 Hour Security, Gated with Guard, Guarded","Assessor","","","25522099","","3","10","","","","","","","","Direct Garage Access, Driveway, Driveway - Combination, Garage - Three Door, Garage Door Opener, Guest, Private","True","Deck, Patio Open","True","1","","Private, Heated, In Ground","True","Close Of Escrow","882.52","A dream home and home of dreams! A sanctuary enveloped in natural light and tranquility. Positioned perfectly for serenity and privacy. Accessed through a 24 hour guard gate to a private road, a long driveway to hold multiple vehicles takes you to the grand entrance. Step onto a walkway, evocative of the finest mid-century homes, via a series of natural wood overlays over landscaped drought tolerant gardens into this magnificent home. Open the double doors to space, natural light and breathtaking views! Inside a gorgeous, tasteful and stylish renovation in neutral finishes with organic design at the forefront beckons. Walls of glass with sliding doors orient to a truly spectacular, panoramic, above the clouds, view spanning Los Angeles. Surround yourself in this breathtaking view from each living space. An open floorplan with multiple living areas and indoor/outdoor flow to the pool and spa, adjacent decks, patios and yard, is ideal for dining, entertaining, and spending time with friends and family. An eat-in kitchen, with soft touch cabinets, waterfall island with porcelain countertop, and walk-in, organized pantry is ready for all cooking and entertaining needs. What could be better than preparing your favorite dishes while watching the city twinkle and sparkle in front of you? The media room, with its high vaulted natural wood ceiling, is a magical space to unwind and screen your media of choice. The glorious view from the glass walls of the primary suite captivates morning and night. A custom, organized, walk in closet, stunning spa-like, full bath with dual floating sinks and cabinetry, walk-in shower and freestanding tub placed against a frameless glass window highlighting the interior courtyard, is a picturesque space to unwind and let time stand still, while breathing in the moment. Two spacious, en-suite bedrooms with ample closets and an additional bedroom and adjacent 3/4 bathroom with shower, provide multiple spaces for family and guests. A laundry room contains additional counter, folding and storage space. A series of steps lead to additional usable land adjacent below which could become whatever your heart desires. Attached 3 car garage provides direct entrance into the home. Rolling Hills is a secure, 24 hour guard gated, equestrian community with miles of private hiking and riding trails, tennis and pickleball courts, riding rings, community clubs, seasonal fun, community activities, and high rated schools nearby. An exquisite home and an unparalleled lifestyle await at 17 Bowie. Move in and make wonderful memories in this transcendent property!","","Family Room, Great Room, Home Theatre, Living Room, Media Room, Projection, Retreat, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","","","","","CLW-107117562","Mark","Stoll","VSTOLMAR","V8463","","","Vista Sotheby's International Realty","3200000","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions: Call/text LA1. 24 hours notice. Property is in a guard gated community. All clients and agents must be registered to enter. No open houses allowed. Showing Information: 24-hr Notice,Call LA 1,Call First,Appointment w/List. Office,Appointment Only,Call Listing Office,Text LA 1,Registration Required,Listing Agent Accompanies,Do Not Contact Occupant,Video Available ","False","Heated, In Ground","True","","3626","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Bowie","","17","Road","","Ranch","","","","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Coastline, Mountain(s), Ocean, Panoramic","True","https://youtu.be/OCb0oBRmDIQ","","","1966","90274","5220","RHRAS2"
