he ultimate in privacy. As you enter through the double-entry foyer, your eyes focus directly on the wall of windows looking out across the swimming pool to the canyon, harbor, and ocean views. The home is 3,550 square feet and features five bedrooms, two full bathrooms, a three-quarter bath, and a half bath, plus an office on the upper level and direct access to a three-car garage. As you walk down the steps to the main living area, you will be mesmerized by the high ceilings and open floor plan, perfect for entertaining. The floor-to-ceiling fireplace is the centerpiece of the main living area. The back of the home features that wall of windows to capture the stunning views of the canyon, ocean, harbor, mountains, and city lights. You can see for miles! The primary en-suite is located on the first level off the main living area on one end of the home while the kitchen and family room are on the other end. This great floor plan is perfect for someone with the vision to remodel to their style. Step outside to the backyard where the pool and patio offer a beautiful space for year-round entertaining or relaxing while taking in the views.","Tile","Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Foo Yau","Lee","TRLEEYFOO","PB2066","2.5","%","KW Vision","3250000","False","Full Service","Please contact Anne St. Cyr to schedule a showing.  310-755-9592  Very easy to show!","False","None","False","True","3550","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Georgeff Road","","19","","","","Cash to New Loan","","19040","","Single Family Residence","","","Canyon, City Lights, Coastline, Harbor, Mountain(s), Ocean, Panoramic","True","","","","1969","90274","5272",""
"","1.2671","1. Please email all Offers along with Proof of Funds and Pre-approval letter to the listing agent, Stephen Haw, at skh8828@gmail.com. 2. Please review the inspection reports in the MLS Supplements with your Buyer before writing up an Offer.  3. This is a Trust Sale. The property is to be sold ""As is"" in its present condition. The Seller will not do any repairs or give any credit.","Built-In Range, Convection Oven, Dishwasher, Electric Cooktop, Freezer, Disposal, Microwave, Range Hood, Refrigerator","True","166 - Rolling Hills","Unknown","True","7567014024","Pickleball, Tennis Court(s), Hiking Trails, Horse Trails, Pet Rules, Guard, Security, Controlled Access","3250","","False","4","1","","2","1","5","","Rolling Hills","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","","Agent Fax","","","None","False","Los Angeles","7","3330000","#ERR","05/29/2023 4:50:30 PM","","","06/05/2023 12:00:00 AM","08/31/2023 10:15:06 AM","","","05/29/2023 12:00:00 AM","06/05/2023 12:00:00 AM","08/25/2023 9:37:20 PM","08/30/2023 12:00:00 AM","08/30/2023 12:00:00 AM","","","7","Double Door Entry, Sliding Doors","False","Breakfast Nook, Dining Room","","","","","","Cash to New Loan","Living Room, Gas, Raised Hearth","True","Carpet, Wood","True","Central","True","Beamed Ceilings, Built-in Features, Cathedral Ceiling(s), Ceiling Fan(s), High Ceilings, Living Room Deck Attached, Pantry, Recessed Lighting, Tile Counters, Wet Bar, Wood Product Walls","True","True","","None","False","","","","33.760026","Individual Room, Inside","True","False","","CC And R's, Death On Property < 3 yrs, Homeowners Association","3250000","","","3250000","#ERR","310-544-6100","","skh8828@gmail.com","310-544-6166","Stephen","","","Haw","","VHAWSTE","","","","","V8040","310-544-6166","Keller Williams Palos Verdes","310-544-6100","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.343441","","21","55195","Cul-De-Sac, Front Yard, Landscaped, Lot Over 40000 Sqft","Hiking , Horse Trails, Suburban","Carbon Monoxide Detector(s), Gated Community, Guarded, Smoke Detector(s)","Assessor","","","PV23086041","","3","3","","1","Owner","","","","","Direct Garage Access, Paved, Garage Faces Side","True","Deck, Front Porch, Wood","True","1","","None","False","Close Of Escrow","867.19","First time on the market! This mid-century single-story home in the prestigious Rolling Hills boasts panoramic views of the ocean, coastline, city, and mountains. This charmer is nestled on a quiet cul-de-sac in a central location. As you approach the residence, you are greeted by a charming front porch and welcoming entry. The center atrium, with the living areas gracefully encircling it, creates a seamless flow throughout the home. The enchanting living and family rooms, adorned with high cathedral ceilings, add a sense of space. Floor-to-ceiling glass windows and sliding doors effortlessly merge the interior with the natural beauty outside, allowing an abundance of natural light to fill the space while showcasing the awe-inspiring views. The kitchen is a culinary enthusiast's dream, featuring 2 cooking areas, a convenient center island, and a walk-in pantry. Entertaining is made effortless with a wet bar located in the family room, with sliding doors leading to the view deck. Meanwhile, a private office provides a dedicated workspace with a serene and productive environment. Retreat to the primary bedroom, where you will find a generously sized walk-in closet that can be expanded further. Its primary bathroom boasts a private sun-filled garden, double sink vanity and a sunken tub-size shower. This stunning property also offers versatility with two bedrooms sharing a Jack and Jill bathroom, and 2 additional bedrooms that share a hallway bathroom with a double sink vanity. A spacious laundry room conveniently connects to an enclosed patio, perfect for drying clothes under the warm California sun. The large view deck provides an idyllic setting for personal enjoyment and hosting gatherings & outdoor barbecues while marveling at the picturesque views. Surrounded by lush landscaping, this home creates a serene oasis for relaxation and tranquility. The front landscape even includes a potting area, allowing you to indulge your green thumb in planting herbs & garden vegetables. Rolling Hills is renowned for its sought-after location, offering privacy, security, and exclusivity. This is an extraordinary opportunity to update this remarkable property to your exact preferences and create your dream home in one of the most desirable communities in Southern California. Indulge in luxury living, embrace the views, and seize this unparalleled opportunity to elevate your lifestyle. The time is now to make this extraordinary property your very own.","Concrete","Atrium, Attic, Entry, Foyer, Jack & Jill, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Bedroom, Office, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palo Verde Unified","Dapplegray","Palos Verdes","Miraleste","","Amy","Haw","PVHAWAMY","V8040","2.5","%","Keller Williams Palos Verdes","3330000","False","Full Service","For all private showing appointments - please text my team member, Cindy Carter, at 310-388-2533 of your showing date and time, your name and your buyer's name so that she can register the names with the gate guards.","False","","","","3840","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Reata","","6","Lane","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","19040","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Water Connected","City Lights, Coastline, Mountain(s), Ocean, Panoramic","True","","","Skylight(s)","1966","90274","5201","RHRAS1"
