oors, framing the city skyline and inviting indoor-outdoor living at its finest. The state-of-the-art chef?s kitchen is a statement of form and function, anchored by a dramatic waterfall-edge island and outfitted with premium Sub-Zero and Wolf appliances, a 60-inch double oven range, steam oven, built-in coffee system, and custom cabinetry designed with precision and elegance.   The grounds have been thoughtfully landscaped to create a resort-like retreat, with multiple tranquil garden vignettes, a secluded pool area designed for both privacy and entertainment, and a flourishing orchard with mature apple, pear, orange, fig, and avocado trees. At the rear of the property, a rare barn opens up endless possibilities for equestrian use, hobby farming, or further expansion, with direct access to miles of private horse trails to the Rolling Hills community. Additional highlights include an oversized three-car garage, a stately circular driveway with generous guest parking, and proximity to nationally ranked public schools in the Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified School District, as well as prestigious private institutions such as Chadwick School and Rolling Hills Country Day. This rare offering is more than a residence?it is a private sanctuary that embodies the pinnacle of luxury, lifestyle, and land. Perfect for those seeking a harmonious blend of sophisticated living, panoramic views, and equestrian charm in an ultra-exclusive setting.","","All Bedrooms Down, Great Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Mingli","Wang","swangmin","SB1365220","","","Realty One Group United","3500000","False","Full Service","Seller occupied, 3 hours notice required.  Call or text Mingli: 310-293-0250.","False","","","","2995","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","N","Palos Verdes","","2840","Drive","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conv