t door, you are greeted by multiple french doors that look out on the verdant backyard with pool and spa.  The home has 4 bedrooms, 3 baths and also has a guest house (approx 340 sq ft and not included in square footage) on the lower pad, nestled among lemon, lime, persimmon, peach and apricot trees.  Living room and Family room are situated on both sides of the entry and a kitchen with center island looks out onto a third living space. Canyons form the property boundaries on both sides of the property. Living in Rolling Hills is unlike any other community in southern California, so check out this unique family home and experience the comfort and solace and find your place!","","All Bedrooms Down, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","XZACH","NONE","NONE","NONE","NONEMRML","","","None MRML","3675000","False","Full Service","Agent to be present for all showings.  Please give  24 hours notice and provide prospective buyer names for gate access","False","Private, In Ground","True","True","3111","Public Records","","CA","Closed","One","","N","Middleridge","","9","Lane","","Ranch","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","12866","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Connected, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Not Available","Canyon","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=TAosbwpW5sb","","","1953","90274","",""
