ted in the prestigious guard-gated community of Rolling Hills. Set on a private knoll, this 3,191 sq. ft. residence is a masterclass in serene luxury, with walls of glass framing sweeping vistas of glittering city lights and majestic mountains. Inside, the layout flows effortlessly between spacious living, dining, and family rooms each thoughtfully designed to maximize natural light and showcase the breathtaking surroundings. The gourmet kitchen, breakfast nook, and expansive primary suite all share the same stunning backdrop. The primary retreat opens directly to the patio and features a spa-inspired bath with a soaking tub set against striking stonework. Step outside to discover tiered gardens, an oversized pool, and multiple outdoor living areas creating a resort-style environment ideal for both intimate gatherings and large-scale entertaining. A long private driveway and lush, mature landscaping enhance the sense of seclusion, offering a rare blend of tranquility, comfort, and unparalleled privacy.Located just minutes from award-winning Palos Verdes schools, this is an extraordinary opportunity to own a private retreat in one of Southern California's most exclusive communities.","","Entry, Family Room, Living Room, Office","","","","","","CLW-72467904","Brian","Walker","SBWALKBRI","SB1301220","","","West Shores Realty, Inc.","3700000","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions: Please contact LA2 Showing Information: 24-hr Notice ","","In Ground","True","","3191","Estimated","","CA","Closed","One","","","Caballeros","","19","Road","","Traditional","","","","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Hills, Trees/Woods","True","","","","1958","90274","5279","RHRAS1*"
