akes center stage against the sweeping panoramic backdrop, while multiple seating areas offer the perfect spots to unwind and savor the California sunshine. Adding a touch of natural luxury, the property boasts fruit-bearing trees?including tangerine, passion fruit, orange, lemon, peach, apple, loquat, avocado two sweet grape vines for fruit and pomegranate?providing fresh, organic delights throughout the seasons.Beyond its private gated entry and spacious two-car garage, this exceptional estate offers equestrian-zoned trails and an array of exclusive community amenities. Enjoy private tennis, pickleball courts and hiking trails all within the serene setting of Rolling Hills.Perfectly positioned near top-rated schools, fine dining, and premier shopping, this estate is a rare gem?a seamless fusion of luxury, privacy, and natural beauty. This Is A Rare Opportunity!!!","Spanish Tile","Family Room, Great Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Office","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Erik","Lim","CLW-C143284","CLW-X8257519","","","Hollywood Estates","3730000","False","Full Service","***All Agents Please see Private Remarks*** Private Showings by Appointment Only ? 24-Hour Notice Required. This exclusive property is not open to the public, and no public open houses will be held. Showings are available by private appointment only. Please note that the total square footage does not include the guest house.","False","None","False","True","3780","Appraiser","","CA","Closed","One","","","Saddleback","","88","Road","","Spanish","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","6705.0","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Available, Natural Gas Connected, See Remarks, Sewer Available","City Lights, Harbor, Ocean, Panoramic, Pool","True","https://thereelpix-real-estate-photography.aryeo.com/sites/qaljelw/unbranded","https://thereelpix-real-estate-photography.aryeo.com/site