h a large soaking tub. The home also has added security, sound, heating, and cooling systems. The total 3300 square feet of living space includes guest house square footage. The lighted paver driveway leads to a large parking area for 6+ vehicles and an oversized three car garage. Part of the property acreage is across Portuguese Bend Road with enough space for your horses or an orchard! Do not wait to visit and personally experience this gracious home!","Fire Retardant","All Bedrooms Down, Family Room, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Suite, Office, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Heidi","Agid-Mackenbach","VAGIDHEI","V8107","3.5","%","Vista Sotheby's International Realty","3800000","False","Full Service","Vacant and easy to show. Lockbox on the front door. Call Al D'Amico for gate access before showing.","False","None","False","True","3300","Appraiser","","CA","Closed","One","","","Wagon","","1","Lane","","Modern, Ranch","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","30731","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Connected, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Connected, Water Available","Bay, Canyon, City Lights, Coastline, Mountain(s), Ocean, Panoramic","True","","","","1972","90274","5021","RHRAS2*"
