rejuvenate on the pool deck, or take a leisurely spa in the elevated Jacuzzi above the glistening pool. The sound system covers all the outdoor entertainment areas, including the additional trellis covered outdoor kitchen by the pool. Located in the prestigious area known as ?Behind the gates? there are miles of scenic trails to explore, 3 lighted tennis/pickle ball courts, spectacular ocean, city and mountain views, and  several riding rings for residents to enjoy.","Spanish Tile","All Bedrooms Up, Den, Entry, Family Room, Formal Entry, Kitchen, Laundry, Library, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Media Room, Office, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Kevin","Pluimer","PVPLUIKEV","v8542","2.5","%","Compass","3900000","False","Full Service","Please call agents to show for gate access.  Must have an appointment - thanks!","False","Private, Gunite, Heated, In Ground","True","True","4750","Public Records","","CA","Closed","One","","","Caballeros","","28","Road","","Custom Built, Ranch, Spanish","Cash, Conventional","","6705","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Connected, Sewer Not Available, Water Connected","Canyon, City Lights, Coastline, Courtyard, Hills, Ocean, Park/Greenbelt, Pool, Water, White Water","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=sjm2rPC28S7&mls=1","","Bay Window(s), Casement Windows, French/Mullioned","1981","90274","5221","RHRAS1*"
