,"","1290.43","Welcome to this exquisitely remodeled ranch-style sanctuary in the heart of Rolling Hills. Every inch of this exceptional estate has been thoughtfully curated?from the lush, manicured grounds to the luxurious finishes throughout?creating a one-of-a-kind, turnkey retreat. As you approach the home, you're greeted by a magical setting that feels like a world of its own. Mature landscaping frames the entry, leading to an intricately laid Idaho Schist stone motor court. The peaceful ambiance is enhanced by the gentle sounds of nature and a charming garden fountain. Inside, guests are welcomed with views of the sparkling pool and expansive yard. The formal living room offers a cozy gathering space with floor-to-ceiling bookcases and a fireplace, perfect for entertaining or relaxing. The floor plan is both functional and elegant, with high-traffic areas flowing seamlessly into more private living spaces. From the picturesque garage?ideal for a car enthusiast?you pass a versatile fourth bedroom (perfect as an office or mudroom), a ? bathroom, and a spacious pantry before arriving at the designer kitchen. A chef?s dream, the kitchen features custom cabinetry, a premium La Cornue range, dual islands (prep and seating), and top-of-the-line appliances. It opens to a generous family room and dining area with custom built-ins for wine, cocktail, and coffee essentials, as well as AV components. Down the main hallway, the private bedroom wing includes two ensuite bedrooms with marble bathrooms and garden views. The primary suite is a retreat of its own, with a spa-like bathroom, walk-in closet, custom stone fireplace, and refined cabinetry and lighting. A well-equipped laundry room is also in this wing. Set on a fully usable 1.1-acre lot, the grounds are a visual delight, with manicured gardens, photogenic nooks, and distant Queen?s Necklace views. A stone path leads to the stables and corral, with direct access to the Bowie Trail. The stables have been transformed into a charming ADU with kitchenette and ? bath. Adjacent, the former paddock now serves as an outdoor lounge with cantina lighting. Further down, the corral features raised garden beds with irrigation and trail access. Additional highlights include central air and a backup generator. This rare Rolling Hills estate blends timeless elegance with peaceful, resort-style living?an extraordinary property you must see in person.","","Entry, Family Room, Great Room, Laundry, Library, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Neil","Chhabria","SCHHANEI","SB1326590","","","Chhabria Real Estate Company","3950000","False","Full Service","Please call Neil (310) 902-7227 or Anand (310) 704-1395 to schedule a showing.","False","","","","3061","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Chuckwagon","","14","Road","","","Cash to New Loan, Contract, Conventional","","23103","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Cable Connected, Electricity Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Available, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Available, Phone Connected, Water Available, Water Connected","City Lights, Coastline","True","","","Double Pane Windows, Skylight(s)","1960","90274","5276","RHRAS1"
"","2.5886","HOA dues are base on $.20 per $100 of assessed value. Buyer to verify all information in MLS. Lot can handle New home up to 13,000 ft of living space. Currently moving forward with just under 4,000 sq ft, 4 bedroom and  3 1/2 bath planned remodel,SELLER WILL LOOK @ ALL OFFERS.","Dishwasher, Freezer, Disposal, Gas Oven, Ice Maker, Refrigerator","True","166 - Rolling Hills","None","False","7567009005","Pickleball, Hiking Trails, Horse Trails","0","","False","3","1","","","2","3","","Rolling Hills","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Direct Ph","Agent Pager Ph","Agent Fax","Agent Voice Mail","Agent Email","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","293","4100000","#ERR","10/16/2023 3:32:25 PM","","","08/04/2024 12:00:00 AM","08/23/2024 3:07:52 PM","","","10/16/2023 12:00:00 AM","08/04/2024 12:00:00 AM","06/25/2024 8:17:13 AM","08/23/2024 12:00:00 AM","08/23/2024 12:00:00 AM","","","293","","False","Area","","","","","","Cash","Living Room, Gas, Great Room","True","Wood","True","Central, Solar","True","Granite Counters","True","True","none","None","False","","","","33.750591","Gas & Electric Dryer Hookup","True","False","","","4350000","","","4350000","#ERR","","","pacificlandcorp@gmail.com","","Chris","","","Fitzpatrick","","SFITZCHR","","","","","S5580","","Pacific Land Corporation","310-200-2780","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.343661","","1","112759.42","2-5 Units/Acre","Hiking , Horse Trails, Rural","","Assessor","","","SB23192930","","3","3","","1","Owner","","","","","","","","","55","","None","False","Close Of Escrow","1394.08","Nestled within the prestigious city of Rolling Hills, this rare single-level classic ranch home offers an unparalleled living experience. Perched atop one of the highest points in the area, the property boasts Spectacular Breathtaking Panoramic Ocean Views, stretching from Catalina Island to the Trump Club. Situated on a 2.5-acre lot, this home is a sanctuary of elegance and tranquility. The spacious living and family rooms, adorned with picturesque ocean views, seamlessly connect with the entire property. With 3 generous bedrooms, including a luxurious master suite with en-suite master bath, this residence offers comfort and style. The home features an updated chef-style gourmet kitchen equipped with high-end Thermador stainless steel appliances, a wine cooler, ice maker, granite counters, classic wood cabinets, and a convenient island adorned with Travertine tile. Natural light floods the interior, highlighting the elegant formal dining room and leading to a private backyard patio with a built-in BBQ bar, ideal for entertaining friends and family. This property is more than just a home; it?s a canvas of endless possibilities. With equestrian horse facilities and vast land, there's ample space for customization, whether you dream of a private vineyard, a tennis court, or additional guest accommodations. The home is designed for modern living with energy cost-efficient features, including newer solar panels and a 50-year life expectancy roof. Additionally, there?s a barn on the property, perfect for extra storage or a potential ADU (Accessory Dwelling Unit). Convenient Luxury Living:Conveniently located near popular beaches, top-rated schools, scenic hiking trails, and community tennis/pickle-ball courts, this residence offers easy access to the best of Southern California. With proximity to LAX and iconic landmarks like The Getty and Griffith Observatory, you can enjoy both the serenity of rural living and the vibrancy of the LA metro area. This residence, is a testament to luxurious living and timeless elegance. If you desire a home that offers breathtaking views, utmost privacy, and the freedom to create your own paradise, then this property is your perfect match. Schedule your private viewing today and step into the extraordinary world of fine living.","","All Bedrooms Down, Family Room, Formal Entry, Living Room","","