 Rolling Hills. Step back in time to a more tranquil and serene era as you enter this exquisite legacy property which has been a cherished family home, hosting memorable weddings and numerous charitable events.  The outdoor space is a true oasis, featuring a dramatic pool surrounded by beautiful mature trees and an expansive lawn. Whether you're seeking a refreshing swim or a peaceful moment under the shade of trees, this stunning estate offers it all. As you explore the grounds, you'll discover lovely ocean vistas and cozy sitting areas thoughtfully scattered throughout, leading you to enchanting secret gardens. Each turn opens up new vistas and breathtaking scenery.  Perched atop this enchanting landscape, you'll be captivated by the magnificent sweeping ocean and Catalina views, offering a captivating backdrop for moments of tranquility and awe. On clear days, you'll be rewarded with the distant sight of San Nicolas Island, which inspired the iconic novel ""Island of the Blue Dolphins."" The estate's expansive verandas beckons you to unwind with a glass of lemonade and your favorite book. Secluded and tucked away, this property ensures privacy and tranquility, situated just off of Crest Road and accessible via a private driveway.  Perfect for multi-generational living, this home features three separate master bedrooms or in-law suites, each boasting its own unique charm and private amenities. Furthermore, every room on the west side of the house presents a captivating view of the ocean and a sparkling night view of the Terrenea Resort located below.  The appeal of a traditional ranch home shines through with the roof overhang design, allowing you to extend the walls and create delightful outdoor entertaining spaces.  Sports enthusiasts will delight in the generously sized cement slab, perfect for a friendly game of pickleball. Embrace an active lifestyle without leaving the comfort of your home but if you must the City of Rolling Hills offers both tennis and pickleball courts for the community as well as miles of hiking trails and riding rings.  This classic ranch house offers an unparalleled living experience. A sanctuary of peace and privacy, this estate invites you to create your own cherished memories and bask in the beauty of nature's splendor. Discover your very own oasis of tranquility and coastal elegance in this extraordinary property.","","All Bedrooms Down, Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Kevin","Pluimer","PVPLUIKEV","v8542","2.5","%","Compass","4500000","False","Full Service","Text agent to show 310-528-7480.  24 hour notice please","","None","False","","4924","Taped","","CA","Closed","One","","S","Quail Ridge SOUTH","","2","Road","","Ranch","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","1","","Single Family Residence","","","Catalina, City Lights, Coastline, Ocean, Panoramic, Water","True","","","","1952","90274","5017","RHRAS1"
