"","1.1118","Email complete offers to Nicole@InmanTeam.com AND Gordon@InmanTeam.com with proof of funds and pre-approval letter. Square footage was estimated and provided by prior owners, Buyer to verify. 2 of the 4 bedrooms are being used as offices, but can be converted to bedrooms.","","","166 - Rolling Hills","Unknown","True","7567018007","Pickleball, Tennis Court(s), Horse Trails, Controlled Access","8790","","False","4","1","","","3","4","","Rolling Hills","#ERR","310-936-1979","","Gordon@InmanTeam.com","310-707-2170","Gordon","310-541-3737","","Inman","sinmagor","","","","519-1080","232","S4726","310-519-1882","Keller Williams Realty","310-519-1080","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","","","","","","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","6","4825000","#ERR","08/31/2025 9:29:21 PM","","","09/08/2025 12:00:00 AM","09/30/2025 3:57:48 PM","","","08/31/2025 12:00:00 AM","09/08/2025 12:00:00 AM","09/08/2025 1:52:12 PM","09/29/2025 12:00:00 AM","09/29/2025 12:00:00 AM","","","6","","False","","","","","","","Cash","Dining Room, Kitchen, Living Room","True","","True","Central","True","","True","True","None","None","False","","","","33.756197","Inside","True","False","","","4395000","","","4395000","#ERR","424-558-0476","","nicole@inmanteam.com","","Nicole","","","Pletkovich","","PVPLETNIC","","","","","v8460","","Keller Williams Realty","310-519-1080","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.34195","","17","48431","Horse Property, Horse Property Improved","Hiking , Horse Trails","","Assessor","","","PV25195283","","3","3","","1","Owner","","","","","","","","","34","","Private","True","","1269.74","Nestled on 1.1 acres in the exclusive gated city of Rolling Hills, this beautifully appointed estate offers the perfect blend of timeless elegance with thoughtful modern upgrades all while overlooking serene views that stretch across the city. With approximately 3,800 sq. ft. of living space, the home features 4 bedrooms (2 currently used as offices), 3.5 bathrooms, and an open floor plan that welcomes both grand entertaining and everyday living. At the heart of the home, the gourmet kitchen showcases top-of-the-line appliances including a La Cornue range, Wolf oven + Miele steam oven, Sub-Zero refrigerator with additional built-in refrigerator drawers?perfect for the most discerning chef. The oversized primary suite is a sanctuary, complete with dual walk-in closets and a spa-inspired ensuite bathroom. Highlights include 5 a/c zones throughout the home, a newer roof (approx. 2024), newer heater (approx. 2024) and more. Outdoors, the property unfolds like a private resort?complete with a sparkling pool and spa, outdoor kitchen with built in BBQ, and a spacious patio for entertaining al fresco. Adding to its charm, the grounds are dotted with fruit-bearing trees including avocado, apricot, lemon, orange, and tangerine. Equestrians will appreciate the 2-stall barn with tack rooms and direct access to the community?s scenic riding and hiking trails. Life in Rolling Hills is unlike anywhere else?residents enjoy the serenity of a rural atmosphere, miles of equestrian trails, and 24-hour guarded gates, all just minutes from the South Bay?s coastal amenities. This property embodies the very best of Rolling Hills living: elegance, privacy, and modern comfort in a setting of natural beauty.","","Living Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Suzanne","Dyer","VDYERSUZ","V8407","","","Strand Hill Properties","4825000","False","Full Service","*Text Nicole at 424-558-0476 to schedule a private showing* Do not use showing time.","","","","","3800","Estimated","","CA","Closed","One","","","Caballeros","","23","Road","","","Cash, Conventional","","0","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Mountain(s)","True","https://www.23caballerosroad.com/unbranded","","","1953","90274","5279","RHRAS1"
