s of beautifully crafted quartz countertops, tiled wall accents, and hardwood, as well as sweeping city views that twinkle at night from nearly every room. Every thought came to life in this home from the breakfast nook, formal dining room, dual living rooms each equipped with their own fire place, a bar, walk in pantry, butlers staging area, a laundry room with hookups for two washers and two dryers, whole home interior and exterior surround sound, and owned solar. It doesn't end there, the pool was just completed in 2022, and is furnished with swim jets, a seamless built in spa, and retractable pool cover. Detached form the main house are two additional living areas. The first, is a 714 sq ft guest quarters which includes a 3/4 bathroom, and a kitchen. Large sliding glass doors allow this suite to enjoy the captivating views of the city. Along side the guest home is a workshop where you can explore your crafty passions, and just beyond that is a 540 sq ft guest suite with a flex space, bedroom and 3/4 bathroom! While much of the land has been developed into beautiful, peaceful landscaped luxury, there is still ample space to let your imagination run wild. There is room for a tennis court, putting green and horse stable! If space, land and luxury are what you're looking for, then, welcome home.","","All Bedrooms Down, Bonus Room, Entry, Guest/Maid's Quarters, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Retreat, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry, Workshop","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Chris","Adlam","VADLACHR","V8107","2.5","%","Vista Sotheby's International Realty","4900000","False","Full Service","Please text LA with Name and office information, then go direct. Please turn off all lights and lock all doors.","","Private","True","True","4945","Appraiser","","CA","Closed","One","N","N","Palos Verdes","","2860","Drive","","Ranch","Conven