ant formal dining room, step down living room with another fireplace, and a grand piano terrace under multiple skylights. There are four generous sized ensuite bedrooms plus a sumptuous primary suite with fireplace, spa style bath with soaking tub, and huge walk-in-closet. Private entertainers backyard complete with outdoor sitting areas, fireplace, built-in BBQ, putting green, rose garden & orchard, bar area with 3 refrigerators, and an inviting pool with a beach shelf, and ample grassy play area plus a north/south tennis court. Expansive 3 car garage with lots of storage and a paver driveway. Community offerings include pickle ball courts, tennis courts, multiple horse arenas and miles of riding trails. Serviced by the award winning Palos Verdes School District and located within minutes from Rolling Hills Country Club, The Jack Kramer Club, Trump Golf Course and Terranea Resort.","Fire Retardant, Flat Tile","Dressing Area, Entry, Family Room, Formal Entry, Foyer, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Loft, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Tom","Royds","SROYDTOM","sb1293130","2.5","%","Redfin Corporation","5000000","False","Full Service","Easy to show but must call for an appointment and gate access.","False","","","True","5038","Appraiser","","CA","Closed","One","","","Hummingbird","","2","Lane","","Custom Built, Modern, Ranch","Conventional","","29529","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Connected, Sewer Not Available, Water Connected","Canyon, City Lights, Coastline, Landmark, Mountain(s), Pool","True","","","Double Pane Windows, Skylight(s)","1976","90274","",""
