ing vistas and unlimited potential. For the first time in an astounding 74 years, this coveted estate is ready to welcome a new chapter in its storied history. Perched high above the city, the property offers an awe-inspiring panorama that includes the dynamic skyline of downtown Los Angeles and the serene ocean views of the Redondo Beach Queens Necklace. Imagine waking up to the golden glow of sunrise over the city and winding down with the gentle hues of a Pacific sunset?each day a masterpiece of nature's canvas. At the heart of this estate is a charming 2-bedroom, 2-bathroom, 2,016 square foot home?a testament to its enduring legacy. Alternatively, for those with a vision of their dream home, this property provides a rare opportunity to create a custom masterpiece. Whether you choose to craft a new architectural marvel or reimagine the existing residence, the canvas is yours to shape. A spacious 6-car parking garage effortlessly accommodates vehicles, reflecting the lifestyle of comfort and convenience that defines this estate. Additionally, a two-story barn stable stands ready to accommodate equestrian pursuits or provide a canvas for creative possibilities. Positioned in the coveted enclave of Rolling Hills, this property offers privacy and tranquility while maintaining accessibility to the vibrant city and coastal destinations. Seize the moment to own a piece of history and craft a future filled with boundless promise. Embark on a journey of imagination, where the scenic views and abundant space set the stage for your aspirations. Whether you're drawn to the allure of the existing residence or inspired to create a visionary new abode, 2 Possum Ridge Rolling Hills is more than a property?it's a canvas for the life you've always dreamed of.","","Entry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Daniel","Assayag","sbassadan","sb1303660","2.5","%","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","5200000","False","Full Service","Shown by appointment only. Please email