me featuring 5 bedrooms, 6 bathrooms. The heart of the home can be found in the great room, including a stunning living room with fireplace with views from every window of the mountains and city, formal dining room and gourmet kitchen with Sub Zero and Wolf appliances plus a huge walk-in pantry. Enjoy movie night in the  cozy family room with wet bar and walk-in liquor pantry, this makes for a perfect space to entertain your guests. The incredibly spacious master bedroom includes a walk in closet, plus bathroom and a private outdoor deck to enjoy the morning sunrise. Highlights include stunning wood beam ceilings throughout, HEPA filtration system in the bedrooms, 5 a/c and heating zones, solar heating for the pool, a beautiful private temperature controlled wine cellar down a romantic spiral staircase, plus an oversized 3-car garage with storage. Take a step outside to the entertainers dream backyard with sparkling salt water pool and spa, outdoor kitchen with bbq, outdoor bathroom with shower, firepit, barn, plus a huge sprawling grass lawn all overlooking stunning views of the Los Angeles Basin and mountains.","","All Bedrooms Down, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry, Wine Cellar","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Heidi","Agid-Mackenbach","VAGIDHEI","V8107","2.5","%","Vista Sotheby's International Realty","5500000","False","Full Service","* Call Gordon @ 310-936-1979 to schedule a showing * Must have scheduled appointment.","","","","","5720","Taped","","CA","Closed","One","","","Eastfield","","52","Drive","","Ranch","Cash, Conventional","","0","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Mountain(s), Panoramic","True","https://www.seetheproperty.com/story/439503/u","","","1978","90274","5262","RHRAS1"
