, while walls of glass along the northern exposure flood the home with natural light and frame the dramatic vistas. The home has been thoughtfully updated with a newer roof, solar panels, Fleetwood doors and windows, and remodeled bathrooms. The gourmet kitchen includes stainless steel appliances, and comfort is ensured with air-conditioning, radiant heating, and an oversized three-car garage. Designed for both entertaining and everyday living, the layout features a formal living and dining room, a spacious family room, and an amazing covered porch that extends the living space outdoors. The luxurious primary suite boasts a fireplace, spa-like bathroom, and an impressive walk-in closet. Just outside, a secluded spa offers a peaceful escape. Set on an incredible lot, the property includes a large, flat area?perfect for a future barn or your finishing touches. A rare opportunity to enjoy privacy, views, and top-tier amenities in one of Rolling Hills? most desirable locations.","Flat Tile","All Bedrooms Down, Entry, Family Room, Laundry, Library, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Two Primaries","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","SHU","LIU","ws81321","21823","","","eXp Realty of California Inc","5500000","False","Full Service","Please TEXT Valerie for an appointment.  310.704.5164 It's easy to show, but we need to call you in to the gate.","False","Private","True","","4583","Taped","","CA","Closed","One","","","Roadrunner","","16","Road","","Custom Built","Cash to New Loan","","6705","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Hills, Neighborhood","True","","","","1963","90274","5139","RHRAS1"
"","2.631","Showing requests via email only (NO CALLS/TEXTS): Jeff@JeffYarbrough.com. Register buyer's name(s) and provide POF (cash) in first email. Please review www.2PineTree.com for features list, virtual tour, floor plan (also under pics) PRIOR to booking an appointment. Buyer to verify all listing-generated data. Broker does not guarantee the accuracy of the information provided, including square footage, lot sizes, acreage, HOA info, permitted or unpermitted spaces, and/or bedroom/bathroom count. Buyer/buyer's representatives are advised to independently verify accuracy of this information through personal inspection, building permits and/or with appropriate professionals (i.e. attorney, appraiser, contractor, etc.).","","True","166 - Rolling Hills","","False","7569012018","Tennis Court(s), Horse Trails, Security, Controlled Access","14500","","False","8","2","0","0","6","7","","Rolling Hills","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Preferred","Agent Email","Co-Agent Cell Ph","Preferred","Co-Agent Email","","","Los Angeles","370","5500000","#ERR","01/10/2025 11:51:44 AM","","07/14/2025 8:16:40 AM","12/02/2025 12:00:00 AM","01/21/2026 12:42:25 PM","","","01/10/2025 12:00:00 AM","12/02/2025 12:00:00 AM","01/21/2026 12:27:10 PM","01/21/2026 12:00:00 AM","01/21/2026 12:00:00 AM","","North","370","","","","","","","","","Cash","Family Room, Living Room","True","","","","","","True","True","No Key Safe","None","","","","","33.765788","Individual Room","True","False","","","6499500","","","6999500","#ERR","323-854-4300","","jeff@jeffyarbrough.com","","Jeff","","","Yarbrough","","CLW-X54350","","","","","CLW-X74054","310-432-6401","Keller Williams Beverly Hills","310-432-6400","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.349706","","","114608","","","","Assessor","","","24474549","","4","9","","","Vacant","","","","","Circular Driveway","True","","","1","","Heated, Infinity, Waterfall","","Close Of Escrow","470.65","Fixer alert! Within the gates of Rolling Hills is an unfinished two-story ranch-style residence on 2.63 acres of west-facing land. The structure is mid-remodel and will span 11,686 sq.ft. according to current plans, with 7BR/8BA. Public record reflects 7,585 sq.ft. and 5BR/5BA. More than a million dollars in high-end finishes, fixtures, cabinetry, and appliances are already on-site, boxed, labeled, and ready. Most plans are completed, HOA approvals were secured, and the current vision includes a home theater, gym, expansive primary suite with spa bath and boutique closet, infinity lap pool, spa, pickleball court, croquet lawn, and meandering garden path sset against unobstructed views of the Pacific Ocean, the Queen's Necklace, and the downtown Los Angeles skyline. Developers can complete the project, or pivot toward a new plan entirely. Owner-users seeking to build to suit can bring their own aesthetic and ambition. A circular motor court offers scale and presence, while equestrian zoning adds uncommon flexibility. The Rolling Hills community, with its rural atmosphere and enduring appeal, promises seclusion, security, and long-term value. Located in the top-rated Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified School District and minutes from beaches, freeways, and luxury amenities, this is a rare opportunity to create something exceptional in one of Southern California's most storied enclaves.","","Basement, Entry, Family Room, Home Theatre, Living Room, Office, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","CLW-C134465","Caroline","Wu","CLW-C134468","CLW-X82773","","","AK Luxury Properties Inc","5500000","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions: Appts. via email only (NO CALLS/TEXTS): Jeff@JeffYarbrough.com. Register buyer(s) name and/or BRBC in first email. Showing Information: Registration Required ","","Heated, In Ground","True","","11686","Plans","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Pine Tree","","2","Lane","","Ranch","","","","","Single Family Resi