graded one-level ranch residence, epitomizing luxury living. Situated ideally off Crest Road on a serene cul-de-sac, this tranquil abode offers a sanctuary away from the hustle and bustle, showcasing panoramic views that capture the essence of Rolling Hills living.  The outdoor oasis boasts a beautiful pool and spa, complemented by a spacious pool deck, perfect for entertaining amidst the backdrop of breathtaking vistas. A private tennis court, versatile enough to double as a pickleball court, adds to the allure of outdoor recreation. Inside, vaulted ceilings and walls of glass frame the expansive grounds, infusing the home with an abundance of natural light and a sense of openness.  The interior features generously sized living and formal dining rooms, along with a large family room conveniently located off the kitchen. The well-appointed kitchen boasts a wet bar and breakfast nook, offering a perfect setting for casual dining. The primary suite is a haven of luxury, featuring picturesque views, a cozy fireplace, a walk-in closet, and an impressive en suite bathroom. Additionally, the residence includes five bedrooms and an office/study adjacent to the primary suite, providing ample space for relaxation and productivity.  Throughout the years, the current homeowner has meticulously upgraded the property, ensuring both functionality and aesthetic appeal. During their ownership they resurfaced pool, installed newer septic system, and renovated the kitchen and master bedroom suite, every detail reflects a commitment to excellence. Ongoing maintenance and upgrades, included driveway resurfacing, exterior painting, landscaping, and system upgrades, further enhance the allure of this exceptional estate. With its unmatched blend of elegance, tranquility, and modern convenience, this residence epitomizes luxurious Rolling Hills living.","","All Bedrooms Down, Family Room, Formal Entry, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Office, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Suzanne","Dyer","vdyersuz","V8407","2.5","%","Strand Hill Properties","6800000","False","Full Service","Text agent with 24 hours notice to show.","False","Private","True","True","5695","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","N","Quail Ridge","","2","Road","","Ranch","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","27006","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Coastline, Ocean, Panoramic","True","https://unbranded.youriguide.com/2_quail_ridge_rd_n_rolling_hills_ca/","","","1985","90274","5016","RHRAS2*"
"","2.0113","Call or text Keith at 310-944-5554 with any and all questions. HOA dues are base on $.20 per $100 of assessed value. Buyer to verify all information in MLS.","","","166 - Rolling Hills","Unknown","True","7569026016","Tennis Court(s), Paddle Tennis, Hiking Trails, Horse Trails, Guard, Security, Controlled Access","15377","","False","6","2","","1","3","6","","Rolling Hills","#ERR","310-920-8812","","billdavishomes@me.com","","Bill","","","Davis","vdavibil","","","","","","V8496","310-565-2491","Palm Realty Boutique","310-545-2490","","","","","","","","Agent Text Message","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","","","","Central Air, Zoned","True","Los Angeles","383","7250000","#ERR","09/08/2023 11:22:38 AM","","","12/11/2023 12:00:00 AM","03/01/2024 8:46:40 AM","","","09/08/2023 12:00:00 AM","12/11/2023 12:00:00 AM","11/27/2023 8:52:19 AM","02/29/2024 12:00:00 AM","02/29/2024 12:00:00 AM","","","94","","False","Breakfast Nook, Dining Room","","","","","","Cash","Family Room, Living Room","True","Carpet, Wood","True","Forced Air, Solar, Zoned","True","","True","True","NA","None","False","","","","33.765568","Individual Room, Inside","True","False","","","7688800","","","7688800","#ERR","310-707-2124","","keith@palosverdesrealty.com","310-707-2170","Keith","","","Kelley","","VKELLKEI","","","","","V8496","310-565-2491","Palm Realty Boutique","310-545-2490","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.355769","","5","87612","0-1 Unit/Acre, Horse Property Unimproved, Landscaped, Lot Over 40000 Sqft, Sprinkler System","Hiking , Horse Trails","","Assessor","","","PV23168370","","8","8","","1","Owner","","","","","","","","","41","","Private, Heated, In Ground, Solar Heat","True","","1076.95","THE SELLER HAS COMPLETED UPGRADES INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO NEW WOOD FLOORS, NEW CARPET IN BEDROOMS, NEW APPLIANCES IN THE KITCHEN, NEW CABINET HARDWARE, NEW WATER HEATER AND MORE!! This classic Ranch home sits inside the most desired gated city in Palos Verdes, Rolling Hills. The home has been with the same family since it was designed and constructed in 1981. This lot was carefully selected because it offers unobstructed, panoramic city, pastoral and Queen?s Necklace views. With 6,732 sq ft of living space the home has every amenity you could ask for including a great room with a large open kitchen with new counter tops, new appliances and more. The family room opens to the backyard with a fireplace, redwood beamed open ceilings, bar and views making it a great place to entertain. Also great for entertaining is the oversize living room with open ceilings, dining room, new wood floors and spectacular views flowing to the backyard. As one of the 5 bedrooms, the master suite offers a large bedroom with open ceilings, walk in closet and large bathroom area. Other features include 5 additional bedrooms (one being used as an office but has a closet), 5 additional bathrooms, sauna, a game room, and a bonus room that can be a workshop, gym or anything you desire.  As you step onto the back deck you instantly take in the panoramic views that the patio and pool area enjoy. There is a pool and spa that run off solar heaters during the summer and have a gas heater to assist in the winter. The lower pad can be used for a barn, ADU, guest house, play area etc. Throughout the property you will find fruit trees, a rose garden, a vegetable garden and space to add other amenities. For the car enthusiasts, let's not forget the 8 car garage with extra tall doors and ceiling for potential car lifts etc. A bonus is the home runs completely on solar and the owner is not paying anything for electricity. This property was built with an amazing floorplan and and the future in mind given the high ceilings, wide hallways and large rooms.","","Bonus Room, Dressing Area, Exercise Room, Family Room, Formal Entry, Foyer, Game Room, Great Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Sauna, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Ve