"","7.5256","45 Saddleback Road's lot square footage is approximately 7.5 acres. There are two separate parcels of land, each of the parcels having their own APN#. The list price includes both parcels of land. Please see listing supplements for property details, sellers? names and additional information required to be included when writing an offer. One of the listing agents is related to the Sellers. Submit complete offers to lizsnyderhomefinder@gmail.com AND kat@katdelpit.com  HOA dues are calculated as $.20 per $100 of assessed value. Buyer to verify all information. This property is on a conventional Septic tank. Owners passed away peacefully on the property in 2020 & 2021 each at the age of 90. Please call or text with any questions.","Barbecue, Built-In Range, Dishwasher, Disposal, Ice Maker, Refrigerator, Trash Compactor, Warming Drawer, Water Heater","True","166 - Rolling Hills","None","False","7569004025","Pickleball, Tennis Court(s), Horse Trails, Guard, Security","0","","False","7","","","","7","4","","Rolling Hills","#ERR","310-480-9958","","kat@katdelpit.com","","Katherine","","","Delpit","CLW-C134551","","","","","","CLW-X76752","310-519-1882","Keller Williams LA Harbor","310-519-1080","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Text Message","Co-Agent Text Message","Agent Cell Ph","Co-Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","152","8750000","#ERR","03/27/2023 8:58:16 PM","","","08/26/2023 12:00:00 AM","11/22/2023 3:45:13 PM","","","03/17/2023 12:00:00 AM","08/26/2023 12:00:00 AM","03/28/2023 2:13:12 PM","11/22/2023 12:00:00 AM","11/22/2023 12:00:00 AM","","","152","Double Door Entry","False","Breakfast Counter / Bar, Family Kitchen, Dining Room, In Kitchen","Barbecue Private, Koi Pond","","","","","Cash","Family Room, Living Room, Primary Retreat","True","Carpet, Laminate, Wood","True","Central, Fireplace(s), Solar","True","Bar, Cathedral Ceiling(s), Granite Counters, Open Floorplan, Pantry, Recessed Lighting, Storage, Tile Counters, Track Lighting, Wet Bar","True","True","none","None","False","","","","33.77144","Dryer Included, Individual Room, Inside, Washer Included","True","False","","Death On Property < 3 yrs, Homeowners Association","10000000","","","10000000","#ERR","310-707-2135","","lizsnyder@kw.com","310-519-1882","Elizabeth","","","Snyder","","SSNYDELI","","","","","S4726","310-519-1882","Keller Williams Realty","310-519-1080","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.344081","","2","327813","6-10 Units/Acre","Horse Trails","24 Hour Security, Gated with Attendant, Automatic Gate","Assessor","","","SB23044649","","4","4","","1","Owner","","","","","Direct Garage Access, Driveway, Concrete, Paved, Driveway Down Slope From Street, Garage Door Opener","True","","","75","","Private, In Ground, Solar Heat, Waterfall","True","Close Plus 2 Days","1057.91","Welcome to the epitome of luxury living in the prestigious Rolling Hills gated community. This one-of-a-kind estate boasts panoramic 360-degree views of the city, with stunning peek-a-boo ocean and Queen's necklace views. Set on 7.5 acres of land, this single-story masterpiece offers the ultimate in privacy and exclusivity. With 4 bedrooms and 7 bathrooms, this home offers a perfect balance of luxury and functionality. Step inside to soaring vaulted ceilings and an abundance of natural light that floods the interior. Every room in the house offers breathtaking views, making it impossible not to fall in love with the surroundings. The estate has been thoughtfully designed and meticulously maintained throughout the years, offering a perfect blend of modern convenience and classic elegance. The wood-paneled executive office, large bonus game room and indoor spa are just a few examples of the many luxurious features that make this property one of a kind. The estate's three kitchens are perfect for entertaining guests and the lush landscaping creates a serene and inviting atmosphere. Take a dip in the resort-like pool that waterfalls into a large wading pool, or enjoy the award-winning rose garden that spans the entire front of the property. If you'd rather doing something sporty, you can challenge your guests to a game of tennis on the private court or take a stroll through the orchard. The property also features a picturesque koi pond filled with a plethora of mature fish. The gated driveway leads to a four-car garage that ensures absolute privacy and security. Built in 1984, this single-owner property has been lovingly maintained and is in pristine condition. Located in close proximity to the freeway, shopping, and grocery stores, this estate is ideally situated for those who value convenience and luxury. HOA dues are calculated as $.20 per $100 of assessed value. Don't miss your chance to own this stunning property and experience the ultimate in luxury living. Schedule your private tour today and witness the breathtaking beauty of this one-of-a-kind estate for yourself!","","Guest/Maid's Quarters, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Loft, Office, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Dapplegray","Peninsula","Miraleste","","Catherine","Cleveland","SBCLEVCAT","S5543","2.5","%","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","8750000","False","Full Service","Please text both Liz Snyder at 310-339-5301 & Kat Delpit 310-480-9958 with your name, company name, DRE#, desired date and time to show. Listing agents must be present for all showings. Thank you for showing!","False","Private, See Remarks","True","","8271","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Saddleback","","45","Road","","Custom Built, Mid Century Modern, Traditional","Trust Deed","","29543","","Single Family Residence","","","Canyon, City Lights, Coastline, Mountain(s), Neighborhood, Panoramic, Trees/Woods","True","https://vimeo.com/812886106","","","1984","90274","5140","RHRAS1"
