irable neighborhoods on the Peninsula.  Just a short walk from award winning schools, , local parks, shopping and dining- and with quick freeway access-this property offers both serenity and accessibility in one package.  Step inside and discover a warm, inviting floor plan filled with natural light.  The formal living room provides a perfect space for entertaining while the separate family room-complete with cozy fireplace and adjacent dining area offers a comfortable setting for everyday living. The kitchen with its charming layout and plentiful cabinetry, opens easily to both the dining area and the inside laundry room, which comes equipped with appliances for added convenience. The spacious Primary Suite is a true retreat featuring private bathroom, spacious closet and direct access to the expansive backyard- ideal for morning coffee, weekend barbecues or just relaxing wih friends and family.  Three additional bedrooms provide flexibility for family, guests or a home office setup.  Outdoors, you will find a large, private yard and 2-car detached garage with ample storage and parking space and easy access to the house.  Many rooms have been freshly painted and carpets professionally cleaned.  This is an incredible value and a rare opporunity to own a home in RPV for under $1,500,000!","Spanish Tile, Tile","All Bedrooms Down, Entry, Family Room, Formal Entry, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Utility Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Brett","Maginn","PVMAGIBRE","PV8594","","","eXp Realty of California Inc.","1411000","False","Full Service","CALL PHYLLIS FOR APPOINTMENTS TO SEE  310-413-5150 OPEN THIS WEEKEND 1-4 PM","True","None","False","","1947","Public Records","","CA","Closed","One","","","Via Canada","","6716","","","Ranch","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","27220","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Available, Natural Gas Available, Phon