Wake up to a panoramic city and harbor view that promises to be more punctual than your morning coffee. With three bedrooms and two baths, there?s ample space for quiet nights in, or lively parties where fondue makes its grand comeback. Outside, the sparkling swimming pool awaits your best cannonball or a serene float under the stars, pondering the comeback of shag carpets. The poolside is perfect for impressing guests with more than just your retro hors d'oeuvres. Located on a legendary street in Rancho Palos Verdes, Colt Road sits across from the award-winning Miraleste Intermediate School and meanders from Palos Verdes Drive East down through Colt Canyon, offering a retreat from the bustling city lights below. This home is tucked away on a 'spur' of Colt Road proper, which is like a private driveway shared with only a few homes, ensuring secluded privacy.  They truly don?t make them like this anymore. This legacy home has witnessed history, and now, it?s ready to welcome you. Ideal for those who appreciate a view?and a sprinkle of humor about their decor?2570 Colt Road is more than just an address; it's a conversation starter. Ready to make a statement? Make it here, where the lights are bright and the nights are quiet. Value-priced to start your new chapter today.","","Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Alyshia","Beck","PVBECKALY","V8107","","","Vista Sotheby's International Realty","1450000","False","Full Service","Vacant. Supra. Go direct. Courtesy text Agent at 310-780-9071. See Private Remarks.","True","","","","1736","Public Records","","CA","Closed","One","","","Colt","","2570","Road","","","1031 Exchange, Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional, Fannie Mae","","0000","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Harbor, Mountain(s), Vincent Thomas Bridge","True","https://ranchophotos.com/mls/2570-colt-rd/","","","1962","90275","6504","RPRS20000&E*"
