, making this a smart investment for the future. Don?t miss this chance to own a piece of history with panoramic ocean views and the potential to create your dream home. Schedule a visit today to experience the charm and possibilities this property has to offer. Embrace the opportunity to make this special house your forever home and enjoy the stunning coastal lifestyle it offers.","Spanish Tile","All Bedrooms Up, Bonus Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Mira Catalina","Palos Verdes Peninsula","Miraleste","","Peter","Warren","PVWARRPET","V7826","","","RE/MAX Estate Properties","1552809","False","Full Service","UPDATE: OFFERS DUE TUESDAY, 9/17 at 5:00pm. There will be a lock box on the side of the home. Please call or text with business card for code. Trina Gagliano 310.403.8058","True","None","False","","2427","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Miraleste","","4215","Drive","","","Cash to New Loan","","7145","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Available, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Bridge(s), Catalina, City Lights, Neighborhood, Ocean, Park/Greenbelt","True","https://vimeo.com/1009745000?share=copy","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=BToxDNPJYyJ","Shutters","1969","90275","6528","RPRS13000*"
