t blend of elegance and modern living. This beautifully renovated mid-century single level home spans 1,840 square feet and sits on a generous 7,924 square foot lot, promising ample space and comfort. As you enter, you are greeted by the warmth of white oak hardwood floors that flow seamlessly throughout the home and soaring high-beamed ceilings. The open-concept living area boasts breathtaking ocean views, and is grounded by a dual-sided modern fireplace, while the formal dining room is perfect for hosting memorable dinner parties. The gourmet kitchen is a chef's delight, featuring sleek stainless steel appliances, a convenient breakfast bar, and ample cabinetry. The primary suite is a serene retreat with a private patio, spacious closet, and a luxurious en-suite bathroom, complete with a soaking tub. Two additional well-appointed bedrooms and a second full bathroom offer versatility and comfort. Wide sliding glass doors fully open into the expansive and private backyard, surrounded by flowering bougainvillea and featuring a sunken outdoor gas fire pit, ideal for outdoor relaxation and gatherings. Enjoy the convenience of a detached two-car garage, providing extra storage and parking. Additional amenities include air conditioning and an in-unit washer and dryer. Situated on a quiet cul-de-sac with easy freeway access and distinguished schools, this home combines tranquility with convenience, making it a true gem in a coveted neighborhood. Experience the extraordinary lifestyle that awaits at this exceptional property.","Tile","All Bedrooms Down, Kitchen, Living Room, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Akash","Rohera","sbroheaka","SB1381930","","","Rohera Capital","1580000","False","Full Service","Pls call or text Mina at 310-971-5483 for appt. Easy to show. Just need a couple of hrs notice. Supra will be on front door after brokers open on Oct 29. Thank you for wearing booties and turning off lights after showing.","True