delights. Inside, the upper level unfolds with a sense of refined comfort. The spacious primary suite is a tranquil retreat featuring dual closets, a well-appointed ? bath with dual-sink vanity, and panoramic city light views. The adjoining living and formal dining areas offer an elevated setting for entertaining, with rich hardwood laminate flooring, a stately fireplace, and expansive windows showcasing sweeping vistas of the harbor, mountains, and twinkling skyline. The gourmet kitchen is both stylish and functional, featuring natural wood cabinetry, tile countertops, and a sunlit breakfast nook. Plantation shutters, dual-pane vinyl windows, and central heating and air conditioning elevate both form and function. The lower level continues the home?s luxurious feel, anchored by an expansive family room with a second fireplace and direct access to a beautifully landscaped backyard featuring a spacious patio and manicured lawn. Three generously sized bedrooms, a full bath with spa tub, an additional ? bath, and a dedicated laundry closet complete this level?complemented by plush new textured carpeting and a freshly painted interior. A walk-in basement offers exceptional bonus space, including a utility room housing the newer central HVAC system and 50-gallon water heater, along with a separate room ideal for a wine cellar or storage room The oversized three-car garage provides seamless interior access, while a broad, paver-stone driveway adds to the estate-like presentation and offers ample parking. Located within the highly acclaimed Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified School District and just a short walk from the Miraleste Early Learning Academy and Miraleste Intermediate School. Just a little further away is Miraleste Plaza where you'll find a pizzeria, convenience store, auto repair shop and hair salon among others. This rare offering combines breathtaking views, exceptional functionality, and timeless design?making it an ideal haven for discerning families or multigenerational living. Don?t let this one pass you by. HURRY!!","Spanish Tile","Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, See Remarks, Wine Cellar","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Zach","Deaso","PVDEASZAC","PV8629","","","Real Brokerage Technologies, I","1625000","False","Full Service","Submit request through the Showingtime link in the listing. CBS code will be in the confirmation. Please be sure to turn off lights and lock all doors. Thanks for showing and good luck!","True","Bath","True","True","2496","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Via Canada","","6609","","","Mediterranean","Cash, Cash to New Loan, FHA, Submit, VA Loan","","27220","","Single Family Residence","","","Bridge(s), City Lights, Harbor, Ocean, See Remarks, Trees/Woods","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=C2mw2UZ7XoQ&brand=0","","Double Pane Windows, Plantation Shutters","1968","90275","6556","RPRS20000*"
