liding door that opens to the inviting outdoor oasis, complete w/ a refreshing pool and ample space for alfresco dining.    There is also a laundry room and powder room on the first level.  Upstairs, retreat to the primary suite with walk-in closet, fireplace and balcony to enjoy the views. The primary bath features dual sinks and custom tiled shower. All 3 other bedrooms are nice sized with nicely appointed full hall bath with dual sink stations and separate tub and toilet area.  An oversized 2 car garage with tons of storage space.  Located in the distinguished Palos Verdes Peninsula school district with the elementary and middle schools right around the corner.","Spanish Tile","Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Walner","Hernandez","DWHERWAL","DWHMV","","","Home View Realty","1650000","False","Full Service","Owner passed away peacefully at the age of 97.  Seller's choice of services.  Please text me a photo of your business card and the time that you are showing. (2310) 345-3245  Please make sure that the sliding glass door is locked.  Thank you for showing. **** Property fell out of escrow that is why there is a huge price reduction.   The inspection reports will be provided with the Seller's counter offer to the potential buyer.","","None","False","","2600","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Grandpoint","","30061","Lane","","","Cash to New Loan","","24281","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Harbor, Mountain(s), Neighborhood, Ocean","True","","","","1967","90275","6425","RPRS20000*"
