d, In Ground, See Remarks","True","Close Of Escrow","720.55","Your new memories start here! Perfectly set on a spacious lot, this home has so much to offer! Start with the beautiful rural location on Rockinghorse Road, and enter a unique, special and well-loved home with soaring ceilings and an open floorplan designed to showcase the spectacular harbor view!  This home was designed with comfortable living in mind, with a generous living room with a cozy fireplace flowing into a phenomenal custom kitchen that has withstood the test of time. With floor to ceiling natural oak cabinets, you can see that ?everything old is new again!? These cabinets are right on trend and this kitchen can easily be transformed to a modern masterpiece. Equipped with 2 dishwashers, a center island, Sub Zero refrigerator and a Viking range, everything you need for a true gourmet experience is here! The cabinets wrap all the way around the dining area and have glass-front cabinets to showcase your collectibles. Skylights add to the ambiance of the space and allow the natural light to filter through. Adjacent to the kitchen is a multipurpose space currently showcased as an office but can easily be an extension of the kitchen. A sun-filled family room is also nearby with walls of windows, and direct access to the backyard. There are 3 generous bedrooms, all with vaulted ceilings, and each is like its own wing with an adjacent bathroom; the primary is en-suite and has a walk-in closet with custom built-ins. At the rear of the home is a special bonus?a solarium with a built-in exercise pool, and space for your home gym! There are 4 remote controlled skylights for natural light and airflow, and a stall shower to rinse off after your swim! Parking and storage will never be a problem here with a direct access 4-CAR GARAGE-2 cars wide and 2 cars deep, and high ceilings allow for storage galore! All of this is situated on a lot of nearly 26,000 sq. ft., much of which is flat and usable. The rest is accessible via stairs and can be terraced for gardening and planting or letting the kids be kids and pets roam free! Head up to the deck for an expansive and stunning view of the LA Harbor and beyond?on a clear day you will see downtown LA, mountains, and so much more! This home offers nearly 2400 sq. ft. of living space and has been freshly painted throughout. There?s dual-paned windows, central heat and air, 16 skylights, recessed lighting and other updates. All you need to do is bring your personal touch and taste to make this the home of your dreams!","","All Bedrooms Down, Exercise Room, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Dapplegray","Peninsula","Miraleste","","Joe","Nasr","CLW-C123345","CLW-X7710801","","","Compass","1725000","False","Full Service","SUPRA WILL BE PLACED ON WATER PIPE LEFT OF GARAGE DOOR BY 10:00 AM ON FRIDAY, 5/2.  SHOWINGS TO BEGIN FRIDAY, MAY 2nd.  OPEN HOUSE SUNDAY, MAY 4th FROM 1-4PM.","True","","","True","2394","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Rockinghorse","","94","Road","","Ranch","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","18220","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected","Bridge(s), City Lights, Coastline, Harbor, Vincent Thomas Bridge","True","https://youtu.be/63bTQddXdAU","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=mv5rB5Sk7CA","Double Pane Windows","1954","90275","6564","RPRS20000&E-OH"
