ws, and a recently refreshed kitchen. A private entrance leads to a versatile downstairs room, with a half bath, ideal as an office or 4th bedroom. The kitchen showcases new quartz countertops, freshly painted cabinets, recessed lighting, and new stainless steel sink. Abundant natural light illuminates the interior, accentuating the recently refinished hardwood floors, two fireplaces, and inviting vaulted ceilings in the living room with a balcony presenting sweeping ocean views. Outside, the expansive backyard and private entrance to Colinita Trail offer boundless outdoor enjoyment. Complete with a 2 car attached garage, this home is the ultimate coastal luxury on a tranquil cul-de-sac.","Spanish Tile","Bonus Room, Den, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Joe","Alessi","VALESJOE","V7946","2.5","%","RE/MAX Estate Properties","1750000","False","Full Service","Offer deadline 4pm Sunday 5/5/2024.  Easy to show. Please contact Cristina at 714-273-1085 for showing instructions then go direct.","True","","","","2288","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Beauvais","","4612","Road","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","9302","","Single Family Residence","","","Coastline, Mountain(s), Ocean","True","","","","1955","90275","6447","RPRS13000*"
