rty offers easy freeway access and is conveniently located just 25-30 minutes from both Long Beach and Los Angeles Airports. The home is thoughtfully designed with high-quality finishes, including numerous French doors that maximize the stunning views, elegant crown moldings, distressed hardwood floors, and plush carpeting in the bedrooms. The grand marble-inlaid entry leads seamlessly into the formal living room, dining room, and family room, boasting open-beamed ceilings and a wet bar. The gourmet kitchen is both stylish and functional, featuring granite countertops, a large peninsula with bar seating, and a sun-drenched breakfast nook where you can enjoy views from every angle. A beautiful bleached pine frame surrounds the brick fireplace in the living room, adding warmth and charm. This home offers TWO primary suites, each with panoramic views?one on each level?along with two additional view bedrooms, with access to private deck overlooking the terraced canyon. All four bathrooms have been tastefully remodeled, showcasing granite and tumbled marble accents. The expansive 19,543 sq ft lot is a gardener?s dream, with lush landscaping, an array of fruit trees, and vibrant vegetation. A spacious, flat grassy area off the kitchen and family room provides the perfect spot for family gatherings, all while soaking in the spectacular canyon, harbor, ocean, mountain, and city light views. Located within the renowned Palos Verdes Peninsula School District and just minutes from fine dining, shopping, hiking trails, Terranea Resort, and world-class golf courses, this peaceful, private retreat is a true gem. Meticulously maintained and move-in ready, this home exudes serenity and luxury. See Floorplan in Supplements.","","Family Room, Formal Entry, Foyer, Great Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Two Primaries, Walk-In Closet, Workshop","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Sharon","McHale","smchashe",