u step inside, you'll be greeted by hardwood floors and the warmth of two fireplaces. The master bedroom boasts stunning views of the ocean and harbor, and you can indulge in the beauty from your own private balcony, offering panoramic views of the ocean, harbor, mountains, and downtown Los Angeles. Step outside to the backyard oasis, complete with a pool and spa, providing the perfect space for relaxation and entertainment. Within minutes of the property, you can experience a world-class dining experience at Terranea Resort or take a leisurely stroll through the nearby nature preserve. Located in the prime Palos Verdes area, this magnificent private property allows you to embrace the best of California coastal living. Enjoy the benefits of living with easy access to freeways, shopping centers, theaters, golf courses, beaches, and the renowned Palos Verdes Unified School District.","Spanish Tile","Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Karen","Lopez","SBLOPEKAR","SB1348310","2.5","%","Remy Owl Corp","1795000","False","Full Service","Go direct or contact agent for virtual tour.","True","Private, Heated","True","","2296","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Miraleste","","4108","Drive","","Spanish","Cash to New Loan","","8471","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Connected, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","City Lights, Coastline, Harbor, Marina, Mountain(s), Neighborhood, Ocean, Panoramic","True","","","","1954","90275","6527","RPRS13000*"
