ng single-level home, where nearly every room showcases sweeping panoramic views of the harbor, ocean, coastline, and majestic mountains. Wake up to mesmerizing sunrises and unwind with golden sunsets, all from the comfort of your beautifully updated retreat. This 4-bedroom, 2.5-bathroom, approx. 2,300 sq ft residence is designed to embrace its spectacular surroundings with all new dual-paned vinyl tempered glass windows and doors that frame the scenery like artwork. The primary bedroom is a serene escape, featuring a striking wood plank ceiling and awe-inspiring views that stretch endlessly before you. The ensuite has been tastefully upgraded with dual lavs, decorator finishes and tile keeping in the character of the home. The elegant dining room, wrapped in knotty pine wood planks, provides the perfect ambiance to enjoy meals with a backdrop of natural splendor. Rich wood oak flooring flows throughout the home, complementing the PV stone wall accents, smooth ceilings, fresh paint, air conditioning, custom sun-sensitive draperies and modern updates. Both bathrooms have been meticulously renovated, offering stylish enhancements including new vanities, decorator finishes, heated towel racks, and ceiling heaters. The spacious kitchen includes all new appliances and a butler's serving pantry. Step outside to enjoy the recently replastered pool and decking, redesigned with a raised deep end to enhance relaxation and fun. The newly fenced backyard and raised block walls create a private oasis where you can soak in the fresh ocean breeze and stunning surroundings. The expanded double-car garage provides ample space for storage and convenience. A new sewer line was installed, along with a fully automated sprinkler system to enhance the landscaping. Perfectly positioned close to shopping, entertainment, medical offices, beaches, and freeway access, this exceptional home offers a lifestyle defined by elegance and panoramic beauty. Don?t miss the chance to experience these fa