wood setting the tone for this mid-century experience. Family room and casual dining areas are positioned to take in all the views and vaulted open beamed ceiling creates a great volume of space. The formal dining area with rich wood built-ins enjoys a cozy fireplace. The kitchen is equipped to handle any family gathering with stainless steel appliances and rich wood cabinetry. The master suite is spacious and affords lay down views of the ocean and harbor. A walk-in shower and double sinks finish off the master wing. A front viewing area is surrounded by lush landscaping and plenty of sitting area ensuring friends and family will enjoy the space. A newly refinished pool is surrounded by brick pavers and a secluded spa. Additional features: Two zoned heat and AC, over-sized garage, direct connection to the city sewer system, underground utilities, no power poles, and all appliances are included. Conveniently located close to the 110 Freeway, retail, and the award winning PVPUSD school district. There are too many attributes to put in writing. The open floor concept and spectacular vistas will provide lifelong memories.","","Entry, Family Room, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Mira Catalina","Palos Verdes","Miraleste","","Jared","Yutronich","VYUTRJAR","V7044","","","Estate Properties","1940000","False","Full Service","lock box to be installed after open house.","","Private, Heated","True","","2849","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Knoll View","","29897","Drive","","Mid Century Modern","Contract","","27142","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Harbor, Hills, Marina, Mountain(s), Neighborhood, Ocean, Panoramic, Vincent Thomas Bridge","True","","","","1966","90275","6437","RPRS20000*"
