or plan. The chef ready kitchen is complimented with granite counters with additional seating. The stainless-steel appliances include a built-in refrigerator, Oven , Microwave, Dishwasher and stove top with designer hood. The dining room opens to a wall of glass exposing the ultimate harbor and ocean views. The master suite is also positioned to take in the spectacular views while lying in bed. It?s complimented by a remodeled bathroom and walk-in closet. The rear 2000 sq ft patio is perfectly situated to take in the amazing views and perfect for any large gathering of family and friends. Professionally landscaped hillsides with numerous fruit trees including lemon, apricot, orange and avocado. ADDITIONAL upgrades include: upgraded electrical wiring, Anderson windows and doors, air conditioning, attic storage, and can lighting. The educational system is considered one of the best in Country? you will enjoy access to Mira Catalina Elementary and your middle school children can attend Miraleste intermediate? Palos Verdes and Peninsula high schools are open to all students living on the hill. Minutes from this palatial domain, you can enjoy a game of golf or dine at Terranea Resort. Or take a stroll through one of the many hiking trails, either way you are surrounded by the best of California coastal living.","Tile","Entry, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Mira Catalina","Peninsula","Miraleste","","Margery","Chirchick","CLW-X16852","CLW-X7173802","2.5","%","Rodeo Realty","1995000","False","Full Service","FIRST SHOWINGS WILL BE SUNDAY 5/19/24 FROM 1-4","","","","True","2211","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Crownview","","3360","Drive","","Mediterranean","Contract","","25376","","Single Family Residence","","","Bridge(s), Canyon, Catalina, City Lights, Coastline, Harbor, Hills, Landmark, Marina, Neighborhood, Ocean, Panoramic, Trees/Woods, Vincent Thomas Bridge, Water","True",