"","0.343","NO blind offers will be entertained. All offer to accompany verification funds, Down payment and closing costs. Copy of their most recent FICO scores, credit report, and pre qualification or pre approval letter from buyers lender or loan broker.  Buyer to cooperate with sellers 1031/721 tax deferred exchange at no cost or liability to buyer. 2962 Sq.Ft was taped for the floorplan and is an estimate.  Seller nor the listing agent verifies the square footage.  Tax data states 4 bedrooms, one of 3 rooms downstairs does not have closet. Buyer to verify square footage, condition and all information to satisfy themselves.  Property is part of Palos Verdes Estates Homeowners Association/Art Jury. Seller were unaware of this fact when they purchased.  Seller will not provide completion or compliance, inspection was performed by Jim DeRosa of HRS. Conformity Study report will be provided Incas part of seller disclosures.  This list would have to be corrected if new owner were to remodel.  The list of non compliant items is approximately $1,800.00 x 3(for fines), =$5,400.00. Buyer to verify the non compliant items.  Copper Dolphin statue and stereo excluded from sale.  Pool table in downstair opposite 3/4 bath was there when clients purchased. It was dark paneled walls. Sellers had it removed and had contractor plaster the walls for pool room. Refer to seller disclosures.  Fountain on side patio above and below patio are included in the sale.","Built-In Range, Dishwasher, Disposal, Gas Cooktop, Microwave","True","167 - PV Dr East","Unknown","True","7561008003","","0","","False","4","1","","1","2","4","4810","Rancho Palos Verdes","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Angela","Conterno","SBCONTANG","S4706","Henry Falkenstein & Assoc","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Direct Ph","Agent Pager Ph","Agent Fax","Agent Voice Mail","Agent Email","None","False","Los Angeles","33","2000000","#ERR","07/11/2024 6:01:12 PM","","","08/13/2024 12:00:00 AM","11/