triking PV Stone faced fireplace. The living & dining area, adorned w/wall-to-wall glass windows, offers panoramic views & access to a Trex deck/balcony that spans the view side of the entire top level. The gourmet kitchen is equipped w/granite countertops, newer Viking appliances, built-in dishwasher, 7 ample cupboard space. Off the entryway is a guest bathroom & direct access to an oversized 3-car garage /2 doors. Also on this level is one of 2 primary suites w/stunning views, a walk-in closet, an en-suite bathroom w/a private atrium off the bathtub & shower. The lower level features Mohawk Glamorous Style carpeting in Sugar Cookie coloring. The lower level offers another primary suite with a en-suite full bathroom & walk-in closet w/custom shelving. There are 3 additional bedrooms, all have fabulous views, another spacious downstairs living room complete w/a wet bar & sliding glass doors leading to a private, expansive concrete & Trex deck patio. This level also  has a separate laundry room &/a bonus room perfect for a games, crafts office. Also there is a 3/4 hallway bathroom.  The spacious rear yard features an outdoor oasisi with tranquil waterfall & ample space for gardening enthusiasts to create their own vegetable garden. Centrally located near top-rated schools,and just minutes from grocery stores, banks, gas stations, restaurants, & hiking trails. It also offers easy access to the 110 freeway, just 10 minutes away. Other amenities: Newer Water heater, Halo salt-free water Softener System for the entire house, new remodeled bathroom downstairs taken down to the studs, including new-tiled shower. Upgrades to the upstairs primary bathroom w/new vanity. Newly installed flooring, painting, Viking appliances & dishwasher.  Don't miss this opportunity.  Call for your private showing today.","Spanish Tile","Bonus Room, Entry, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, See Remarks, Separate Family Room, Two Primar