 time in 55 years, this property is offered, featuring 4 bedrooms, 2.5 baths, and 3217 (BTV) square feet of living space on an expansive 19,000+ square foot flat and usable lot. Upon stepping through the welcoming front door, your attention is immediately captured by the spacious living room adorned with large, picturesque windows and an inviting brick fireplace. The generously sized dining room offers a cozy window bench, providing a perfect spot for relaxation and taking in the mesmerizing city lights. The updated kitchen showcases ample cabinet space, a sizable walk-in pantry, and a charming breakfast nook with views of the backyard. The heart of this home lies in this oversized den, a true entertainment haven surrounded by sliding doors. This inviting space features a cozy fireplace, a wet bar, and is ideal for hosting movie nights or pool parties, seamlessly connecting indoor and outdoor living. The bedroom wing of the home houses three spacious bedrooms, two of which offer captivating views, and share a full bathroom. The extra-large primary en-suite boasts two walk-in closets, a spacious bathroom with a jetted tub, a separate walk-in shower, and private access to the sparkling pool. The spacious backyard and pool provide an ideal canvas for unlimited potential, ready for a new owner to elevate this residence to new heights and create lasting memories. Consider the possibility of adding an Accessory Dwelling Unit (ADU) to further enhance the property's versatility. Conveniently located with easy access to freeways, shopping, and beautiful hiking trails, this property embodies the essence of Southern California living, offering a unique opportunity for those seeking a home with both character and potential. Additionally, the residence falls within the highly regarded PVPUSD school district, providing excellent educational opportunities for families. You don?t wanna miss this one!","","Den, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Flo