,"1","193","Vacant","","","","","Direct Garage Access, Driveway, Garage - Single Door","True","Patio, Patio Open, Rear Porch","True","44","","Private","True","Close Of Escrow","709.1","Commanding sweeping views from a generous 19,000-sq ft lot in the prestigious Miraleste Hills neighborhood, this stunning 4-bed, 3.5-bath Rancho Palos Verdes home is a must-see! Flourishing hedges border the expanded elegant paver driveway leading to this hidden gem. Past the artisan double-door entry, explore a freshly painted approx. 2,900-sq ft interior finished in rich tiles and new earth-tone plush carpeting. Nearly every window provides incredible ever-changing scenery, from the harbor and shimmering ocean to the serene mountains and twinkling city lights below. A stately fireplace draws guests to its warmth under the living room?s exposed beamed ceiling, while a wet bar adds a festive mood to your gatherings. Beautiful built-ins and millwork add a timeless elegance to the formal dining room, where French doors allow you to take meals al fresco easily. A family corner with easy access to the back and side yards next to the charming kitchen is an excellent spot for TV watching, game, and movie nights. Breathtaking panorama views greet you in the comfortable 4 bedrooms, one of which is a convenient main-level suite. Surpassing them all, the upper-level primary bedroom showcases a sun-soaked sitting area, another fireplace, a walk-in closet, custom window-side seating for admiring the spectacular vistas near and far, and a refreshing 5-piece ensuite with a soaking tub. Crafted for fabulous outdoor entertaining, the oversized paver patio has plenty of space for guests to mingle around the inviting pool and spa. Imagine sipping drinks under the stars as you marvel at the fantastic surroundings. As a bonus, there?s lots of storage, an indoor laundry area with hookups, an attached drive-through 2-car garage, and convenient access off the hill for shopping, dining, entertainment, freeways, and visiting beaches. Come for a tour before the opportunity passes you by!","Flat, Spanish Tile","Dressing Area, Entry, Family Room, Formal Entry, Foyer, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Anthony","Todora","VTODOANT","V7044","2.5","%","RE/MAX Estate Properties","2050000","False","Full Service","Please text LA your contact information and date and time of showing. A confirmation Text will be sent with a CBS code.  Please do not use showing time for appointments.  Thank you for showing.","True","Private, In Ground","True","","2891","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Crownview Drive","","3268","","","Contemporary","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","25376","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected","Bridge(s), Canyon, City Lights, Coastline, Harbor, Mountain(s), Neighborhood, Ocean, Vincent Thomas Bridge, Water","True","https://tour.caimagemaker.com/l/?id=179593IDX","","Bay Window(s), Double Pane Windows","1975","90275","6416",""
