r, Vincent Thomas Bridge, downtown LA and mountains from nearly every room in the home.  This home features over 2,600 sq ft of living spaces and sits on an over 20,000 sq ft lot. The 3 bedrooms, 3 bath home has both a formal living room, family room, formal dining, breakfast nook area, and laundry room. A spacious Master suite enjoys vaulted ceiling and ocean view that opens to a sunny south exposure private patio with a view of the ocean and beautiful hill side. This home features a second master with ocean view and private updated bathroom. The kitchen has beautiful custom wood cabinets, Brazilian granite, Viking range with double oven and a breakfast bar. The ocean and city view family room boasts vaulted ceilings, fireplace, built-in entertainment unit, dry bar and informal eating area which opens to a back yard. The court yard boasts beautiful Spanish tile and fountain that is perfect for entertaining. Ample parking in the newly redone driveway with parking for 4 or more cars plus an oversized 2 car garage. Ultimate entertainers? backyard with built-in BBQ, artificial lawn and more amazing views from ocean to downtown LA. There is also an upper patio area that overlooks the home with a tranquil feel and more amazing views. Truly a must see!! * Second house from the street set behind private gate.","","Family Room, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Dapplegray","Palos Verdes Peninsula","Miraleste","","Fred","Lavi","VLAVIFRE","V7064","2.5","%","Lavi & Associates","2050000","False","Full Service","Contact listing agent Kristen (310)989-4436. Prefer 24-hour notice. Listing agent or owner must be present because 2 dog on property.","False","","","True","2632","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Crownview","","3158","Drive","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","25376","","Single Family Residence","","","Bridge(s), City Lights, Coastline, Harbor, Hills, Marina, Mountain(s), Neighborhood, Ocean, Panoramic, Vincent