rimary Bedroom has strong views and a recent Ensuite Bath 3/4 Walk-In Shower Remodel with ample Closet space.  Two other bedrooms each with Bay Windows share a Freshly Remodeled Full Hall Bath with separate Soaking Tub and Walk-In Shower.  There are two separate living spaces flanked by a common wall of Fireplaces.  The front Living Room looks out to the Massive View while the rear Family Room blends into an Open Kitchen concept while looking out towards the inviting backyard.  The Kitchen features a Thermador Island Cooktop, Built-In Kitchen Aide Fridge & Double Wall Oven with plenty of cabinet space.  The covered breezeway leads to the garage, which lends itself to adding square footage w/o having to manipulate the roof line.  There are several fruit trees on the property from Avocado to Limes. Cool off in the summer in the swimming pool or relax inside in an A/C environment.  Venture off to the beaches, trails, public golf courses, Terranea Resort, Miraleste Library or join private clubs Rolling Hills Country Club or the Jack Kramer Tennis Club nearby.  Award winning Palos Verdes Unified schools are always a big draw.  Room sizes provided in photos are approximate!","Tile","Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","H. Jasan","Sherman","CLW-X53361","CLW-B2003113","2.5","%","Berkshire Hathaway HomeServices California Properties","2100000","False","Full Service","First showings at Open House Sat 5/4, 11-2p. DO NOT USE SHOWING TIME.  Text Joe @ 310-738-3262 with desired date/time and to get  CBS Code.","True","None","False","True","2275","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Mustang","","15","Road","","Ranch","Cash, Conventional","","19115","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Harbor, Mountain(s), Ocean","True","https://youtu.be/v3dzksY7shI","","Bay Window(s)","1958","90275","5250","RPRS20000&E*"
