s Verdes, this grand 3,500 sqft. abode offers panoramic views of Los Angeles, the Canyon and the South Bay, including breathtaking beach and ocean views (Queens Necklace). This home boasts a generous floor plan featuring three distinct living/family areas, each with soaring vaulted ceilings. The foremost living space merges a dining zone with a streamlined galley kitchen, presenting peaceful vistas of the canyon, city, and sea. The central living area welcomes you upon entry with its cozy fireplace and overhead skylight. The rear living/dining area is a haven of relaxation, with its fireplace and ceiling-to-floor windows and doors that blur the lines between the indoors and the lush outdoors. Gaze upon the serene pool and manicured gardens to unwind from daily life. The residence hosts three well-appointed bedrooms and two bathrooms on the lower level. Two of these bedrooms are designed with vaulted ceilings and expansive windows with sliding doors, framing the tranquil pool and garden views. The capacious master bedroom is a retreat in itself, featuring lofty ceilings, an extensive walk-in closet, an en suite bathroom, and access to a secluded courtyard through sliding doors?offering an idyllic spot for morning coffee or leisurely reading, accompanied by the fresh breeze and scenic canyon views. Ascend to the upper level, where an additional room awaits, potentially serving as a second master suite complete with a full bathroom, walk-in closet, and a balcony that commands awe-inspiring views of the canyon, cityscape, and ocean. A charming nook accessed by a ladder makes for an enchanting children?s hideaway. Ideally situated for serenity and convenience, this property is a stone?s throw from freeways, premier shopping destinations, and picturesque hiking trails, encapsulating the quintessential Southern California lifestyle. It?s also nestled within the boundaries of the esteemed PVPUSD school district, ensuring top-tier education for residents. This home is a rare find, blending distinctive charm with boundless possibilities?truly a gem not to be overlooked.","See Remarks","Family Room, Foyer, Galley Kitchen, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, See Remarks, Separate Family Room, Two Primaries","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Gina","Salazar","PWSALGIN","PB21568","2.25","%","The Home Realty Company","2200000","False","Full Service","Showings to start Saturday June 22nd at Open House 2pm-4pm Showings can be scheduled after the open house 6/22.  Email: LoveHelpingYou@gmail.com for showings. I can make sure alarm is off and give you CBS code. Questions: Email LoveHelpingYou@gmail.com","True","","","","3500","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Martingale","","5","Drive","","","1031 Exchange, Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional, FHA","","22909","","Single Family Residence","","","Canyon, City Lights, Ocean, Panoramic, See Remarks, Trees/Woods","True","https://youtu.be/yxrxOEbxlXw","https://youtu.be/3zQXi_g9VB4","","1960","90275","5248","RPRS20000&E*"
