hools, freeways, shopping centers, pristine beaches, and picturesque parks. The meticulously designed main level boasts three bedrooms, two and a half baths, a cozy living room with a fireplace, an elegant formal dining room, a convenient laundry room, and a remodeled eat-in chef's kitchen. The kitchen showcases new granite counters, cabinetry, and stainless steel appliances, while a sprawling balcony extends across the entire length of the house, providing a perfect spot to savor the views.Downstairs, the lower level offers a game room adorned with a pool table and a well-appointed bar area. A family room with direct access to the backyard creates an inviting space for relaxation. Additionally, a second remodeled gourmet kitchen graces this level, featuring a granite island, stainless steel appliances, new tile flooring, and another cozy fireplace. Completing the lower level are two additional bedrooms and two baths, ensuring ample space for family and guests.Embracing modern comforts, the house is equipped with air conditioning, an outdoor spa, a fire pit, automatic night-time lighting, and remote access capabilities. The electronic front driveway gate ensures privacy and security, while state-of-the-art German-made solar panels offer the potential for eliminating electric bills. Furthermore, a solar hot water system enhances energy efficiency.Step outside and bask in the tranquility of the meditation garden, where you can relish the sunrise over the majestic mountains and marvel at the mesmerizing sunset hues. The soothing sounds of a water fountain create a peaceful ambiance. For outdoor enthusiasts, the property boasts trails in its backyard, inviting you to embark on leisurely strolls and connect with nature.Don't miss the opportunity to own this remarkable property, where luxury, comfort, and natural beauty converge harmoniously. Experience the epitome of California living in this magnificent home.","","Family Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","