"","0.92","Multiple-offers received. -Roof replaced about 15 years ago and was guaranteed for 50 years -higher ceiling height possible; remove drop down lights. You may convert part of the home to an additional dwelling unit or build a detached ADU!  if ADU is a studio max size 850 SQFT, if ADU is a one bedroom no larger than 1,000 SQFT. Per City planner Jose 2023. Buyer to do due diligence.  Electrical system is original needs to be updated.  Water line to barn and from water meter to house replaced about 20 years ago with copper pipe. no permit taken out for that. Water lines in house replaced about 6 years ago with pex ( separate 4th bedroom plumbing lines installed about 15 years ago with copper). No permit taken out for waterline replacement. Untextured wall blemishes are where lines where water lines were replaced and no texturing or painting was done afterwards.   There are 4 original sewage seepage pits in the front yard.  2 septic tanks located on property; one outside the kitchen sink window, the other outside the tiled bedroom.","","","167 - PV Dr East","Unknown","True","7566022004","","0","","False","4","","","","4","4","","Rancho Palos Verdes","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Home Ph","Agent Email","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","15","2300000","#ERR","01/19/2024 9:08:04 AM","","","02/03/2024 12:00:00 AM","03/22/2024 5:38:37 PM","","","01/19/2024 12:00:00 AM","02/03/2024 12:00:00 AM","03/22/2024 5:38:37 PM","03/22/2024 12:00:00 AM","03/22/2024 12:00:00 AM","","","15","","False","","Corral, Stable","","","","","Conventional","Masonry","True","","True","","","","True","True","Supra lock box on front door  key with blue tape is the front door and barn key   Please only unlock and lock deadbolt at front door and simply turn the left hand side door knob to open door.","Supra","False","","","","33.757787","Inside","True","False","","","2250000","","","2250000","#ERR","619-322-4039","","chr