"","0.4713","TAKE ANOTHER LOOK.. ***NEW INTERIOR PAINT** NEW FRESH CARPET***NEW STAGING***The motor for the front gate is inoperable and the seller will not repair it. The 5 light fixtures on the front of the house are decorative and non-functioning. Miraleste Hills has a voluntary Community Association with annual dues of $150.00 The photos of the fireplace with flames is for marketing purposes only and it does not imply they are operable. The square footage of the house varies from various sources: The buyer to confirm. County tax assessor at 4776; appraisal report at 4123, building plans per seller at 4447. Buyer to verify square footage (lot and structure) and all MLS information. Broker and Agent do not guarantee the accuracy of square footage, bedroom and bathroom count, lot size, ordinances, zoning, rent control, permits, use code, schools, and/or other information concerning the conditions or features of the property provided by the seller, obtained from public records or all other sources.","6 Burner Stove, Dishwasher, Double Oven, Electric Oven, Freezer, Gas Cooktop, Gas Water Heater, Indoor Grill, Ice Maker, Instant Hot Water, Microwave, Refrigerator, Water Heater","True","167 - PV Dr East","Unknown","True","7566011019","","0","","False","5","1","","","4","4","","Rancho Palos Verdes","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Text Message","","","","","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","249","2340000","#ERR","04/12/2024 7:02:48 PM","","","07/07/2024 12:00:00 AM","08/16/2024 11:49:48 AM","","","04/11/2024 12:00:00 AM","07/07/2024 12:00:00 AM","04/30/2024 9:45:59 PM","08/16/2024 12:00:00 AM","08/16/2024 12:00:00 AM","","","85","Double Door Entry","True","Breakfast Nook, Dining Room, In Kitchen","","Stucco","","","","Cash to Loan","Family Room, Living Room","True","Carpet, Wood","True","Central, Forced Air","True","Balcony, Granite Counters, Tile Counters","True","True","Front Door","Supra","False","","","","33.748071","Dryer Included, Individual Room, Inside, Washer Hookup, Washer Included","True","True","","Easements","2595000","","","2595000","#ERR","310-427-3369","","atodora1@yahoo.com","310-349-3128","Anthony","","","Todora","","VTODOANT","","","","","V7044","310-831-1684","RE/MAX Estate Properties","310-831-0222","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.328901","","32","20528","0-1 Unit/Acre, Back Yard, Landscaped","Gutters","","Assessor","","","PV24073485","","3","3","","1","Owner","","","","","Direct Garage Access, Driveway, Concrete, Garage, Garage - Three Door","True","Patio, Patio Open, Porch, Front Porch, Rear Porch","True","48","","Private, In Ground","True","Close Plus, Negotiable","567.55","View, View, View - If a breathtaking view  and a spacious move-in-ready home are what you desire, your search ends here. Proudly situated on an expansive 20,000 sqft lot in the scenic Miraleste Hills neighborhood, this immaculate Rancho Palos Verdes residence boasts a freshly painted interior and new flooring you'll be delighted to call your own. Approach via a paved driveway lined with flourishing foliage, leading to this extraordinary home offering 4 bedrooms, 4.5 baths, and an array of indoor and outdoor entertainment spaces. Step through the double-door entryway into a striking two-story foyer adorned with rich tiles and a sweeping staircase, exuding grandeur at every corner. Throughout the approximate 4,123 sqft floor plan, intricate crown molding adds an air of refinement. Floor-to-ceiling glass sliders frame awe-inspiring coastal , city and mountain views from every angle, from the inviting living room warmed by a magnificent fireplace to the formal dining area illuminated by an elegant chandelier. The updated eat-in kitchen is a chef's haven, featuring a 48"" 6-burner range with a griddle and double ovens, a built-in refrigerator-freezer, cabinetry with trim lighting, chic backsplash, a generous walk-in pantry, and sleek granite countertops extending to the pendant-lit island. Enjoy your morning coffee while taking in the stunning cityscape from the breakfast nook, or unwind with a good book by the stone fireplace in the family room while appreciating captivating ocean, city, and mountain views. Revel in the vast, ever-changing vistas from any of the four generously proportioned upper-level private bedrooms, two of which boast en suites and are positioned in opposite wings for enhanced privacy. The primary suite features an oversized boutique-like closet and a luxurious 5-piece ensuite with dual vanities, a separate shower, and a spa-like soaking tub. Additional amenities include a well-sized laundry room with ample storage and an attached 3-car drive-through garage. Your outdoor oasis awaits, offering unparalleled views and the epitome of Southern California living amidst a stunning backdrop. Entertain guests on the pergola-covered patio, surrounded by a meticulously maintained and well-lit garden. Host weekend BBQs in the backyard as guests relax by the sizeable 9-jet spa, perfect for a floating cocktail hour. With its prime location, enjoy easy access to shopping, dining, freeway access and the beach.","Spanish Tile","All Bedrooms Up, Attic, Center Hall, Entry, Family Room, Formal Entry, Foyer, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room, Two Primaries, Utility Room, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palo Verde Unified","","","","","DAVID","CHEN","W73115","7944","2.5","%","IRN REALTY","2340000","False","Full Service","Please call or text Anthony at 310.738.6775  with date and time of showing, a CBS code will be sent with confirmation. EASY TO SHOW. Please do not use showing time.","True","Private, Heated, In Ground","True","","4123","Appraiser","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Grandpoint Lane","","29711","","","Contemporary","Cash to New Loan","","7090","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Available, Natural Gas Connected","Bay, Bridge(s), City Lights, Coastline, Har