d Wood floors and 2.5"" thick custom Mahogany interior doors throughout.  A reimagined Chefs Kitchen with Thermador 6 Burner Double Oven and large Granite top Peninsula Island open to an entertaining space with a full balcony stretching the length of the sliding doors.  The main floor has three good sized Bedrooms, one with an Ensuite 3/4 Bath and private patio.  The lower level houses the Primary Suite, which includes a Private Patio, office space and large Walk-in Closet with Custom Cabinetry, plus a well appointed Ensuite Full Bath that includes a Walk-In Shower, Jacuzzi Tub, Dual Sinks and Relaxing Sauna.  Antique Clay tile flooring from France lines the remainder of the lower level where an additional bonus area awaits.  Join private Clubs close by in Rolling Hills Country Club or Jack Kramer Tennis Club. Venture West to the coast line for Beaches and Exquisite Terranea Resort.  Close Freeway access for ventures to Airports, Stadiums, DTLA, Shopping, Mountains or Desert.  Coveted PVP School District.","Spanish Tile","Laundry, Living Room, Primary Suite, Sauna, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Mira Catalina","Palos Verdes Peninsula","Miraleste","","Marvin","Phillip","PPHILMAR","PB21589","2.5","%","Y Realty","2499000","False","Full Service","Text Joe 310-738-3262 with any questions and showing requests.","True","None","False","True","3576","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","E","Palos Verdes","","29258","Drive","","Mediterranean, Spanish","Cash, Conventional","","unknown","","Single Family Residence","","","Bridge(s), City Lights, Mountain(s)","True","https://youtu.be/QO25v27Br8g","","","1975","90275","6463","RPRS20000&E*"
