oof Top, See Remarks","True","61","","Private, Gas Heat, In Ground","True","","1083.33","Welcome to 2636 Sunnyside Ridge Road, a serene single-level retreat nestled on a quiet cul-de-sac in Rancho Palos Verdes. Privately set behind a long driveway, this fully remodeled home showcases breathtaking harbor, ocean, mountain, and city views from nearly every room?stretching from downtown Los Angeles to Dana Point. Set on nearly half an acre, the property delivers true indoor?outdoor living with a large flat backyard and expansive spaces for dining and entertaining.  A sparkling pool, firepit lounge, mature rose garden, fruit trees, and a complete outdoor kitchen with built-in BBQ create a resort-like setting designed to maximize the home?s exceptional views.  Inside, the layout includes four bedrooms, three fully remodeled bathrooms plus an office. Double 16-foot sliding glass doors frame stunning sunrises and evening harbor lights, while panoramic views carry through the primary suite, kitchen, dining, family, and living rooms. Vaulted and open-beamed ceilings, along with two brick fireplaces, add warmth and architectural charm. The home has been extensively redesigned with high-end finishes throughout. The gourmet kitchen features new cabinetry, Taj Mahal quartzite counters, Viking appliances, a large island, and a butler?s pantry with laundry area. Additional upgrades include all new windows and doors, solid oak hardwood floors, custom millwork, full interior and exterior repainting, an oversized two-car garage (can easily be three cars), solar power, a new HVAC system, and upgraded electrical panel, wiring and lighting. Conveniently located near top-rated Palos Verdes Peninsula schools, freeway access, Terranea Resort, golf, hiking trails, shopping, and dining. Meticulously renovated and move-in ready, this home captures the best of Southern California living.","Concrete, Flat Tile","All Bedrooms Down, Center Hall, Family Room, Formal Entry, Kitchen, Living Room, Mai