er 40000 Sqft, Flag Lot, Irregular Lot, Near Public Transit, Sprinkler System, Sprinklers In Front, Sprinklers In Rear, Sprinklers On Side, Sprinklers Timer, Up Slope from Street, Yard","Horse Trails, Stable(s), Rural","Automatic Gate, Carbon Monoxide Detector(s), Smoke Detector(s)","Assessor","","","PV25117012","","2","2","2","1","Owner","","","","Storage","Built-In Storage, Controlled Entrance, Direct Garage Access, Driveway, Asphalt, Paved, Driveway Up Slope From Street, Garage, Garage Faces Front, Garage - Single Door, Garage Door Opener, Gated, Oversized, Private, RV Potential, Shared Driveway, Workshop in Garage","True","Concrete, Front Porch, See Remarks","True","1","","Private, Diving Board, Filtered, Gunite, Heated, Gas Heat, In Ground, Permits","True","Close Plus 2 Days","1251.2","Nestled in the beautiful rolling hills of Rancho Palos Verdes is a masterpiece Mid-Century Modern estate, waiting to envelop you in its timeless beauty. Designed and built in 1961, by the renowned firm of Remington & Young, this exquisite home is set on more than one acre of fully landscaped and gated property, with dozens of mature trees and shrubs, and many producing fruit trees, including grapefruit, orange, lemon, lime, tangerine, apple, avocado, and more! All upgrades and remodels have meticulously maintained the integrity of the original mid-century design. The living room and family room share the original double-sided fireplace. The living room and dining area have softly lit ledges, exposed beams, and barrel ceilings, still keeping with the mid-century modern style of design. The family room is open to the bright and airy kitchen, and it also looks out into the stunning backyard, with a sparkling pool and extensive acid-etched concrete decking and grassy areas, as well as a residential bocce ball court. There also is a relaxing fire pit and many other seating and gathering spaces. Two bedrooms share a large bathroom with an open shower and jetted tub, while the primary suite, has its own bath that boasts a spectacular shower. Notably, the property is zoned for equestrian use and is situated within an area boasting miles of riding trails and stables. Rancho Palos Verdes also is well known for its award-winning schools, relaxed atmosphere, mild climate, and convenient access to shopping, beaches and major freeways, making it one of the most sought-after locations on the Palos Verdes Peninsula.","","All Bedrooms Down, Atrium, Bonus Room, Center Hall, Exercise Room, Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Suite, Office, Separate Family Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Nancy","Mavar","vmavanan","8481","","","West Shores Realty, Inc.","2600000","False","Full Service","By appointment only. Please call Nancy Mavar 310-938-2360.   Easy to show, just call. 2 hours notice okay.   Submit Offers with supporting documentation. Prequal letter, proof of funds and FICOs.","True","None","False","True","2078","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Palos Verdes Drive East","","27649","","","Custom Built, Mid Century Modern","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","n/a","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Available, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Available, Sewer Not Available, Water Connected","City Lights, Coastline, Harbor, Hills, Ocean, Panoramic, Pool, Trees/Woods, Vincent Thomas Bridge, Water","True","","","Double Pane Windows, Screens","1961","90275","5146","RPRS20000&E*"
