twinkling city & LA port lights by night, and ever-changing scenes of ships arriving in port.Designed for both luxurious living and effortless convenience, the home features a sleek PVE pneumatic elevator connecting all three levels. The main floor showcases a refined formal living room, an elegant dining area, and a chef-inspired kitchen equipped with premium stainless steel appliances including a professional French door oven, gas cooktop, refrigerator, wine fridge, and under-counter drawer refrigerator. A cozy breakfast nook and tranquil master suite are perfectly positioned to capture the view.??The lower level offers a spacious family room that opens to expansive wraparound balconies, where an extended terrace and jacuzzi create the perfect setting for entertaining or unwinding in style. Every bedroom is a private retreat with its own beautiful en-suite and generous closet, offering comfort, privacy, and stunning views. Additional highlights include a well-appointed laundry room with a deep sink, ample cabinetry, and a convenient laundry chute from the upper floor. Follow the charming red brick pathway to a lower-level flat pad, surrounded by mature fruit trees, ideal for gardening, a children?s play area, yoga studio, or private outdoor lounge. Sustainability meets sophistication with newer installed solar panels, a TESLA Powerwall, smart thermostat, Navien tankless water heater, and a top-tier York HVAC system with a newer AC unit?ensuring year-round comfort with modern efficiency. Securely tucked behind a gated driveway and lush landscaping, this property promises peace, privacy, and prestige.? Welcome home where every sunrise is inspiring and every sunset is unforgettable.","","Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Joe","Buck","sbbuckjoe","SB1379380","","","Compass","2730000","False","Full Service","DO NOT USE ShowingTime.  Text to Rod @ 213-663-8888 for all showing inquiry.  24 hour notice required.","