 of living space and is located on a 26,000 sq. ft. lot with gated lit sports court, pool, spa, huge garden area and massive outdoor veranda/deck perfectly positioned to take in the breathtaking views. Situated high on a cul-de-sac, you enter from a circular gated driveway to this open floorplan perfect for entertaining. The open floor plan will engulf you with a wall of glass exposing the postcard perfect views. Enjoy the amenities in the large family room with beautiful built-in cabinetry, a spectacular bar, and billiard area that leads to a dining area large enough for all your family and guests. There is also a separate formal dining room, living room, and additional salon for your enjoyment. Al fresco dining is available on a Tuscan stone balcony with food from the gourmet kitchen with Venetian glazed cabinets and top of the line appliances. A grand powder room includes three sinks and a large sitting area. The primary suite is complete with two separate bathrooms and walk-in custom closets. The bottom floor is an incredible party venue or its own living area leading outdoors to a sprawling terrace, backyard, pool, jacuzzi, and lit sports court highlighted by a banquet kitchen and dining area, living room, den (perfect for an in-home theater), bedroom, one and one quarter baths, laundry room, and two large storage rooms. The estate also features a large garden area with direct street access which could be the ultimate private ADU.  Award-winning schools and the coastal beauty that surrounds this house should put this home at the top of every buyer?s list.","Spanish Tile","Bonus Room, Den, Family Room, Formal Entry, Great Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Utility Room, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Jerry","Yutronich","VYUTRJER","V7044","","","Estate Properties","2825000","False","Full Service","Showing by appointment only.  Please contact Evon (310-503-9142), Jerry (310-4