Vacant","","","","","Direct Garage Access, Driveway, Paved, Driveway Down Slope From Street, Garage, On Site, Oversized, Private, See Remarks","True","","","1","","Private, Indoor","True","","1051.56","Life here is measured in sunrises over the ocean, afternoons by the pool, and evenings that unfold against the twinkle of harbor lights. Set on over half an acre in Rancho Palos Verdes, this single-level home was designed for the rhythm of coastal living, where walls of glass invite the outdoors in and every space flows effortlessly to the next. At its heart, the home?s defining feature is its panoramic views, framing the harbor and ocean from nearly every common space, including the kitchen, dining, family, and living rooms. An open-concept design seamlessly connects these spaces, while a separate sitting room with a wet bar with wine cooler expands the entertaining flow. With comprehensive upgrades, this residence blends timeless architecture with modern convenience: a new roof, windows, sliding doors, garage and front doors, plus a full exterior and interior repaint elevate the home?s curb appeal and style. Inside, engineered hardwood floors, new baseboards and casings, custom lighting with new panel, outlets, and switches provide a refined foundation. Comfort is ensured with a new HVAC system, ducting, and tankless water heater. The chef?s kitchen showcases new cabinetry, a custom refrigerator with cabinet paneling, countertops, backsplash, sink, faucet, and even an ?appliance garage?, while the bathrooms, laundry, and bar have each been updated with designer finishes. Five bedrooms, including a serene primary suite with sweeping views and walk-in closet, offer private retreats of comfort and calm. The primary bath and additional bathrooms have been reimagined with custom tilework, vanities, glass shower enclosures, and designer fixtures. A second view-filled bedroom and thoughtfully arranged spaces provide versatility for family, guests, or a dedicated office. Outdoor enhancements include a newly tiled patio, refreshed landscaping, pool repair, and a modern concrete driveway, all underscoring the property?s move-in ready appeal, making the outdoors a natural extension of daily life and gatherings. Each day unfolds in layers of light, views, and design. Every moment elevated.","","Bonus Room, Entry, Family Room, Foyer, Great Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Recreation, Separate Family Room, Utility Room, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes / LAUSD ? inquire","","","","","Dorothea","Liebich","SBLIEBDOR","S4331","","","Century 21 Union Realty","3100000","False","Full Service","Schedule showings via ShowingTime. CBS code required to access the supra, so must have confirmed appointment.","","","","","2948","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Daladier","","2232","Drive","","","Cash to New Loan","","21143","","Single Family Residence","","","Bridge(s), City Lights, Coastline, Harbor, Marina, Mountain(s), Neighborhood, Ocean, Panoramic, Pool, See Remarks, Vincent Thomas Bridge, Water","True","","","","1958","90275","6340","RPRS20000*"
