Level Home with Panoramic Views, Modern Upgrades, and Lush Gardens. Discover a truly exceptional living experience at 3139 Dianora Drive, Rancho Palos Verdes. This single-level mid-century modern residence offers a perfect blend of breathtaking views, modern amenities, and a location within an award-winning school district. Revel in awe-inspiring vistas encompassing the sparkling ocean, city lights, and majestic mountains. Every moment is a postcard-worthy experience. This home has been thoughtfully updated with all-new appliances and a new electrical panel, smooth ceilings, fresh paint, recessed lighting and wide plank flooring, making it move-in ready. Smart Home Technology: Effortlessly manage your environment with central heating and air conditioning, all conveniently controlled by Google Nest, ensuring comfort and energy efficiency. Award-Winning School District: Families will delight in the exceptional educational opportunities offered by the renowned local school district. Plus, Mira Catalina Elementary School is just a 5-minute stroll away, simplifying school mornings. This thoughtfully designed home offers the convenience of single-level living, perfect for families, retirees, or those seeking ease of access. Gather around the two-sided fireplace for warmth and ambiance on cooler evenings. Step out to a massive, level yard that's perfect for outdoor activities and relaxation. Mature avocado, orange, and grapefruit trees enhance the landscape, providing delicious fruit right at your doorstep. Enjoy easy access to the 110 freeway, making commutes a breeze. Explore the nearby world-renowned Terranea Resort for fine dining and relaxation or challenge yourself on the links at the prestigious Trump National Golf Course. The location truly offers the best of Southern California living. This remarkable property blends modern comforts, captivating surroundings, and lush gardens into one exceptional package. Don't miss the opportunity to call 3139 Dianora Drive your 