odeled bathroom and walk-in closet.  At the end of the hall, the fourth bedroom is currently being used as a bonus ""Family Room?, as it is oversized and opens to the backyard.  Move-in ready is an understatement... a newly renovated garage, fresh paint inside and out, air conditioning and a state-of-the-art security system with seven cameras and comprehensive window and door sensors are just a few of the amenities.  Located in the desirable Mira Catalina area, residents enjoy close proximity to elementary and middle schools, as well as UCLA?s South Bay campus and convenient freeway access.","","All Bedrooms Down, Great Room, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Cari","Corbalis","sclaycar","S5267","","","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","1875000","False","Full Service","Please contact Charlotte for showings.  310.947.4339","","","","","2341","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Casilina","","30866","Drive","","","Cash to New Loan","","26140","","Single Family Residence","","","Peek-A-Boo","True","","","","1961","90275","6206","RPRS13000*"
