 , Foothills, Golf, Hiking , Horse Trails, Park, Mountainous, Preserve/Public Land","Carbon Monoxide Detector(s), Smoke Detector(s)","Assessor","","","PV24101423","","2","5","","1","Owner","","","","Shed(s)","Direct Garage Access, Driveway, Garage","True","Patio, Front Porch","True","45","","None","False","Close Of Escrow","643.35","You will love coming home to stunning ocean and sunrise views from your new dream house in the prestigious community of Rancho Palos Verdes. Featuring an incredible indoor/outdoor living space, the home spans 3,031 sq ft on a generous 11,467 sq ft lot. This home?s well-designed layout is the perfect blend of elegance and comfort, including an expansive living room with a large stone fireplace, vaulted high ceilings with beautifully crafted woodwork and beams that create an airy, inviting atmosphere. An abundance of windows frame views of the landscaped yard, ocean and beautiful Catalina Island. A built-in bar adds an element of luxury and convenience, making it a perfect spot for entertaining guests. The kitchen includes a walk-in pantry and looks into the formal dining room, which is separated from the family room by a two-way brick fireplace, creating a cozy ambiance for both spaces. The family room and dining room are both enhanced by coffered ceilings, adding a touch of sophistication to your gatherings. All bedrooms contain mirrored closets and the master bedroom features two closets, including a spacious walk-in. One of the additional bedrooms has French doors that open to the backyard, providing a seamless connection to outdoor living. Enjoy the elegance of well-maintained wood floors and tile throughout the home, complemented by charming brick wall accents and built-in shelving, ceiling fans, an extra storage closet, and an attached two car garage with direct access to the home. The backyard is fully landscaped, featuring a garden, grass, pavers, a pergola, a built-in BBQ, as well as stunning views and sunsets, all within an abundant space for entertaining. This home has been thoughtfully expanded, making it one of the largest in the community and located in a peaceful cul-de-sac. Situated within the highly sought after and award-winning Palos Verdes School District, this property is also conveniently close to hiking trails and parks, making it an ideal location for outdoor enthusiasts. Don?t miss this opportunity to make this beautiful home yours!","Tile","All Bedrooms Down, Den, Kitchen, Living Room, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Mira Catalina","Palos Verdes Peninsula","Miraleste","","Nick","Burdiak","PVBURDNIC","V8107","","","Vista Sotheby's International Realty","1950000","False","Full Service","Please see open house times, or contact agent for showings. Supra on property, but CBS code required. There is a family member that stays there part time. Please Call Trina Gagliano 310.403.8058","True","None","False","True","3031","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Narino","","3308","Drive","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","26140","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Available, Natural Gas Available, Phone Available, Sewer Available, Water Available","Neighborhood, Ocean","True","https://vimeo.com/995434201?share=copy","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=xgLrBWF1cgk","Custom Covering","1961","90275","6227","RPRS13000*"
