land, while offering an incredible opportunity to transform this space into your dream home. With a spacious floor plan, a private pool/spa, and panoramic views, this property is brimming with potential. As you enter, you'll immediately be struck by the bright and airy atmosphere, thanks to large windows that invite natural light and frame the breathtaking ocean vistas. The expansive living room and dining area provide a perfect setting for both casual family gatherings and elegant entertaining, with the ocean view as a stunning backdrop. A cozy fireplace adds warmth and character to the space, creating a welcoming ambiance.The kitchen offers plenty of cabinet space and a functional layout to suit your needs. The five generously sized bedrooms offer ample space for family, guests, or even a home office. The primary suite is a peaceful retreat, featuring a remodeled en-suite bathroom and a large balcony looking over the backyard with & breathtaking views and mesmerizing sunsets. The additional bedrooms provide comfort and convenience for family members or guests. Step outside to discover your own private oasis. The backyard features a sparkling pool & spa surrounded with an amazing mature cactus as you look west, offering the perfect space to relax, entertain, or take in the stunning views. Located in a quiet, upscale neighborhood, this home is just minutes away from highly rated schools, local parks, hiking trails, and shopping. With its prime location, ocean views, and potential to customize, this property offers an amazing opportunity to build equity and live the coastal lifestyle you've always dreamed of. New HVAC was installed in 2023. Don't miss out on the chance to own a piece of paradise in Rancho Palos Verdes!","","Den, Living Room, Wine Cellar","","","","","","CLW-10010194","Joe","Alessi","VALESJOE","V7946","","","Estate Properties","1950000","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions:  Showing Information: 24-hr Notice,Call LA 1,Text LA 1,Registration Re