Mira Catalina neighborhood.  The breathtaking, Magnificent Views are unobstructed and captivates your senses.  This home has the perfect low-maintenance outdoor space and boasts an expansive 500 SF viewing deck to relax or enjoy entertaining friends and family while admiring the 180 degree views of Cabrillo Beach, Catalina Island, San Nicolas Island, San Clemente Island, the Channel Islands, miles of Coastline and Gorgeous Coves.  There are NO STEPS inside this lovely remodeled home and property upgrades include dual glazed vinyl windows, recessed lighting, crown moldings, smooth ceilings, fresh paint, new Berber carpeting, and new landscaping. The kitchen has granite counters, tons of cabinets and breakfast bar with an adjacent separate inside laundry room with washer and dryer. Views from inside this home can be seen from the kitchen, dining room and two bedrooms.  It has a Spacious Master Suite with 3 closets and private bathroom with double vanities. With three other bedrooms, you can host family, friends or make space for a work from home office. The dining room leads out to the beautifully landscaped yard highlighted by the Magnificent Viewing Deck with Trellis, in addition to lush greenery, lawn area with automatic sprinklers, and a brick sun deck. This property is conveniently located walking distance to Mira Catalina Elementary School and UCLA South Bay, or a short drive to other top rated Palos Verdes public schools. The renowned Terranea Resort and Trump Golf Course are just down the Drive. With easy access to the freeway, you'll enjoy a seamless commute to wherever your adventures take you. This is a must-see property and will not disappoint the most discriminating buyer. See it before it is TOO LATE!!","","All Bedrooms Up, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Mira Catalina","Palos Verdes Peninsula","Miraleste","","Meg","Puccinelli","PVPUCCABI","v8542","2.5","%","Compass","21000