ose Of Escrow","904.7","Perched to capture breathtaking harbor, ocean, coastline, and Catalina Island views, this beautifully updated single-level home in the highly desirable Mira Catalina neighborhood offers the ultimate in Southern California coastal living. From the moment you arrive, you'll be impressed by the lovely landscaping and inviting curb appeal. Step through elegant beveled glass double doors into a bright, open layout filled with natural light and panoramic vistas. The home has been extensively upgraded inside and out, featuring new interior and exterior paint, quiet high efficient HVAC, custom granite countertops, rich wood and travertine flooring, and recessed lighting throughout. In addition, all the bathrooms are remodeled and updated with high-end fixtures. The functional open-concept floor plan includes a spacious living room as well as a formal dining room and a family room that showcase large picture windows to embrace the stunning views. The remodeled kitchen is designed for both style and function, with ample cabinetry, high-end Thermador appliances, granite countertops, and a large breakfast bar for casual dining. The kitchen opens seamlessly to the family room, which is surrounded by dual sliding doors leading to an expansive wood deck and patio, ideal for indoor-outdoor entertaining. The primary suite is a private retreat, perfectly positioned to take in the view. It features sliding doors to the backyard, dressing area with mirrored closets and cabinets, and an en-suite bathroom with dual sinks and a spacious walk-in shower. Three additional generously sized bedrooms share a well-appointed hallway bathroom with dual sinks and granite countertops. The true highlight of this home is the fully landscaped backyard; an entertainer?s dream with a million-dollar view. Enjoy peaceful mornings with the sunrise, captivating sunsets, moonlight reflecting off the ocean, and even fireworks on holidays from the comfort of your private oasis. The outdoor space includes a sitting area with a cozy fire pit and a dining patio, perfect for year-round enjoyment. Additional features include a large powder room, a separate laundry room with backyard access, and an updated garage with vinyl flooring and ample built-in storage. Located in the award-winning Palos Verdes School District, near UCLA South Bay and with easy freeway access for commuters, this home is an exceptional find that offers luxury, comfort, and stunning coastal views.","","Entry, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Separate Family Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Mira Catalina","Peninsula","Miraleste","","Tiana","Capper","sbcapptia","S5267","","","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","2250000","False","Full Service","An Offer has been accepted at the property. The scheduled public open house on 8/10 is cancelled.","True","","","","2487","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Corinna","","3226","Drive","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","25839","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Catalina, City Lights, Coastline, Harbor, Ocean, Panoramic","True","https://www.seetheproperty.com/u/483359","","Blinds, Double Pane Windows, Roller Shields","1962","90275","6210","RPRS13000*"
