drapes, soft carpet, and original hardwood floors that add charm and warmth. There is also a unique bonus room with double doors, currently used as an office and workout space. Originally designed as a dance room, it features a built-in dance floor with fiber optic lighting, a wet bar, built-in bookshelves and its own fireplace?making it a great spot to unwind or entertain. Additional highlights include a three-car attached garage, extra basement storage, and a location just minutes from the top rated Palos Verdes Unified Public schools, freeways, scenic hiking trails, and the stunning coastline?with views of the ocean and the Channel Islands. This one-of-a-kind home offers space, style, and spectacular scenery?all in one of Rancho Palos Verdes? most desirable neighborhoods. ***Please check out the virtual tour and loving it!!!***","Tile","Basement, Exercise Room, Family Room, Formal Entry, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Retreat, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Mira Catalina","Palos Verdes Peninsula","Miraleste","","HUILING","LI","WS81768","20652","","","Pinnacle Real Estate Group","2259000","False","Full Service","Appointment only due to guard gated community. Please kindly text Kai-Li at 626-466-7699 with your business card, date and time of showing. Thank you! Listing agent is related to the Sellers/Owners","False","Bath, Fiberglass","True","True","4153","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Multi/Split ","","","Avenida De Azalea","","10","","","","Cash, Cash To Existing Loan, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","33206","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Available, Natural Gas Available, Water Available","City Lights, Harbor, Mountain(s), Ocean, Panoramic","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=n5eRwqFb6Un","","Double Pane Windows, Drapes, Screens","1988","90275","6379","RPRS1-RS20000-"
