m level with a gorgeous master suite, the master bathroom, a guest bedroom/office/master bedroom sitting area, a guest bathroom, the laundry room, and even more views! The master suite has an expansive walk-in closet, another Brazilian hardwood deck, and its own ensuite bathroom where you can listen to the relaxing built-in fountain right outside your window while utilizing the heated tile floors, two sink areas, and spacious steam shower with dual shower heads and ocean views even from inside the shower! Above the main level of the property is a loft, which has its own enclosed bedroom, a private outdoor balcony, a separate office area, a skylight, atrium windows, and a full bathroom. This property also features beam ceilings, bamboo floors, tinted windows, a newer main electrical panel ready for solar panels, copper plumbing, a tankless water heater with a recirculating hot water pump, 3 electric split A/C and heating units controlled by a phone app, fire retardant DensGlass under exterior cedar siding, a water main automatic emergency leak shutoff with cell phone alerts, Milgard windows/sliders, sprinkler system in the canyon, 2-car garage, parking for 4 additional cars in the long concrete driveway, and more!","","Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Loft, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Danielle","Whitney Moore","SWHITNDA","S4726","2.5","%","Keller Williams Realty","2350000","False","Full Service","Seller just added a bedroom to this property and remodeled the kitchen. Extensive list of property features is in the supplements section of the MLS.  No showings until open house on 7/16/2023 from 12:00-2:00pm. Text Danielle at (310) 987-9103 to set up a showing. There is a CBS code to the Supra. Please park at the bottom of the cul-de-sac on Bendigo Drive. Then, walk down the long driveway easement all the way to the second property. Please do not disturb the owners of the first pr