celain creating the ultimate first impression. The open space is anchored by a granite waterfall center island with custom drop down lighting. The kitchen is a chef's dream with 48? Forno Galinano gas range and hood with soft closing modern cabinets and drawers. The Panda marble counters and island with its bold contrast of black and white streaks sets the tone for any culinary gathering. The kitchen space also includes a stainless built-in refrigerator, dishwasher, and wine center. Formal dining and family room are both framed in by two glass sliders opening to the amazing views and grounds. The den is perfectly positioned to take in the views and also has direct access to the grounds. The home office with two angled walls of glass affords the best spot to catch up on the days events. The master suite opens to the amazing endless views and enjoys the ultimate spa enfused bath with double sinks, custom tile rain shower head and wi-fi enabled bidet. Custom lighting can be found thru-out with ceiling corner accenting lighting as well as exterior step lighting. Additional features include new AC and heating system, new doors and windows, backlit mirrors in all the bathrooms and exterior covered patio. The rear grounds have a modern concrete grid surrounded by gray and black stones creating a Zen experience. The yard is anchored by the most amazing tree and firepit. The fully finished garage, complete with an epoxy flake system floor and brand-new garage door enjoys a huge picture window with stunning views of the ocean and coastline. This home provides easy access to the renowned Terranea Resort and Golf Course, as well as miles of walking and hiking trails for outdoor enthusiasts. Residents have access to the top-ranked Palos Verdes Schools such as Mira Catalina Elementary, Miraleste Intermediate, and your choice from two of the top ranked high schools in California. Epic views and priceless sunsets?. This is the best of Southern California coastal living!","","Den, E