 and wet bar makes for nice gatherings. One bedroom and full bath downstairs. Upstairs, the primary suite opens to relaxing views and features a sitting room with a cozy fireplace. Enter the bathroom through double doors to find double vanity, separate Jacuzzi spa tub and steam shower, and his & hers closets.  The resort like backyard features a sparkling pool with swim jet, Baja deck, spa, waterfall, and app based controls. Sit under the heated pergola looking over downtown, gather around the large fire pit, or watch your favorite game with friends around the ample granite covered bar complete with fridge, sink, and plenty of storage. This is truly an entertainer's delight!  The solar system is seamlessly integrated into the home's electrical infrastructure, powering essential appliances, lighting, heating, and cooling systems, while any excess energy returns to the grid. There is a 3 car garage and bonus parking spot. Extra storage is under the home. Easy access to freeways for Downtown LA commute and to Long Beach, as well as a close distance to Terranea Resorts and the Trump Golf Course. Top Ranked Palos Verdes Schools. Miles of walking and hiking trails with ocean and Catalina views can be enjoyed just minutes away.","Tile","Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Mira Catalina","Palos Verdes","Miraleste","","Craig","Holden","INHOLDCRA","IN2527","2.5","%","Craig Holden","2600000","False","Full Service","Thank you for your interest! DO NOT GO DIRECT!!! Please schedule ALL showings by calling or texting listing agent: Haley Farrahi @ 310-415 4351 first. 1 hour advance notice would be appreciated!","True","Private, In Ground","True","True","3948","Public Records","","CA","Closed","Multi/Split ","","","Avenida De Camelia","","2","","","Mediterranean","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","33206","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natur