h elegant and inviting. Every detail has been thoughtfully curated to enhance style and comfort, making this a truly exceptional retreat. This home features three spacious en-suite bedrooms?two upstairs and one downstairs?and 4.5 exquisitely designed bathrooms. The layout offers ultimate flexibility and privacy, with both upstairs en-suites featuring walk-in closets and spa-inspired bathrooms. The bathrooms are designed with luxurious touches, including a standalone tub featured in one primary en-suite, dual sinks, and Brizo Champagne Bronze finishes, elevating everyday living to a new level of refinement. The heart of the home is a chef's dream kitchen, equipped with brand-new Signature Kitchen Suite appliances, custom Rift White Oak cabinetry, and stunning MSI Calcatta Abezzo quartz countertops. Thoughtful details like Top Knob modern cabinet pulls and new designer lighting?including kitchen pendants, chandeliers, and sconces?add to the space?s timeless appeal. A newly tiled fireplace in the living area enhances the warmth and style of the home, while Vandyck engineered wood floors and recessed lighting flow seamlessly throughout. New vinyl windows frame the captivating views, while a striking 10-foot custom front door sets the tone for the modern sophistication within. The fully finished garage, complete with an epoxy flake system floor and brand-new garage doors, ensures both practicality and style. Outside, the home boasts smooth stucco exteriors, carefully landscaped front and backyards, and newly poured concrete areas. The backyard is a true haven, featuring custom cable railings, Mangaris decks, and ample space to relax and enjoy the ocean breeze. From the custom Deus modern mailbox to the stylish exterior light fixtures, no detail has been overlooked. Whether entertaining guests or enjoying peaceful moments, this home offers the perfect balance of luxury, comfort, and stunning coastal views, making it a rare and extraordinary find in one of Southern Califor