eat!  Step into the perfect blend of comfort, space, and breathtaking ocean views in this inviting single-level home, ideally situated at the end of a quiet cul-de-sac in Rancho Palos Verdes!  From the moment you arrive, you?ll be captivated by stunning ocean vistas from the primary suite, front yard, and expansive backyard?an ideal backdrop for everyday living and entertaining.  This well-maintained 4-bedroom, 3-bathroom home rests on a generous 15,184 sq ft lot, offering endless possibilities for outdoor fun, gardening, or even a future pool. Inside, enjoy the airy, light-filled layout featuring brand new flooring and fresh interior paint that create a clean, modern feel throughout.  The large kitchen is a chef?s delight, complete with abundant storage, an eat-in area, and easy flow to the dining room and cozy living room, where a welcoming fireplace awaits your evenings. Start your day in the bright enclosed sunroom or unwind on the expansive deck that?s perfect for gatherings or simply soaking in the coastal breeze.  A spacious indoor laundry room, versatile two-car garage with a large workshop area (ideal for hobbies, storage, a 3rd car, or small boat), and a flat, usable yard add to the home's exceptional functionality.  Enjoy a peaceful, private lifestyle surrounded by lush greenery, just minutes to scenic hiking trails, Ladera Linda Park?s new community center and playground, Abalone Cove, Trump National Golf Club, Terranea Resort, and top-rated Palos Verdes schools.  Don?t miss this rare chance to own an ocean-view gem where your dream coastal lifestyle awaits.  Come take a look and experience the potential of this wonderful home!","","All Bedrooms Down, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Sun","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Virginia","Butler","VBUTLVIR","V7151","","","Coldwell Banker Realty","1296363","False","Full Service","Go direct, thank you f