 roof, only six years old.  Picture yourself lounging by not one but two fireplaces, both meticulously serviced inside and out, promising cozy evenings and a touch of rustic charm. The exterior is defined by a sturdy cinder block wall erected just six years ago. The boundaries are marked by fully fenced yards, encompassing over a half acre, offering a private sanctuary for outdoor activities and relaxation.  This home is connected to the local sewer system.  The landscaping is a blend of mature trees, recently trimmed and maintained, providing shade and a scenic backdrop. Plumbing is a well-managed aspect of the property, exemplified by the recently installed disposal.  Inside, the home offers three bedrooms in a family-friendly design. A full bathroom and a convenient powder room cater to both functionality and comfort. The laundry/mudroom adds practicality to the daily routine. The gas dryer hookup and two gas water heaters ensure efficiency and convenience. The kitchen features electric cooktops and an oven, offering a balance of traditional and modern culinary options.  For additional storage needs, a large and newer Tuff Shed is thoughtfully placed in the yard, providing ample space for tools, equipment, or personal belongings. Completing the ensemble is a 1 1/2 car garage, combining functionality with a touch of nostalgia. This home is not just a residence; it's a testament to decades of thoughtful ownership and a commitment to enduring quality and comfort.  *Some photos have been virtually staged","","All Bedrooms Down, Entry, Galley Kitchen, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Steven","Nottingham","PNOTTSTE","PB16299","2.5","%","Keller Williams Pacific Estate","1310000","False","Full Service","Text agent for showing instruction. Property may not be able to get financing or insurance due to location.","","None","False","","1834","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Cinnamon","","11","Lane","",