our coastal retreat! This is a Single Family Residence, Planned Unit Development located in a private community of only twenty homes at the end of a quiet cul-de-sac.  Enjoy resort-style amenities including two full-size tennis courts, a pool, spa, and clubhouse, all within walking distance to the ocean.This beautifully upgraded end-unit home features a fully remodeled kitchen with custom cabinetry, new countertops, upgraded appliances, and a spacious island that opens to the living room. The inviting living area offers a fireplace, bar/coffee nook, and direct access to a back patio. Upstairs, the primary suite showcases ocean, Catalina, and sunset views from a private balcony, a second fireplace, a walk-in closet, and a luxurious spa-inspired bath with dual sinks, jetted tub, and separate shower. The secondary bathroom has also been tastefully remodeled. Additional upgrades include new energy-efficient windows and sliding doors, recessed LED lighting, fresh interior paint, smart climate control with Wi-Fi thermostat, Ring security system, new electrical panel ready for EV charging upgrades, and a quiet-drive garage door. Prime location near scenic hiking trails leading to Terranea Resort and the Golden Cove Center with Trader Joe?s, Starbucks, and dining options. Situated within the award-winning Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified School District, one of the top districts in California.  Move-in ready coastal living at its finest! Schedule a private tour today and make this exceptional home yours!","","Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Multi-Level Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Anne","St.Cyr","PVSTCYANN","V8107","","","Vista Sotheby's International Realty","1370000","False","Full Service","NO SHOWINGTIME! The property is vacant. Please call or text prior to showing. Kindly wear shoe covers while touring the home. Supra lockbox is located at the front gate.","","","","","2040","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Coastsite","