layout serves as a blank canvas for a dream culinary space. The outdoor living area is a tiered paradise. A tiled patio sits at the highest level, perfect for al fresco dining and entertaining. Below, a lush grass area provides a serene space for relaxation, while the lowest level features a concrete pad, gravel, and mature trees, offering a versatile setting for various outdoor activities and possible guest house? The owners installed double pane windows, ensuring energy efficiency and comfort, and a brand-new central furnace installed in 2023, providing peace of mind for years to come. Living at 8 Clipper Road means you'll have a pathway to the stunning Abalone Cove Shoreline Park, home to sea caves, tide pools teeming with marine life, and frequent seal and dolphin sightings. The property is also within a short distance to the renowned Terranea Resort and an array of picturesque hiking trails. Don't miss this rare opportunity to own a piece of coastal paradise with endless potential.","Tar/Gravel","Entry, Family Room, Jack & Jill, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Utility Room","","Palo Verde Unified","Point Vicente","Palos Verdes","Miraleste","","Keegan","Cin","DWCINKEE","DWBSD","","","Berkshire Hathaway HomeServices","1475000","False","Full Service","Please schedule all showings though ShowingTime prior to showing the property.  Kindly provide feedback after your showing. Please do not call to schedule. CBS Code is REQUIRED","True","None","False","True","2791","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Clipper","","8","Road","","Mid Century Modern","Cash, Conventional, VA Loan","","14649","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Available, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Catalina, Coastline, Hills, Neighborhood, Ocean, Water","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=JTnd63UVvxA&brand=0","","Blinds, Double Pane Wind