niently located across the street from ocean and hillside hiking trails and near Terranea Resort, public and private golf courses, the Point Vicente Interpretive Center, Trader Joes, and all that the Palos Verdes Peninsula has to offer for a relaxed and special community. PVPUSD is an award winning school district. ?The Hill? also offers exceptional private schools.","Flat","All Bedrooms Down, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Office, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Max","Lindenberger","OCLINDMAX","OC18045","","","Engel & Volkers Dana Point","1600000","False","Full Service","LA/Owner. No Supra but easy to show. Please allow 2 hours notice to relocate the dog. Thanks for showing! Please NOTE: The home is NOT located in the Portuguese Bend/Klondike Canyon mapped area and is NOT included in the SoCal Gas shut-off mandate. See Supplements.","True","None","False","True","1828","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Admirable","","3913","Drive","","Contemporary","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","22387","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Connected, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Neighborhood","True","","","Double Pane Windows, ENERGY STAR Qualified Windows, Screens","1959","90275","6027","RPRS10000*"
