mple storage space, and an electric plug-in for electric vehicles. Immerse yourself in the beauty of this incredible area, including a private equestrian center and trails. This home is designed for modern living and entertaining, making it perfect for gathering with friends and family. Come and see why so many have fallen in love with this extraordinary place.  ****NOTE: This property is located in an area of Rancho Palos Verdes experiencing active land movement. This home has NOT been affected and shows no signs of movement inside or outside the home. The home has 9 caisons. A Geological Report has been done and states the property is currently in good condition. Please email the listing agent for?report. The city has received a $23.33 million grant from FEMA for its proposed Portuguese Bend Landslide Remediation Project.**","","All Bedrooms Down","","Palo Verde Unified","Point Vicente","","Miraleste","","Maor","Katzman","SR207059620","SR0125500","","","Arch Realty Group","1675000","False","Full Service","For any showings please contact listing agent Jackie Enriquez at 310.753.2758 text/call. Owners still live there so we are requesting a 4 hour notice.","False","Bath","True","","3595","Public Records","","CA","Closed","One","","","Narcissa Drive","","53","","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","14195","","Single Family Residence","","","Hills, Ocean","True","","","Custom Covering, ENERGY STAR Qualified Windows","2013","90275","","Rprs20000&E"
