rom inside and out. Positioned high on the hill and within a cul de sac, the home offers the ultimate privacy. Enter through the double front doors into a wide foyer that is open to the living, family,  and dining rooms. The gourmet kitchen is an entertainer's delight, with Wolf industrial stove/oven and separate convection steam oven, and Subzero built-in frig. Designer cabinets and quartzite stone counters complete the culinary experience that ensures family and friends returning to every event. Additional features include freshly painted interior and exterior, newer hardwood floors, new central heating, new ABS sewerline. The flat back yard is perfect for a game of lawn frisbee or simply just relaxing on a peaceful  afternoon. A perfectly positioned viewing deck and newly installed outdoor BBQ/pergola area complete the backyard experience. Walk to The Trump Golf Course with miles of hiking trails and beautiful ocean vistas. The newly built Ladera Linda Community Center with outdoor sports and childrens complex is amazing and open to all residents. Homeowners have access to Palos Verdes Schools, including your choice from two of the top-ranked high schools in all of California. Minutes away, you can enjoy a game of golf or dine at Terranea Resort. Or take a stroll through one of the many hiking trails, either way you are surrounded by the best of California coastal living.","Composition","Entry, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Mira Catalina","Peninsula","Miraleste","","Kelly","deLaat","CLW-X97234","CLW-X80715","","","Douglas Elliman","1700000","False","Full Service","First showing will be on 1/20/26","","","","True","1983","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Heroic","","3512","","","Modern","Contract","","26834","","Single Family Residence","","","Mountain(s), Neighborhood, Ocean, Panoramic, Water","True","","","","1963","90275","",""
