long-term comfort immediately. Step through the front door into a spacious open floor plan featuring a living room with a cozy fireplace and a bright family room with its own fireplace and floor-to-ceiling windows that flood the home with natural light. Multiple sliding glass doors lead to a private backyard, creating an effortless setting for entertaining and everyday enjoyment. Thoughtfully designed for accessibility and ease of living, the home features a single-story, mobility-friendly layout, making it well-suited for aging in place, multigenerational living, or enhanced everyday comfort. The modern kitchen boasts sleek quartz countertops, stainless steel appliances, and ocean views. Down the hallway are four well-sized bedrooms, including a primary bedroom with its own ocean view, along with two beautifully updated bathrooms featuring quartz countertops and skylights that bring in abundant natural light. Additional highlights include newer flooring and window coverings throughout, central air conditioning, and convenient in-home washer/dryer hookups. Outdoors, unwind in the private heated pool and spa or host guests in the spacious backyard retreat. A two-car garage with side door access is complemented by an additional concrete side pad offering dedicated space for RV parking, a boat, or a handicap-accessible vehicle, adding rare flexibility and convenience. This home seamlessly combines coastal charm, accessibility, and bright, inviting spaces?a truly versatile coastal retreat. NOTE: This property has not been affected by the Portuguese Bend landslide area.","","All Bedrooms Down","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Tony","Nafissi","SNAFITON","sb1309590","","","Berkshire Hathaway HomeServices California Properties","1800000","False","Full Service","Text or Call Anne St. Cyr with any questions.  GO DIRECT Please make sure you lock all doors and turn lights off.","True","Private, Heated, In Ground","True","True","2517","Assessor","","CA","Closed",