ace, and large picture window to enjoy the view. The first-floor family room with ocean view bay window opens to the outdoor patio. And if that isn?t enough, the dining room, kitchen with breakfast bar and eating area open to the private backyard with sliders. Finishing off the first floor are a bedroom and convenient laundry area. The inviting foyer featuring vaulted ceiling and sweeping open stairwell taking you to your oversized master bedroom and bathroom. Two more bedrooms, one with ocean view bay window, and a full bath as well as a spacious storage area finish off the second floor. This is a great home that has been well loved! Ladera Linda in RPV is south facing and has some of the best weather on the hill! Walk to Trump National and the Nature Reserve and only minutes from Wayfarers Chapel and Terranea Resort. All utilities are underground. This is a fantastic opportunity to own in one of the best kept secrets in all of Palos Verdes!","Metal","Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Haig","Barsamian","C12676","50049","2.5","%","BARSAM & ASSOCIATES, INC.","1815000","False","Full Service","Showings are by appointment only, Thank you","","None","False","True","2435","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Vigilance","","3618","Drive","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","26834","","Single Family Residence","","","Catalina, Neighborhood, Ocean","True","","","Bay Window(s), Screens","1964","90275","",""
