ng sunsets, starlit skies, and cool ocean breezes. The sunsets are the main attraction here?a nightly display of natural beauty that never gets old. This original home is full of potential, presenting a unique opportunity for a buyer to renovate and make it their own, or for an investor to reimagine entirely. Located on the ocean side of the block, the property is just a short walk from the brand-new, state-of-the-art Ladera Linda Community Center and Park. It's also steps from the world-class Trump National Golf Club and adjacent to the largest nature preserve in Los Angeles County, offering miles of scenic riding and hiking trails. A rare opportunity to own a property with one of the South Bay?s most iconic views, in a peaceful, prestigious enclave with top-rated Palos Verdes Peninsula schools and endless potential to create something extraordinary.","","All Bedrooms Down, Formal Entry, Foyer","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Josephine","Balzano","PVBALZJOS","V8040","","","Keller Williams Palos Verdes","1825000","False","Full Service","Easy to show but please Call Kristen for appointment (310) 650-1078.","","","","","2045","Appraiser","","CA","Closed","One","","","Sea Raven","","32353","Drive","","","Submit","","26834","","Single Family Residence","","","Catalina, Coastline, Ocean, Panoramic, Water","True","https://players.brightcove.net/5782667246001/default_default/index.html?videoId=6375512240112","","","1963","90275","6118","RPRS13000*"
