onvenient ensuite. A tastefully tiled hall bath treats you to a soothing jetted tub. Sure to be a crowd favorite, the sun-drenched deck is perfect for year-round gatherings. Whether you?re basking in the cool afternoon breeze or sipping a beverage by the fire columns, its picturesque setting can?t be beat. An enchanting English garden adorned with a gently trickling fountain creates a truly unique oasis. As a premium perk, a beautifully converted garage with a 3/4 bath nearby is ideal for overnight guests or a bonus room for entertaining. Living here puts you in a tight-knit community with a shared pride in homeownership. Plus, you?re conveniently located across the street from the exclusive Portuguese Bend Beach Club. Come take a tour before it?s gone for good!","","All Bedrooms Down, Center Hall, Entry, Family Room, Foyer, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","John","Shaw","PSHAWJOH","PW0065","2.5","%","Coldwell Banker Realty","1875000","False","Full Service","Please call/Text L/A. Owner occupied.","True","None","False","","2383","See Remarks","","CA","Closed","One","","","Exultant Drive","","4240","","","Ranch, Traditional","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Submit","","22835","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Connected, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Catalina, Coastline, Ocean, Water","True","https://tour.caimagemaker.com/l/?id=179038IDX","","","1956","90275","",""
