ve vaulted, beamed ceilings upstairs, allowing an abundance of natural light to illuminate the spacious living area. The second living room provides seamless access to the backyard, featuring a cozy fireplace and wet bar, ideal for entertaining guests. As you explore the upstairs floor plan, take a moment to appreciate the panoramic ocean view from the living and dining rooms, and on clear days, you may even catch a glimpse of Catalina Island. Descending to the lower level, you'll discover a guest suite with a walk-in closet and a full bath. The house showcases hardwood flooring, newly carpeted bedrooms, fresh exterior and interior paint, new blinds on the windows, and a recently re-roofed structure with new underlayment. In addition to the generous rooms and open layout, the house offers a family room adjacent to the kitchen and an exquisite master bedroom. The master suite boasts his-and-her walk-in closets and a spacious bathroom. Another notable feature is the fourth bedroom, which includes its own full bath and is conveniently located on the first floor, adjacent to the triple car-sized garage. Step outside to the serene backyard, featuring a tiered fountain that enhances the tranquility of the outdoor space. The location of this property presents a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity, with cliffs and ocean trails just steps away, and easy access to the amenities of Terranea. The nearby Golden Cove shopping center, offering Trader Joe's, Starbucks, and various dining options, is just minutes away, and the 110 freeway can be reached in a short 20-minute drive. Don't miss out on the chance to turn this dream house into your forever home.","Clay, Tile","Entry, Family Room, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, See Remarks, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Julie","DeCoste","SDECOJUL","sb1300260","2","%","Re/Max Estate Properties","1950000","False","Full Service","Vacant. Go directly. T