,"A large mahogany door welcomes you upon entering the walkway into the home and are greeted by a beautiful weeping willow-like tree highlighting a whimsical private secret garden. This gorgeous stunning yard captures your immediate interest as your gaze travels over the impressive and lovingly cared for landscape. The garden complements the mid century modern home featuring a stunning design of glass walls, post and beam construction and an open floor plan reminiscent of the California Modernist architecture.  All the main living areas and hallway evoke a feeling of bringing in the verdant landscaping inside the home while enjoying the serene zen-like privacy. Family living at best, completely updated windows, high ceilings, wood floors, new paint, tankless water heater, skylights and ceiling light fans. Easy entertaining with a remodeled gourmet kitchen boasting an island counter, a Sub-Zero refrigerator, Dacor Oven, abundant cabinets with organizers & easy pull outs, built-ins and roomy quartz counters. Enjoy the master en-suite complete with its own separate office, walk in closet and bathroom with jetted tub, separate walk in shower and double sinks.  Make many memories in the park-like backyard filled with abundant plantings, expansive stone patio, flat grassy yard, raised garden bed and children's playhouse. This neighborhood known for its perpetual sunny micro climate, close proximity to the ocean, and wooded tree lined streets.  Hurry to this irresistible home!","","All Bedrooms Down, Galley Kitchen","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","CLW-X65688","Tracy B","Do","CLW-X54637","CLW-X2000192","","","Coldwell Banker Realty","2010000","False","Full Service","Showings begin 10/14/24. Give 1 hour notice. Book on ShowingTime and you will get CBS.","False","None","False","","1882","Seller","","CA","Closed","One","","","Packet","","10","Road","","Mid Century Modern","Cash to New Loan","","14649","","Single Family Residence","","","Peek-A-Boo","True","","htt