weeping breathtaking 270-degree ocean views in a tranquil cul-de-sac setting and exclusive access to resort-style HOA amenities, including a newly upgraded clubhouse, gym, tennis/pickle courts, sauna, spa and swimming pool.  A thoughtfully designed serene Zen garden welcomes you, setting the tone for the calm and beauty that awaits inside. Step through the front door and be instantly captivated by the breathtaking ocean vistas, complemented by brand-new white oak flooring throughout. The formal open dining area features expansive windows framing stunning vistas of the Terranea golf course, directly accessible via a nearby walking path, with Catalina Island and the Pacific Ocean providing a stunning backdrop. The formal dining room flows seamlessly into the formal living room, where floor-to-ceiling balcony doors and windows showcase dramatic southern coastline bluff views. The new expansive glass balcony with frameless railings creates a seamless indoor-outdoor flow?perfect for enjoying ocean breezes and sunset views. The main level also includes a fully remodeled kitchen featuring elegant bar seating and a cozy breakfast nook. The main level also boasts a refined bathroom with elegant ocean hues, a fourth bedroom, and a freshly epoxy-coated garage with direct access. Downstairs, you will find three spacious bedrooms, two additional bathrooms, a laundry room, and access to the serene backyard, offering ample space for family or guests. The primary suite is a private retreat, enjoying peaceful ocean views, a spacious walk-in closet, and a spa-like ensuite bathroom with a soaking tub and separate shower. Another bedroom on this level also benefits from abundant natural light and captivating ocean views. Outside, the brick patio invites al fresco dining, with ample room to create a lush garden oasis.  Whether you are relaxing in the serenity of the coastal breeze or exploring nearby hiking trails, beaches, and world-class golf courses, this home delivers the perfect blend of luxury, comfort, and coastal charm?ready for you to enjoy the best of Palos Verdes living. Live the Resort Life Every Day ? Just steps from the world-renowned Terranea Resort. Do not miss this rare opportunity to own a slice of paradise!","Spanish Tile","Entry, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Point Vicente","Palos Verdes Peninsula","Miraleste","","Yu","Ooka","PVOOKAYU","PV8696","","","HomeSmart Realty Group","2198000","False","Full Service","Appointment Only.  Call Neil 310-902-7227","True","Association, In Ground","True","","2635","Appraiser","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Channelview","","6606","Court","","Spanish","Conventional","","35040","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Catalina, Coastline, Ocean, Panoramic","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=dFpXE9zB9XF","","Casement Windows","1990","90275","","RPRS10000*"
