ary suite features a walk-in closet, luxurious bath with a separate shower, sunken tub, and stunning marble surfaces. Throughout the home, custom cabinetry, crown molding, and an integrated sound system enhance its luxurious feel. This home offers the perfect blend of comfort, elegance, and breathtaking views, making it an ideal place to call home.","Composition","All Bedrooms Down, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Office, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","szebrcar","Rebecca","Chambliss","VCHAMREB","V8496","","","Palm Realty Boutique","2220000","False","Full Service","Please do not use Showing Time. For showings, please call or text agent directly to confirm showing and get CBS code before going to the property at (310) 714-8184.","True","None","False","True","3142","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Palos Verdes Drive South","","3951","","","","Cash, Conventional","","22387","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Available, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Available, Sewer Available, Sewer Connected, Water Available, Water Connected","Catalina, Coastline, Golf Course, Ocean, Panoramic","True","https://vimeo.com/1056609122?share=copy","","Bay Window(s), Custom Covering, Plantation Shutters, Roller Shields, Screens, Skylight(s), Wood Frames","1959","90275","",""
