oom, 4 bathroom remodeled home has 3,350 sq. ft. of living space. Enjoy ocean and Catalina views from the upstairs newly added master suite with attached entertainer's balcony and access to the rear yard. Enter through the dramatic double front doors into a wide foyer that is open to the living room and dining room. Be sure to look up to see the barrel ceiling in the foyer. The gourmet kitchen is an entertainer's delight with large island, stainless Forno industrial range and built-in oversized LG refrigerator/freezer. Don't miss the extensive storage and dramatic finishes. 3 Bedrooms, including a second master suite, are located on the first floor. When you enter the generously sized master suite upstairs, you will enjoy sweeping views up and down the coast and Catalina Island from the double French doors and private balcony. The spa inspired master bathroom with jacuzzi tub and separate travertine shower and sky light has direct access to an outdoor, west-facing cantina and party deck with amazing coastline views. Additional features include freshly painted interior and exterior, refinished hardwood floors, new carpeting thru-out, new front doors, new Pelican water softener, new garage door, freshly landscaped rear grounds. Downstairs you can enjoy indoor/outdoor living with a huge flat, beautiful yard, flagstone patio and an outdoor shower perfect for when you get back from the beach. Walk to The Trump Golf Course with miles of hiking trails and beautiful ocean vistas. Residents have access to the top-ranked Palos Verdes Schools such as Mira Catalina Elementary, Miraleste Intermediate, and your choice from two of the top ranked high schools in California. Minutes away, you can enjoy a game of golf or dine at Terranea Resort. Or take a stroll through one of the many hiking trails, either way you are surrounded by the best of California coastal living. NOTE: This home is NOT in the historical or current land movement area, and there has never been recorded land movement on this side of Sea View. Geological reports of the area are readily available online or through the listing agent.","","Entry, Family Room, Formal Entry, Foyer, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room, Two Primaries, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Mira Catalina","Palos Verdes","Miraleste","","Colin","McLaren","p24480","PF5630","","","Keller Williams Realty","2237000","False","Full Service","PROPERTY IS STAGED AND READY FOR ALL SHOWINGS GO DIRECT AND BE SURE TO LOCK ALL DOORS AND TURN OFF THE LIGHTS","","","","True","3350","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Admirable","","4005","Drive","","Mid Century Modern","Contract","","22387","","Single Family Residence","","","Coastline, Neighborhood, Ocean, Panoramic","True","","","","1959","90275","6029","RPRS10000*"
