 where vaulted beamed ceilings create an airy, open ambiance. The huge windows, adorned with custom shutters, flood the home with natural light and perfectly frame the picturesque ocean vistas. The living room, featuring a cozy fireplace, is an inviting space for relaxation, while the family room, also with its fireplace, offers a comfortable setting for more casual gatherings. For formal occasions, the dining area provides a backdrop for memorable meals. Entertaining is a breeze, with a separate bar area designed for hosting friends and family. The large kitchen has plenty of counter space, skylights, a large island, and a breakfast bar for casual meals. Adjacent to the kitchen is a breakfast room that leads to a private patio with ocean views, perfect for morning coffee or al fresco dining. Direct access from the 3-car garage to the kitchen makes for easy entry into the home. Also on this level is a private en-suite bedroom perfect for visitors or a home office. Downstairs, the primary suite is a retreat with an oversized bathroom featuring a soaking tub and dual vanities. With plenty of room for a seating area, it has sliding doors that lead outdoors, letting in the fresh breeze. An additional family room on this level has a fireplace, bar area, and a slider that opens to a rear yard area with a private patio and a firepit.  Located across the street from a beautiful park, this home has quick access to the HOA pool. It is also part of the prestigious Palos Verdes School District, renowned for its excellent educational opportunities. Proximity to shopping and fine dining ensures that everything you need is within easy reach.","Tile","Bonus Room, Family Room, Formal Entry, Kitchen, Library, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Palo Verde Unified","","","","","Cari","Corbalis","SCLAYCAR","S5267","2","%","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","2300000","False","Full Service","Text Cari Corbalis for viewing appointments: 310-704-4014","True","Association","T