ully passing by and golfers perfecting their swings on the stunning resort course below.  Take advantage of the coveted lifestyle this property offers, where you can leisurely stroll down to the resort for a refreshing drink or an exquisite dinner. Alternatively, spend your afternoons basking in the warm embrace of the community pool and tennis courts. This exceptional property grants you the opportunity to embrace a lifestyle of unparalleled luxury and leisure.  Step inside this elegant abode, where a spacious living room welcomes you with its gleaming wood floors, inviting fireplace, and a deck that provides a seamless extension of the awe-inspiring views. The large, remodeled kitchen has been meticulously designed for the art of entertaining, featuring an attached dining area that beckons guests to gather and enjoy culinary delights.  Descending to the lower level, you'll discover a generous family room and two secondary bedrooms that seamlessly opens to a lovely yard, offering a serene vista of the lush greenbelt and ocean beyond. The main level of the home boasts a luxurious primary suite, complete with a beautifully remodeled bathroom, fireplace, and an expansive walk-in closet, ensuring comfort and convenience at its finest.  In addition to its idyllic resort living, this property offers effortless access to the freeway and the surrounding cities. Furthermore, it falls within the acclaimed Palos Verdes School District, known for its award-winning schools.  Don't miss out on this unparalleled opportunity to relish in 365 days of resort living, accompanied by easy access to urban amenities and renowned schools. Make this elegant residence your very own, and embrace a lifestyle that epitomizes luxury and leisure.","Flat, Spanish Tile","Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Stephen","Haw","VHAWSTE","V8040","2.5","%","Keller Williams Palos Verdes","2332500","F