nced by custom-engineered support beams in both the walls and attic, creating seamless flow and structural integrity. No detail has been overlooked: all-new electrical and plumbing systems, extensive foundation retrofitting and upgrades, and a new drainage system provide peace of mind for years to come. The designer kitchen is a showpiece, featuring quartz waterfall countertops, custom wood & tile flooring, a 40-bottle under-counter wine cooler, built-in wine rack and bar, large hammered steel sink, and premium Viking appliances including a five-burner range and Fisher & Paykel dual-drawer dishwasher. A dramatic floor-to-ceiling gas fireplace anchors the main living area, while blackout shades on all windows and doors create comfort and privacy. Flat-screen TV hookups are installed in the TV room, dining room, primary suite, and outdoor patio. Step outside to breathtaking VIEWS of Catalina Island, the Pacific Ocean, and Trump National Golf Club. The grounds have been thoughtfully upgraded with new pavers throughout the driveway, sidewalks, rear patio, pool deck, and courtyard. The sparkling swimming pool and hot tub feature new tile, poured concrete coping, solar heating, and a new pool water heater. Owned solar panels power the home for energy efficiency. Outdoor living is elevated with a custom PVC pergola featuring recessed lighting and two ceiling fans, complemented by five additional interior ceiling fans. Nine palm trees frame the property, creating a true resort-like atmosphere. The fully renovated garage includes new epoxy flooring, custom cabinetry and pantry, large sink, generous storage closet, and new medal garage door. Multiple metal exterior gates, six CCTV cameras with recording capability, and perimeter security lighting with automatic timers complete this meticulously upgraded property. High speed electric vehicle charger Luxury coastal living at its finest ? structurally enhanced, beautifully designed, and situated on an expansive lot offering privacy, views, and exceptional indoor-outdoor living.","Tile","Den, Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","Palos Verdes","","","Denise","Rosner","CLW-C105032","CLW-X81461","","","Compass","2400000","False","Full Service","Please email offers to karen.lowe@compass.com including POF/Pre Qual letter","False","In Ground, Solar Heated","True","","2209","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Phantom","","32333","Drive","","Spanish","1031 Exchange, Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","26834","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Connected, Electricity Connected","Catalina, Coastline, Golf Course, Ocean, Panoramic","True","","","Double Pane Windows","1963","90275","",""
