s, and set in the perfect microclimate?not too hot, not too foggy?this home offers the very best of Palos Verdes living. This opportunity is rare?and it won?t last at this new value price. Schedule Your Private Showing Today! Your dream home with world-class views is ready. Contact your agent?and make sure to ask them to give you the supplements to the listing (savings on electric bills, clear geotechnical report) ? to book a private tour. AND...  Ask about attractive seller financing options!","Clay, Tile","Bonus Room, Entry, Family Room, Foyer, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Media Room, Utility Room, Walk-In Closet, Wine Cellar","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","SR205521863","Zoravar","Singh","SR207067096","SR0154300","","","eXp Realty of Greater Los Angeles, Inc.","2650000","False","Full Service","While owner is SUPREMELY MOTIVATED and PROMISES to work with you on your offer, seeing the property is not super easy.  It's easy, just not super easy.   1) TEXT me your name, license number and email. 2) INCLUDE the date and desired time you want to show 3) I will coordinate with occupant, then confirm back to you.","False","Private, Above Ground","True","True","4116","Appraiser","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Nuvola","","51","Court","","Mediterranean","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Owner May Carry","","45667","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Cable Connected, Electricity Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Available, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Available, Sewer Available, Sewer Connected, Underground Utilities, Water Available, Water Connected","Catalina, Coastline, Golf Course, Ocean, Panoramic, Park/Greenbelt","True","https://unbranded.youriguide.com/51_nuvola_ct_rancho_palos_verdes_ca/","https://vimeo.com/1006663193","Double Pane Windows, Screens","1997","90275","5385","RPRS1-RS20000-"
