ivate, Heated, In Ground, Salt Water, Solar Heat","True","","957.26","Welcome to your dream home in the highly sought-after Ladera Linda neighborhood of Rancho Palos Verdes, CA. This stunning residence boasts 4 beds, 3 baths, and 2,925 sqft of living space on a 16,369 sqft lot. Step inside and be captivated by the extensive remodeling that has taken place within the last 5 years. The interior features are truly remarkable, starting with the custom-designed kitchen remodeled in 2021. It features top-of-the-line appliances including a Subzero clear glass door refrigerator with vegetable drawer and freezer, 48"" Viking 8 burner range with double oven convection bake, under-island built in Viking microwave, and built in Thermador coffee maker. The twin island counter prep spaces, double drawer Fisher and Paykel dishwasher, and 30-inch farm-style sink make this kitchen a chef's paradise. The Silestone Calcutta Gold Polished countertops, gloss white cabinets, and Rivershell white polished backsplash add tasteful elegance and refinement. Wood shutters, large Subzero Wine Fridge, European Oak Villa Blanca flooring, and a Travertine Fireplace with remote control automated gas starter complete the luxurious feel. The sprawling primary suite is a true retreat, offering breathtaking ocean and coastline views. It features double closets, with one being a walk-in, and a remodeled primary bath. The bath boasts tile flooring, a linen closet, an oversized shower with a rainfall showerhead and separate handheld head, and a Japanese copper soaker tub - perfect for unwinding after a long day. The attached TV's are hardwired to the internet service and hooked up to Sonos sound bars, providing an immersive entertainment experience. Outside, enjoy resort-style living with a remodeled saltwater pool with custom lighting and waterfall features, a freestanding spa, and a backyard view deck. The fully paid-for solar panel system, upgraded electrical, and smart patio trellis covers ensure energy efficiency. The outdoor kitchen is built with a hard line gas BBQ, refrigerator, cooler and barstools for hosting gatherings.  The outdoor sound system, and hard line gas firepit tie it all together. The upgraded driveway pavers, wrought iron fencing, and Millgard Windows add to the exterior's charm. Located in the award-winning Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified School District, this home is close to Golden Cove shopping and restaurants, Terranea Resort, Trump National Golf Course, and hiking trails. Experience coastal living at its finest.","Spanish Tile","Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Primary Suite, See Remarks","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Aaron","Aalcides","SBAALCAAR","S6669","2.5","%","Keller Williams South Bay","2800000","False","Full Service","Easy to Show starting Tuesday October 3rd Brokers Open from 11am to 2pm. Text Wyatt with your business card and appointment request. Once confirmed CBS will be provided prior to appointment.","","Private, Above Ground, Heated, Solar Heated","True","","2925","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Vigilance","","3663","Drive","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","26834","","Single Family Residence","","","Catalina, Coastline, Hills, Ocean","True","https://tour.caimagemaker.com/l/?id=179588IDX","http://tour.caimagemaker.com/Viewer/FpV5.asp?ID=179588","Double Pane Windows","1965","90275","6125","RPRS13000*"
