 indoor and outdoor spaces. Upon entering this private, gated entrance to the home, you will see views from almost every room. The single-story floor plan is open, with minimal interior walls to encourage flow between rooms. This house offers the perfect indoor/outdoor California lifestyle with an open concept that extends to the patio, creating a larger outdoor living space. The patio is an ideal place to entertain while enjoying colorful sunsets from the swimming pool overlooking the approximately three-quarter acre lushly landscaped ocean and Catalina view lot. Ideally located near award-winning Palos Verdes schools, shopping, dining, Terranea Resort, endless ocean trails and open nature preserves.","","All Bedrooms Down, Formal Entry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Retreat","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Vicki","Leach","SLEAVIC","S5543","","","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","2900000","False","Full Service","Call for appointment/showing instructions.  Gated property. Call Rae at 310.947.1667 or Paul at 310.910.1547","True","","","True","2182","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Arrowroot","","6116","","","Mid Century Modern","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Contract","","23434","","Single Family Residence","","Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Available, Underground Utilities, Water Connected","Bay, Catalina, Coastline, Ocean, Panoramic, Water, White Water","True","","https://tours.previewfirst.com/ml/145155","","1956","90275","",""
