, and 6+ driveway spaces are additional highlights that complete this home..Rest and relax watching the waves crash, enjoy the Golf Club, incredible beaches, hikes and the world class Terranea Resort are just a short stroll away. The Rare opportunity to own this trophy property within the 24hr secured private community of 36 homes awaits.","Tile","All Bedrooms Up, Den, Exercise Room, Family Room, Formal Entry, Foyer, Great Room, Home Theatre, Kitchen, Laundry, Library, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Media Room, Office, Separate Family Room, Sun, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry, Wine Cellar","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Sean","Galligan","CLW-C123780","CLW-X82789","2","%","Avenue 8, Inc.","11275000","False","Full Service","PLEASE READ PRIVATE REMARKS: PLEASE CALL OR TEXT LEO GOLDSCHWARTZ @ 714-719-0670. PLEASE PROVIDE 24HR NOTICE FOR ALL SHOWINGS. DO NOT DISTURB THE CLIENT OR GO DIRECT. THANK YOU.","True","Private, Gunite, Heated, In Ground, Permits","True","True","7100","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Cape Point","","32033","Drive","","Contemporary, Modern","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","50667","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Connected, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Connected, Sewer Connected, Underground Utilities, Water Connected","Bluff, Catalina, City Lights, Coastline, Golf Course, Hills, Mountain(s), Ocean, Panoramic, Water, White Water","True","","","Double Pane Windows, ENERGY STAR Qualified Windows","2021","90275","4557","RPRSIRPD-OH*"
