ooms, including a spacious primary en suite, the layout ensures privacy. The primary en suite boasts dual sinks & vanities. The grand bathroom includes a step-in shower  & a separate tub. Throughout the home, abundant storage options await, including two hallway closets, including a linen closet with shelving for effortless organization. Recent updates have left no stone unturned, with new custom exterior paint renovations completed. Outside, a lower yard space on the nearly 13,000-sf lot invites your creativity to flourish ? the possibilities are as vast as the ocean itself. Positioned near esteemed schools such as Point Vicente Elementary School, Palos Verdes Intermediate School, & Palos Verdes High School, this home seamlessly combines a spectacular location, generous square footage, and nearby amenities.","Spanish Tile","All Bedrooms Down, Family Room, Formal Entry, Foyer, Kitchen, Living Room, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Nick","Burdiak","PVBURDNIC","V8107","2","%","Vista Sotheby's International Realty","1875000","False","Full Service","For a showing, please text me a picture of your business card, the time & date requested. Thank you, Elizabeth  562.673.9715 Please allow a 1 hour notice. Take Rue De La Pierre private road and park in front of the house. Please do not ask to hold an open house.","True","None","False","True","2560","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Three Or More ","","","Rue De La Pierre","","30738","","","Contemporary","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional, Submit","","30119","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Available, Natural Gas Available, Phone Available, Sewer Available, Water Available","Catalina, City Lights, Coastline, Ocean, Panoramic","True","","","Blinds, Custom Covering, Roller Shields, Screens","1973","90275","",""
