have separate parking and access. Indulge in awe-inspiring Catalina Island and ocean views that paint the skies with breathtaking sunsets. Inside, your journey begins with ocean views greeting you right at your front door. The grandeur of soaring ceilings and a magnificent PV Stone natural gas burning fireplace further enhance the coastal feeling of this home. The attached 3-car garage provides ample space for your classic car or a workshop.  Hidden within the sought-after Pt. Vicente neighborhood in Rancho Palos Verdes, this location is nothing short of idyllic. Pt. Vicente Elementary School, a prestigious member of the esteemed Palos Verdes School District, is close by but not within school traffic. The Peninsula offers a world of opportunities, including hiking trails, beaches, dining options, and the prestigious Terranea Resort. All of this, within a uniquely walkable Peninsula neighborhood, just steps away from Golden Cove Center, Peninsula Tap House offering live music and craft beer, Avenue Italy for fine dining, and Great American for seafood. Get your necessities at Trader Joe's, Starbucks, banking, and medical services. For nature enthusiasts, embark on 5.5 miles of dog-friendly hiking trails, leading to the iconic Pt. Vicente Lighthouse & Interpretive Center, right across from your property. Waking up in the primary bedroom is the perfect way to start your day. It's a sanctuary featuring high ceilings and an en suite bathroom with a soaking tub. Here, the grand ocean views continue to captivate, making every morning a work of art. However, the true star of the show is the backyard covered patio, offering an unrivaled vantage point to savor those panoramic ocean views. Whether you're enjoying a cocktail or a mocktail, watching boats glide across the water, or awaiting the sun for the sun do disappear beyond the horizon, this is your private haven for relaxation. Don't miss the chance to make this remarkable home your very own. Schedule a visit today, as ho