"","0.224","Property is held in a Trust. Call or Text Oliver @ 818-602-6949 for showing instructions.","","","170 - West Palos Verdes","None","False","7582018004","","0","","False","3","","","","3","5","","Rancho Palos Verdes","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Direct Ph","Agent Direct Ph","Agent Toll Free","Agent Voice Mail","Agent Email","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","7","2200000","#ERR","02/28/2025 7:35:11 PM","","","03/10/2025 12:00:00 AM","04/02/2025 12:34:30 PM","03/03/2025 12:00:00 AM","","02/28/2025 12:00:00 AM","03/10/2025 12:00:00 AM","03/03/2025 12:39:49 PM","04/02/2025 12:00:00 AM","04/02/2025 12:00:00 AM","","","7","","False","","","","","","","Cash to New Loan","Living Room","True","","True","Central","True","","True","True","","Call Listing Office, Supra","False","","","","33.762745","Dryer Included, Gas Dryer Hookup, Individual Room, Inside, Washer Hookup, Washer Included","True","False","","","1999950","","","1999950","#ERR","818-602-6949","","darwichre@gmail.com","818-579-9205","Oliver","818-602-6949","0","Darwich","","F207057724","","0","818-602-6949","0","SR0132302","310-230-5478","Compass","310-230-5478","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.40996","","14","9757","Garden, Landscaped, Walkstreet, Yard","Curbs, Fishing, Hiking , Park, Sidewalks, Street Lights, Suburban","Carbon Monoxide Detector(s), Smoke Detector(s)","Assessor","","","SR25044867","","3","3","","1","Vacant","8186026949","","8186026949","","Direct Garage Access, Driveway, Garage, Garage - Two Door, Garage Door Opener, Private","True","","","52","","None","False","Close Of Escrow","814.51","First time to ever hit the market, here is an amazing opportunity to own a 5 bedroom 3 bath home with over 2700 square feet of living space in the prestigious & highly desired Rancho Palos Verdes community. This home has been loved & cared for by the same family since 1969, is situated at the end of a quiet cul de sac just a few blocks away from the Pacific Ocean, and is awaiting a new owner to make this home their very own. As you approach the home you will notice the gorgeous curb appeal with a custom stone paver driveway & walkway, and a grand double door entry welcomes you with custom floor to ceiling stained glass windows & manicured front lawn. The home has a freshly painted exterior and interior & features wood floors throughout with some tile. Step down into the living room and relax by the gorgeous & cozy granite fireplace. A nice size dining room with custom chandelier sits right off the kitchen. The kitchen is perfect for any chef, & features a beautiful backsplash, bay window, newer stainless steel appliances & lots of counter & cabinet space allowing plenty of space for storage. Individual laundry room is located off the kitchen with included washer and dryer and additional pantry space. Downstairs bedroom is currently being used as an office. Large sunroom is a great bonus to the house adding over 375 feet of extra living space. Upstairs you will find a large primary suite & primary bath with his and her sinks & separate shower and soaking tub. Three additional comfortable bedrooms are down the hall serviced by a full bathroom with his and her sinks as well. Large three car garage with direct access into the home offers plenty of room for storage. Newer upgraded heating system and water heater are located in the garage. Step outside to your lush backyard and enjoy the ocean breeze with a large covered patio and spacious side yard with garden beds. This home is located in the highly acclaimed Palos Verdes Peninsula unified school district & is just a short walk to Point Vicente Elementary School. Also near many stunning beach front hiking trails, short drive to Trader Joe?s, world renowned golf courses, and the world famous Terranea Resort.","Tile","Den, Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Palos Ver