ffice, hangout, crafting space or homework area. The generous primary suite features a large en-suite bath, walk-in closet, and an additional room perfect for a nursery, reading room, or private office. A three-car garage with direct access affords ease and convenience. Outdoors, enjoy low-maintenance, drought-tolerant xeriscape landscaping, an inviting pool, and sweeping ocean views. Served by highly rated schools from elementary through high school, with convenient access to nearby shopping and dining.","","Jack & Jill, Living Room, Office, Walk-In Closet","","","","","","CLW-10012633","Scott","Berglund","VBERGSCO","V7078","","","Peninsula Properties","2323000","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions: Supra will be in place on Tuesday, Jan 13th. Please call Brad Lawrence at 323-481-4700 prior to showing for CBS Access Code and with any questions. Showing Information: Vacant,Call LA 1,Supra Lock Box,Call First ","","None","False","","3184","","","CA","Closed","Multi/Split ","","","Via Borica","","30247","","","Ranch","","","","","Single Family Residence","","","Ocean","True","","","","1966","90275","4413","RPRS10000*"
