,"V7765","310-698-6888","Merit Real Estate","310-379-4444","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.405551","","38","10096","Sloped Down, Garden, Landscaped, Lawn, Lot 6500-9999, Rectangular Lot, Yard","Curbs, Sidewalks, Street Lights, Suburban","","Assessor","","","PV23144978","","2","2","","1","Vacant","","","","","Garage","True","Deck, Wood","True","1","","None","False","Close Of Escrow","640.11","Welcome to 30816 Rue de la Pierre. An up-to-date 5 bedroom, 4.5 bath home nestled in the heart of West RPV. This exceptional home is situated on a quiet cul de sac with a private alley, ensuring privacy and exclusivity. Taken down to the studs and tastefully reimagined in 2013, this home offers modern amenities and a dynamic, yet functional floor plan for comfortable living and entertaining. The main level boasts a huge open kitchen which open up to the dining area, with high-end stainless steel appliances, custom finishes, and breathtaking views -- ideal for for hosting gatherings and creating cherished memories with loved ones. On the lower level, there are 4 bedrooms and a a spacious office, ideal for remote work or as a quiet retreat for reading and relaxation. Perhaps one of the most unique features of this exceptional property is the lower level, which features a separate entry, complete with it's own living area, bedroom, and full bathroom. This space is perfect for accommodating visiting guests or just a private retreat away from the rest of the home. Now, we can't just gloss over the views here - simply put, they are breathtaking. From every level of this home, you'll be treated to jaw-dropping panoramic ocean vistas. Located on the high point of the street, you'll catch mesmerizing views of Catalina Island, Santa Barbara Island, and the iconic Pt. Vicente lighthouse. The outdoor spaces are equally impressive. The multiple large deck spaces offer room for lounging and entertaining, making it the perfect spot to unwind and soak in the sun and fresh air. The lower yard presents an opportunity to create your own oasis, whether it be the existing luscious green lawn or a future pool area. But that's not all - this home just keeps delivering. There's even more potential with a large upper yard above the alley. It presents a blank canvas for you to create a private ocean view hideaway. Additional features include air conditioning, high current EV wiring, and solar panels (owned). Extremely walkable location, just a short stroll to Pt Vicente Elementary School, Golden Cove shopping center, and many walking trails. Or pamper yourself with a spa session or dinner reservations just 5 minutes away at Terranea. This is your chance to own a slice of paradise in Rancho Palos Verdes. Schedule a private tour today and let your dreams of coastal living become a reality.","Spanish Tile","Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Library, Living Room, Primary Suite, Office, Recreation, Utility Room, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Point Vicente","","Palos Verdes","","Natalie","Vaughan Edmunds","PVVAUGNAT","v8542","2.5","%","Compass","2330000","False","Full Service","Go direct. Park and access the front door from the alley. Supra on wrought iron gate.","True","None","False","","3640","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Three Or More ","","","Rue De La Pierre","","30816","","","","Submit","","30119","","Single Family Residence","","Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Catalina, Ocean, Panoramic","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=vmiFjQMquR2","https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/v6v7btmt3kdu0llggm2zt/30816-Rue-De-La-PierrePromo-3.mp4?rlkey=dxmtxvoehpa8itdz6yqkwalld&dl=0","Custom Covering, Double Pane Windows","1973","90275","5318","RPRS10000*"
