blished community near hiking trails, local shops, and Palos Verdes? iconic coastline, this move-in ready residence is the epitome of elegant California living. A rare opportunity to own a truly turnkey coastal sanctuary. Schedule your private tour today.","Spanish Tile","All Bedrooms Up, Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Loft, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Nicole","Pletkovich","PVPLETNIC","v8460","","","Keller Williams Realty","2420000","False","Full Service","Schedule showings via ShowingTime. CBS code required to access the supra, so must have confirmed appointment.","True","Private, Heated, In Ground","True","","2706","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Multi/Split ","","","Via Rivera","","30433","","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Contract, Conventional, Submit","","29920","","Single Family Residence","","","Ocean","True","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bo3Yd1bhr34","","","1970","90275","4449","RPRS10000*"
