ite counters, custom cabinetry, a center island, breakfast bar, Sub-Zero refrigerator, double ovens, and Viking appliances. An adjoining family room opens seamlessly to the expansive outdoor areas. Upstairs, the luxurious primary suite showcases a private balcony with panoramic ocean views, fireplace, and a spa-inspired bathroom with dual vanities, walk-in closets, a soaking tub, and separate shower. Additional highlights include an elevator, wine storage/bonus room, full laundry room, and 4-car garage. Outdoor living is equally impressive with a wraparound balcony, beautifully landscaped grounds, and a large grassy yard?all within a 24/7 security-patrolled community for ultimate privacy and peace of mind. This rare offering combines elegance, comfort, and security?delivering the very best of coastal living.","","Family Room, Formal Entry, Primary Suite, Office, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Cathy","Zhang","MLSL2-01331491","MLSL-34989","","","Assent Home & Loan","5120000","False","Full Service","Easy to show. Please call or text DeDe Hsu @ 310-722-9222 to confirm.","True","","","","7031","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Via Del Cielo","","20","","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","46628","","Single Family Residence","","","Ocean, Water","True","","","","2000","90275","2510","RPRS"
