 Door Opener","True","Covered, Deck, Patio Open, Front Porch","True","1","","None","False","","1015.31","FOR COMPOS PURPOSE ONLY. Welcome to your Mediterranean paradise in the prestigious Oceanfront Estates, Rancho Palos Verdes. This Front-Row Bluff Property captures unobstructed Ocean, Catalina, Santa Barbara Island, the Malibu Coast, and mesmerizing Sunset views, making every day a natural masterpiece. As you approach, a private entrance invites you into a meticulously landscaped courtyard adorned with an exotic loggia and a welcoming fireplace, creating the perfect backdrop for limitless outdoor entertainment and relaxation. Inside the MAIN LEVEL, you'll find flexible living areas featuring large picture windows and French doors that seamlessly merge with the breathtaking views outside. The central living room connects the courtyard to the oversize balcony with fireplace & glass railings, offering a front-row seat for whale watching, birds gliding through the azure skies, and the soothing sound of crashing waves. A versatile family room/office opens to a covered section of the balcony, providing a serene space for both work and leisure. The gourmet kitchen is a chef's dream, boasting a spacious custom granite island with a breakfast counter and top-of-the-line Viking appliances: a 6-burner range, Subzero fridge, 2 dishwashers & 3 ovens. An open bar area, a butler station, and a walk-in pantry complete this culinary haven. The kitchen effortlessly flows into a casual dining area and a formal dining/family room, both granting access to the 2 view balconies on this level. A bedroom suite on the main floor provides an ideal space for guests/in-laws. On the LOWER LEVEL, you'll find a generously sized family room featuring a wet bar, work desk, and built-in entertainment center. French door opens to the spacious backyard with a fire pit, adding to your outdoor entertainment options. The Primary Bedroom Wing is a sanctuary of luxury with a bar, a cozy fireplace, and an oversized bathroom featuring double vanity areas, a spa tub, and an expansive walk-in dressing room. Two additional bedroom suites on the lower level ensure privacy and ample space for guests or family. Additional highlights include a grand entryway, a spacious laundry room, and powder room on each floor. Your peace of mind is also assured by the 24-hour roaming security that oversees this exclusive community. This is more than a luxury home; it's a front-row ticket to a lifetime of enchanting sunsets and oceanfront serenity. Embrace luxury, embrace the ocean, and make this masterpiece your own.","","Family Room, Formal Entry, Foyer, Guest/Maid's Quarters, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Point Vicente","Peninsula","Palos Verdes","VCURTJEF","Stephen","Haw","vhawste","V8040","2","%","Keller Williams Palos Verdes","6100000","False","Full Service","No showing.","True","","","","6008","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Via Del Cielo","","31","","","Mediterranean","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","46628","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Bluff, Catalina, Coastline, Ocean, Panoramic, Water","True","https://www.seetheproperty.com/u/451271","","Casement Windows, Double Pane Windows, Drapes","2005","90275","2511","RPRS"
