 your own private access to a pristine beach area, where you can explore the captivating tide pools and bask in the serenity of the coastal surroundings.  Spanning over 8,055 square feet of meticulously designed living space, this magnificent residence boasts seven bedrooms and eight and a half baths. Situated on an expansive lot of over one acre, the meticulously maintained grounds provide a picturesque backdrop for this exquisite property.  The gourmet kitchen is a culinary enthusiast's dream, featuring a center island cooktop, state-of-the-art appliances, and a charming eating nook with a hand-painted ceiling. The large formal dining room, adorned with French doors that open to the outdoors, offers a truly enchanting dining experience with breathtaking views as your backdrop.  The formal living room, complete with a dramatic stone fireplace and French doors, seamlessly blends the indoor and outdoor spaces, creating the perfect setting for sophisticated entertaining. The luxury master suite is a haven of tranquility, boasting a romantic fireplace, a spacious sitting area overlooking the ocean, and his and hers baths and walk-in closets. Every detail has been carefully considered to create a sanctuary of utmost comfort and opulence.  The outdoor oasis is an absolute dream, featuring a beautiful pool and spa where you can unwind and soak up the California sunshine. A guest house with a separate living room area ensures privacy and convenience for visitors.  Indulge in the ultimate entertainment experience with a media room, wine cellar, and library, each meticulously designed with impeccable finishes.  This extraordinary estate offers a lifestyle beyond compare. With its awe-inspiring ocean views, luxurious amenities, and impeccable attention to detail, it presents a picture-perfect haven where refined living and coastal beauty harmoniously converge.","","Center Hall, Dressing Area, Entry, Formal Entry, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Suite, Media Room, Utili