iers, raised ceilings, and custom art pieces all combine to captivate and inspire. This four-bedroom, three-and-a-half-bath residence was designed to evoke the serenity of a spa while offering the privacy of a secluded coastal escape. Each bedroom suite opens to its own balcony with sweeping ocean views. The primary suite features a spa-inspired bathroom with soaking tub, while the home itself is furnished and outfitted with carefully curated pieces?from bedding and furniture to kitchenware and appliances?that speak to quality and taste. Casa Agave is more than a home; it is an experience. A place where Spanish architecture, coastal vistas, and curated design converge to create a truly one-of-a-kind lifestyle on California?s most scenic coastline.","","Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Dylan","Bartlett","SBBARTDYL","SB1332850","","","Real Brokerage Technologies","1925000","False","Entry Only","Buyer to confirm all information.  Seller is a California limited liability company whose member/manager is a licensed California real estate agent, but is selling in his individual capacity as LLC Manager. For showing information, please call or text Jenn at 951.333.0453 or email oerpservice@yahoo.com. Thank you","","","","","2906","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Via Del Mar","","7080","","","","1031 Exchange, Cash, Contract, Conventional, Fannie Mae, FHA, Freddie Mac, Government Loan, USDA Loan, VA Loan","","37818","","Single Family Residence","","","Catalina, Ocean","True","","","","1987","90275","5371","RPRS10000*"
