enerously sized kitchen is a chef's dream, featuring granite countertops and a cozy breakfast nook bathed in natural light. Meanwhile, the downstairs family room exudes charm with its gleaming hardwood floors and a convenient wet bar that seamlessly connects to the inviting pool area, making it ideal for both relaxation and entertainment.  For those in need of a versatile space, the downstairs office with adjacent bath offers the flexibility to serve as a main-floor bedroom, boasting the same hardwood floors that grace the rest of the home.  Upstairs, a sprawling bonus room provides endless possibilities, limited only by your imagination. Plantation shutters adorn the windows, adding an extra layer of sophistication to each room.  This home has been updated with new carpeting, ensuring a fresh and inviting ambiance throughout. Retreat to the spacious primary suite, complete with walk-in closets and an en-suite bath featuring a double vanity, adding a touch of opulence to your daily routine.  Outside, the property's curb appeal is a sight to behold, with meticulously maintained sprawling lawns that mirror the grandeur within. The patio areas surrounding the pool and spa beckon for outdoor gatherings and relaxation, making this home an oasis of leisure and tranquility.  Don't miss the opportunity to call this remarkable property your own and experience the pinnacle of country club living in this sought-after neighborhood.  Very close to shopping and dining and easy access off the hill for commuters.  Located in the Award Wining Palos Verdes School District.","","Family Room, Formal Entry, Game Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Bill","Davis","VDAVIBIL","V8496","2.5","%","Palm Realty Boutique","2150000","False","Full Service","Vacant with Supra","True","Private","True","","3509","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Camino Porvenir","","30428",