 enclosed sunroom, making each day feel like a perpetual vacation. Step inside to discover a well-maintained interior where elegance meets effortless comfort. The newly remodeled, bright, functional kitchen boasts ample counter space and top-of-the-line appliances. The property includes two large living rooms, with fireplaces in both. The living room, dining room, and primary suite have French doors leading to the sunroom for optimal indoor-outdoor access and entertaining. The primary suite has a fully remodeled bathroom, with a beautiful shower, stand-alone tub, and double sinks.  Additionally, the property boasts a three-car garage, a well-kept front and backyard, a formal dining room, a kitchen, eating area, and a sunken bar for entertaining. It?s coastal living at its best! From the spacious layout to abundant natural light, this house feels inviting, open, and relaxing. Nestled in the prestigious Palos Verdes community, this home offers privacy and serenity while remaining just moments away from the area's finest amenities. Trader Joe?s, Starbucks, and fine restaurants are five minutes away. Whether you're drawn to the renowned schools, pristine beaches, fabulous coastal hiking, nearby Golf Courses, or upscale dining and shopping destinations, this is your chance to experience the ultimate in California coastal living.  Don't miss out on the opportunity to call 30165 Avenida Celestial your own and enjoy the tranquil lifestyle of Peninsula living?","","Den, Entry, Family Room, Foyer, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Separate Family Room, Sun","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","George","Wang","sbwanggeo","SB1294140","2","%","Harvest Realtors, Inc.","2220000","False","Full Service","Please do not disturb owners. 310-418-9088 Carol ""CAMi"" Mell. Showings start Tuesday the 14th after 3:00pm-  Please let me know if you would like to schedule a showing. Wed, Thursday/Friday