in the Monaco tract of custom homes in Rancho Palos Verdes.  The home is situated on 1/3 acre, flat lot with south facing ocean views from the kitchen, dining and living rooms as well as the backyard. This home was built in 1975 with a great, must-see, floor plan that has the entry, living room, family room, dining room and a beautifully remodeled kitchen all flowing together and to the huge rear yard. There are two fireplace, two eating areas, vaulted ceilings, custom lighting and dark rich wood floors.  The custom kitchen includes large granite counters, Viking stove and refrigerator, stainless steel appliances, a farmer?s sink, along with plenty of wood cabinet storage and much more. The master bedroom suite has high ceilings, separate bath and shower with double vanity sinks, three closets, double door entry and a slider opening up to a gazebo in the massive backyard with privacy galore.  The other two bedrooms easily fit queen-sized beds.  For those prospective buyers who love art, the home has an artist touch as well in which part of the three (3) car garage has been converted to a working artist?s studio with added windows and lighting. This rare find is situated on a very large flat lot of 15,859 square feet. It includes upgraded hardscaping throughout the property with tiered planters with drip lines, all with beautiful plants, scrubs and trees. The lot has ample room for a home addition, room for a pool or even room for an ADU ? owner has provided a contractor?s rendering for an 800 square foot, 2 bedroom, 2 bath ADU with full ocean views.  Introductions for the interested buyer can be made to the designer/contractor for full plans.  Furnishings, artwork and patio sets can be made available to the Buyer. Come view this perfect home today!","Tile","Family Room, Formal Entry, Foyer, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet","","Palo Verde Unified","","Palos Verdes","Ridgecrest","","Andrew","Tseng","sbtsenand","S5747","2