enities include a dedicated home office, large family room with built-ins,, and a spacious 3 car garage with additional storage space. This move-in-ready house with ocean views offers the perfect blend of luxury, comfort, and coastal living. Whether you're enjoying your park like backyard, or witnessing breathtaking sunsets from your living room, this home is sure to provide a truly enchanting and unforgettable experience.","Tile","Basement, Center Hall, Entry, Family Room, Formal Entry, Foyer, Game Room, Guest/Maid's Quarters, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","DeDe","Hsu","PVDELIHSU","V8040","2.5","%","Keller Williams Palos Verdes","2350000","False","Full Service","Please call first - property is owner occupied.","True","None","False","True","3392","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Rhone","","30203","Drive","","Cape Cod, Custom Built, Traditional","Conventional","","25313","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Connected, Water Connected","Catalina, City Lights, Coastline, Hills, Neighborhood, Ocean, Panoramic, Park/Greenbelt","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=CqRHJq5HDYS&mls=1","","","1964","90275","5768","RPRS20000*"
