l living rooms that open to private patios, perfect for entertaining against the stunning backdrop of the ocean and city skyline.  The large formal dining area highlights custom quality built ins.  The primary master suite is a true sanctuary, complete with a spa-inspired en-suite bathroom, walk-in closet, retreat, private balcony, fireplace, and offers seamless indoor-outdoor living with everchanging enchanting views. Three bedrooms are en-suite, providing ultimate privacy and convenience for family, guests, or a home office. Additionally, the home features a separate office ideal for remote work or creative space.  Other key features include sky lights, dual zoned HVAC, entertainment system with built in speakers, abundant natural light, ceiling fans, beautifully landscaped yards with outdoor tranquil vegetable gardens, fruit trees and relaxation areas that offer an immersive experience that make you feel like you are on top of the world.  The oversized two-car garage with ample storage and attic space enhance functionality and efficiency.  Seller will consider selling furnished.  Nearby amenities include The Palos Verdes Peninsula Interpretive Center, Point Vicente Lighthouse, Terranea Resort, Los Verdes Golf Course, Golden Cove Shopping Center with restaurants, entertainment, banks, pharmacy, Trader Joe's, Ralph's, Award-winning Palos Verdes Unified School District, The Norris Theater, parks, trails, shopping, dining, and entertainment.  There is no other property like this on The Peninsula!  Don't miss this unique opportunity to acquire your dream home!","Tile","Dressing Area, Family Room, Formal Entry, Office, Retreat, Walk-In Closet","","","","","","CLW-X83458","Glenn David","Thompson","CLW-X76901","CLW-X72093","","","WILSHIRE REAL ESTATE","2370000","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions:  Showing Information: Text LA 1 ","","None","False","","3525","","","CA","Closed","Multi/Split ","","","Via La Cresta","","30963","","","See Remarks","","","","","Sing