e living room showcases vaulted ceilings with exposed beams, a fireplace, built-in bookcases, and panoramic views. The formal dining room is perfect for entertaining, while the kitchen, complete with a cozy dining nook, flows seamlessly into the family room, which boasts a wet bar and built-in cabinetry. A large laundry room adds convenience. Three well-appointed bedrooms are located along the family room hallway, while the private master suite, set apart off the entry hall, features a dressing area and an en-suite bath. This exceptional home combines comfort, style, and stunning scenery in an unbeatable location.","","Den, Entry, Living Room","","","","","","CLW-305837360","Dong Van","Vo","PVODONG","PB20255","","","Dong Vo, Broker","2480000","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions:  Showing Information: Listing Agent Accompanies,Call LA 1 ","True","None","False","","3275","","","CA","Closed","One","","","Crest","","6847","Road","","Traditional","","","","","Single Family Residence","","","Ocean","True","","","","1964","90275","4554","RPRAIA"
