.  Big Screen Spectacular Ocean, Catalina and Panoramic Coastline Views are only one of the everyday joys of this immaculate, spacious and super-elegant split-level 5-bedroom home.  Standing in front of the home you instantly have a sense of Classic Beauty and Elegance.  You walk through a large classically styled courtyard/patio of Italian porcelain tile with complementary landscaping. Enter through a custom large wood front door with leaded and beveled glass complimenting entryway.  Perfect home for entertaining and watching the spectacular sunsets. Upon entering the house, you notice how bright and spacious the main living and dining areas are along with the main outside deck  (other rooms have their own private balconies).  They fit together beautifully.  Lots of windows lots of light.  The tastefully elevated living room has a fireplace with a marble mantle and high angled cedar ceiling. The living room floor is of maple wood (matching that in the family room).  The main wrap-around balcony/patio is large and enables a lot of room for dining outside.  On the main level Italian marble floors cover the foyer, dining room, kitchen, hallways and guest bathroom.  The main level also includes a bedroom/office and full bath. The kitchen also has a panoramic view, in addition to the normal built-ins you would expect with granite countertops and an island with its own sink.  Plenty of storge and a pantry.  Next to the kitchen is a breakfast nook with ocean views which adjoins a large cathedral-ceiling family room with a fireplace and a full wet bar.  The family room has its own balcony/patio overlooking the entire coastline.  Up the stairs from the living room is a ""loft"", it's really almost a large private apartment of its own with a bright den/workspace area and a large bedroom with walk-in closet and full bath with beautiful tiling.  Downstairs there are three bedrooms with ocean views overlooking the garden.  One of these is the spectacular master suite with its own outdoor patio.  It includes a large sitting area, giant walk-in closet, fireplace, and a full bath with separate shower area. The other two bedrooms on this floor share a large, covered patio with a jacuzzi and a full bath. The owners have made many upgrades. Ample three car garage.  Spa is included.  Good video on uTube, type in address.","Composition","Center Hall, Dressing Area, Formal Entry, Foyer, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Loft, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Peter","Lim","SBLIMPETE","DWAJE","2.5","%","Allison James Estates & Homes","2500000","False","Full Service","Call owner, easy to show.  When at the property dial owner and she will buzz in through the security gate.  Go up the driveway and just park along the wall.  Nicette Jukelevics, owner, 310-767-6911.","True","None","False","True","3930","Appraiser","","CA","Closed","Multi/Split ","","","Rhone","","30526","Drive","","Contemporary","Cash To Existing Loan","","25313","","Single Family Residence","","","Catalina, Coastline, Hills, Ocean, Panoramic","True","","","Double Pane Windows","1978","90275","5743","RPRS20000*"
