ry hall, you?ll be greeted by a sweeping staircase and an enormous sunken living room that oozes style and comfort. The vaulted beamed ceilings and dramatic ledger-stone fireplace make this the perfect spot to unwind after a long day. Host lavish dinners in the formal dining room, or enjoy a cozy evening by the fire in the library. The family room is an entertainer?s delight, featuring a wet bar and a stunning copper fireplace.There is also a secondary bedroom on the ground floor.  Upstairs, the primary suite boasts a private balcony with jaw-dropping views of Los Verdes Golf Course.This floor has 3 more secondary bedrooms, 2 of which are extra large with balconies. And let's not forget the backyard?your personal oasis, complete with a pool and slide that?s sure to be the hit of every summer party. Located in the highly desirable Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified School District, this home is a must-see to appreciate all it has to offer.","Spanish Tile","Attic, Den, Entry, Family Room, Great Room, Jack & Jill, Kitchen, Library, Main Floor Bedroom, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Point Vicente","Palos Verdes","Palos Verdes","","Cari","Corbalis","SCLAYCAR","S5267","","","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","2519815","False","Limited Service","VACANT - Text Listing Agent at 714-342-9998 then GO DIRECT. Please turn off lights when leaving.  Email offers to: info@titanequities.com","True","None","False","","3808","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Avenida De Calma","","30234","","","Traditional","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","29115","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Connected, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Golf Course","True","","","Bay Window(s), Double Pane Windows","1971","90275","4505","RPRAIA"
