y, there is a bonus room with a separate entry at the lower level, which could be enjoyed for a play/hobby room or a guest quarter with its bath, and again with amazing views. This area is approximately 400 sq ft, which is not on the city/county records; therefore, it is not included in the square footage listed above. There is a voluntary Monaco HOA fee of $150, due annually, to cover the upkeep of the four entrance marquis, lighting, water, and gardening, ensuring a beautiful community. This is a fabulous property. Do not miss it!","","Kitchen, Laundry, Library, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Joann","Kim","SKIMJOAN","S1143","","","Peninsula Realty, Inc.","2548000","False","Full Service","Go direct, L/B on the light post of the front door, two keys in the box, one for the front door, one for the door at the lowere level, please do not miss the room down stairs, which is not included in the sq. ft. Please lock up both the front door and the door to the lower lever. Please turn off all lights. Many thanks!","","","","","2512","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Marne","","31423","Drive","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","25313","","Single Family Residence","","","Bluff, Catalina, City Lights, Coastline, Golf Course, Hills, Mountain(s), Neighborhood, Ocean, Panoramic, Vineyard, Water, White Water","True","https://www.seetheproperty.com/u/485512","","","1966","90275","5621","RPRS20000-OH*"
