ing to large outdoor spaces to entertain, this home is a buyer's dream. A large primary suite offers a cedar covered walk-in closet, additional closets for storage, walk-in shower and jet tub, and dual sinks with plenty of counter top space. Three additional bedrooms, two updated bathrooms, formal dining room, living room with fireplace, large family room with open kitchen and breakfast nook, and a walk-in pantry and laundry room complete the indoor living. Each room offers plenty of natural light, privacy from outdoor vegetation, and high tech remote controlled blinds. Nano doors in the family room create an entertainer's paradise; offering seamless indoor-outdoor living. Enjoy an extra large built-in BBQ and marble top covered bar underneath a beautiful pergola. Take in the afternoon with a game of tennis or pickleball on the private tennis court or enjoy an evening under the stars by the outdoor fire pit. Large side yards are perfect for outdoor storage or for pets to stretch their legs. A three car garage offers convenience and practicality for high-end living. This is a rare and special home and it is ready for its next owner.","Spanish Tile","Family Room, Jack & Jill, Laundry, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Piere","Pirnejad","SPIRNPIE","OC17339","","","Maxim Realty Group","2650000","False","Full Service","Call Matthew for Private Showings - 310-804-4026","True","None","False","","2890","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Avenida Selecta","","30256","","","Traditional","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","27114","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","None","False","https://www.seetheproperty.com/u/474843","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=fJtqh6C4z46&brand=0","Double Pane Windows","1976","90275","5424","RPRA1*"
