Adjacent to the living room, the formal dining room also offers access to the rear yard and includes its own fireplace, enhancing its elegant ambiance. The large, gourmet kitchen is a chef&#39;s dream, with a beautiful stone- topped island that includes a sink and plenty of space for barstools, ideal for casual dining. The kitchen is outfitted with high-end appliances, including a double stainless- steel oven, a built-in Monogram refrigerator, a five-burner Viking range, and ample wood cabinetry. A convenient in-kitchen breakfast area is perfect for informal meals, and the walk-in pantry offers plenty of storage space. The backyard is an entertainer's paradise, featuring a large covered patio, a built-in outdoor cooking area, and sweeping ocean views, making it an ideal spot for gatherings. The primary suite is a private retreat, complete with ocean views, a sliding door leading to the rear yard, and a spacious walk-- in closet. The en-suite bathroom features a soaking tub, separate shower, and dual sinks for ultimate convenience. Three additional spacious bedrooms offer custom built- It is ideal for home offices or organizations, as well as oversized windows and rich wood floors. They share a generously sized bathroom with dual sinks and a tub/shower combination. A three-car direct-access garage includes a laundry area, extra cabinetry, and countertops for added storage and workspace. Located within an award-winning school district, this home offers the perfect blend of comfort, style, and coastal living.","Tile","All Bedrooms Down, Living Room, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Jason","Buck","VBUCKRIC","V7186","","","Estate Properties","2650000","False","Full Service","Text agent Cari Corbalis for showing appointments","True","None","False","","2617","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Avenida De Calma","","30137","","","","Conventional","","29524","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Con