inetry, marble-accent fireplace and large sliding doors that bring in natural light and lead directly to the backyard. The outdoor space is well-designed for both relaxation and recreation, featuring a pool with updated heating equipment, spa, grassy area, seating options and spots for gardening and BBQ. The remodeled primary suite includes a walk-in shower, soaking tub, dual sinks, travertine flooring and custom cabinetry. Three additional bedrooms are spacious and well-appointed, while the fourth has its own bathroom?perfect for guests or extended family. Other upgraded bathrooms and a hallway laundry closet offer everyday convenience. The home is enhanced by newer central A/C, recessed lighting, dual-pane windows, Brazilian cherry engineered wood flooring, heated floors in the family room and kitchen, two tankless water heaters and a newer paver driveway. The 3-car garage provides direct access plus an EV charger. This well-maintained and move-in-ready home is conveniently located near shopping, award-winning Palos Verdes schools, parks, golf courses, hiking trails, Terranea Resort, restaurants and nearby beaches.","See Remarks","Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Donna","Cartwright","PVCARTDON","V7186","","","Estate Properties","2655000","False","Full Service","Call or text Britt Austin 310-938-9167","True","","","","2881","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Sattes","","6330","","","","Submit","","25160","","Single Family Residence","","","None","False","","","","1976","90275","",""
