is one-of-a-kind property blends elegant outdoor living with a rare sense of peace and privacy. A custom-built, multi-section pergola spans the full width of the backyard, defining multiple outdoor living zones beneath its striking gabled structure. Whether you're enjoying a quiet morning coffee beside the tiered fountain, dining al fresco under filtered sunlight, or soaking in the spa as the sun melts into the sea, every space has been curated to embrace the landscape and elevate your everyday. Surrounding the patio, lush drought-tolerant gardens, mature bonsai, sculpted shrubs, and multiple water features create a tranquil, zen-like retreat. The expansive turf lawn offers space for play or entertaining, all framed by rich landscaping and coastal hillside views. Inside, the home is filled with natural light and seamless transitions between indoor and outdoor living spaces. A rare blend of elegance, intention, and natural beauty?this Rancho Palos Verdes retreat is more than a home; it?s a sanctuary.","Tile","Family Room, Laundry, Library, Living Room, See Remarks, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Point Vicente","Palos Verdes","Ridgecrest","","Alicia","Greene","SGREEALI","S5267","","","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","2660000","False","Full Service","Text or Call 424-241-3311. Home is owner occupied. Seller is accommodating. Listing Agent to be present at all showings.","True","In Ground","True","True","2882","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Multi/Split ","","","Avenida De Calma","","30353","","","See Remarks","Conventional","","29115","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Catalina, Ocean, Panoramic","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=kCgZ4cvjgVU&brand=0","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=kCgZ4cvjgVU&brand=0","","1972","90275","4506","RPRAIA"
