Nishide","","PVNISHMIK","","","","","v8542","","Compass","310-241-3038","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.397979","","42","13993","0-1 Unit/Acre, Yard","Biking , Curbs, Golf, Hiking , Park, Street Lights","","Assessor","","","PV26012945","","3","3","","1","Vacant","","","","","Paved","True","","","1","","Private, Heated, In Ground","True","","941.1","Golden hour on the Peninsula doesn?t announce itself; it simply arrives. Soft, unhurried, and quietly changing the way the day feels. At 30105 Avenida Esplendida, that light drifts through wood-beamed ceilings and open living spaces, settling gently across the home and creating a sense of calm that feels both elevated and deeply personal. Coastal air moves easily through the residence, guided by generous windows and doors that blur the line between indoors and out. The interior layout is thoughtful and intentional. From nearly every main gathering space, the living room, kitchen, dining areas, family room, and three of the bedrooms, the home opens outward to ocean views. Here, the water is not something you visit; it becomes part of everyday life. Morning coffee, shared meals, and moments of quiet productivity unfold against the steady rhythm of the coastline, always present, never overpowering. Living and entertaining spaces are positioned on one side of the home, while the bedrooms are set apart on the other, creating a natural sense of privacy and retreat. The kitchen connects seamlessly to the living and breakfast areas, encouraging conversation and ease, while the dining and family rooms provide defined spaces for gathering or unwinding. Refreshed finishes throughout and a newly remodeled primary bath bring a clean, move-in-ready feel, without sacrificing warmth or character. Throughout the home, details speak softly but confidently. Wood-beamed ceilings add architectural depth, while expansive windows and doors flood the interiors with light. Outside, substantial copper half-round gutters wrap the residence, a subtle yet striking detail that reflects craftsmanship and ages beautifully over time. Beyond the interior, the experience continues outdoors. A Tuscany-inspired courtyard wraps gently around the home, creating a private world of its own. A pool and spa anchor the space, complemented by a built-in Lynx and Viking outdoor kitchen, a cozy fireplace, and multiple patios designed for long lunches, evening gatherings, and summer nights well spent. It?s a setting that feels transportive; designed not to impress loudly, but to be lived in fully. Properties that offer this balance of architectural warmth, usable outdoor living, and ocean views are increasingly rare. Avenida Esplendida is meant for living well, gathering often, and staying awhile. All just moments from Los Verdes Golf Course, shops, restaurants, and within the award-winning PVPUSD.","Slate","Entry, Family Room, Formal Entry, Foyer, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, See Remarks, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Cari","Corbalis","SCLAYCAR","S5267","","","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","2780000","False","Full Service","Schedule via ShowingTime. CBS code required to access the supra, so must have confirmed appointment.","","Heated, In Ground","True","","2954","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Avenida Esplendida","","30105","","","","Cash to New Loan","","27114","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Coastline, Mountain(s), Neighborhood, Ocean, Water","True","","","","1967","90275","",""
