pace. It offers its own separate bedroom, bathroom, kitchen, laundry, and living area. This versatile space holds great potential, whether you envision it as a home business, a place for home stay, accommodations for grown-up working children, or a living space for elderly parents. Surrounded by lush greenery, this property also boasts a delightful pond in the front, perfect for planting beautiful lotus flowers or raising koi. In the backyard, you'll find a refreshing pool and spa, ideal for family gatherings during California summers. Don't miss the opportunity to own this stunning property with its remarkable ADU and inviting outdoor spaces. Just a few minutes away, you'll find Robert Ryan Community Park, an ideal destination for family time and friendly gatherings, providing ample opportunities for outdoor fun. The property also offers a picturesque backdrop of a 15-hole Los Verdes golf course. Whether you're an avid golfer or simply appreciate the beauty of a well-maintained green landscape, this view provides a sense of tranquility and adds to the overall charm of the property. MOTIVATED SELLER!","","Foyer, Jack & Jill, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Bedroom, Separate Family Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Dorothea","Liebich","SBLIEBDOR","S4331","2.5","%","Century 21 Union Realty","2830000","False","Full Service","Text to 323-916-1130 with your business card for showings.","","","","","3470","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Vallon","","6853","Drive","","","Cash to New Loan","","28083","","Single Family Residence","","","None","False","","","","1968","90275","5305","RPRAIA"
