rue","Concrete, Covered, Deck, Patio Open, Wood","True","5","","None","False","Close Of Escrow","794.24","VIEW! VIEW!! VIEW!!! Nestled in the heart of Palos Verdes, this beautifully remodeled home offers panoramic Ocean and Malibu Mountain views from most living areas. Updated over the past 10 years, it?s the perfect sanctuary for those seeking elegance, tranquility, and luxury. A private courtyard with outdoor heaters invites year-round outdoor living, leading to a double-door entrance into a stunning foyer. Vaulted ceilings and expansive glass windows/doors fill the home with natural light, creating an open, airy atmosphere throughout. The spacious living room features a cozy fireplace and sliding doors that open to a view deck with glass railings, allowing you to maximize the breathtaking scenery from the comfort of your home. The heart of the residence is the remodeled open kitchen, ideal for culinary enthusiasts, featuring sleek quartz countertops, a large marble island, custom cabinetry, and high-end stainless steel appliances. Casual dining is available at the breakfast bar, or you can enjoy more formal meals in the adjacent dining area, both with astounding views. The primary suite is on the main floor, with large windows framing stunning views and a sliding door opening to the view deck. In addition, a brand new wall of closets with built-in systems, lighting, and a vanity desk are ready for the new owners. The primary bathroom offers a spa-like retreat with a sauna room, free-standing tub, and walk-in steam shower for ultimate relaxation. Two generously sized bedrooms in a separate wing provide privacy and share a remodeled bathroom with a large shower. ON THE LOWER LEVEL, a cozy family room with a fireplace provides additional living space, with sliding doors opening to a private patio. This level also features two versatile bedrooms?one currently used as an office with stylish built-in shelving, and the other as a private gym. Both rooms have sliding doors to the patio, allowing you to easily enjoy the fresh air outside. This home also offers a rare 4-car garage, with one space converted into a large laundry room. An IT closet caters to all your tech needs, including a security system with 8 cameras for peace of mind. A built-in sound system also adds to the entertainment experience. Outside, the backyard features a covered patio, grassy area, and two fruit trees, offering a serene outdoor space. With luxury, stunning views, and modern amenities, this home is a rare opportunity. Welcome to your dream home!","","Entry, Great Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Sauna, Separate Family Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Point Vicente","Peninsula","Ridgecrest","","Sunny","Rahmani","vrezasun","V7044","","","RE/MAX Estate Properties","2980000","False","Full Service","Showings start on this coming Sat and Sun, 11/30 and 12/1, open houses at 1-4 pm. For all showings after that, please text your business card and the showing date and time to my team member, Cindy Carter, at 310-388-2533 and she will set up the showing for you.","True","None","False","True","3752","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Crest","","6884","Road","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","27113","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Golf Course, Mountain(s), Ocean, Panoramic","True","https://www.seetheproperty.com/u/475789","","Blinds, Double Pane Windows, Drapes","1966","90275","4539","RPRAIA"
