share a Jack and Jill Bathroom with an oversize double-headed rain shower. There is also a large bedroom with beautiful built-in cabinets that is immediately adjacent to a full bathroom. Meanwhile, a powder room and a large laundry room are conveniently located to complete the home. Enjoy open-air tranquility in the vast backyard featuring a BBQ station with dining/buffet counter, an open patio as well as pergolas for relaxation. This one-of-a-kind estate has a wide, landscaped frontage and a spacious three-car garage that gives it a great curb appeal. Conveniently located near a park, golf courses, shops and PV award winning schools, don't miss out on the chance to call this dream a reality!","Tile","Entry, Jack & Jill, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Point Vicente","Peninsula","Palos Verdes","","Holly","Danna","sbdannhol","SB1350760","","","Compass","2995000","False","Full Service","The house is vacant. Just go and use Supra lockbox on the railing near the front door to show it. Please make sure that all doors and closed and locked up after showing.","True","None","False","","3586","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Alta Vista","","6707","Drive","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","32673","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Catalina, Ocean, Peek-A-Boo","True","https://www.seetheproperty.com/u/470373","","Bay Window(s), Double Pane Windows, Plantation Shutters, Roller Shields, Skylight(s)","1986","90275","5601","RPRS20000SP*"
