ost every room in the house. Vaulted ceilings, Saltillo tile and wide plank flooring throughout, walk-in closets, and upgraded bathrooms + a chef?s kitchen with limestone countertops, custom cabinetry and stainless steel appliances for the most discerning chef.  Expansive great room with large windows, sliding glass doors, a grand fireplace, automatic blinds and surround sound speakers. Upgrades and details continue in all bedrooms, the formal living and dining rooms, and the laundry room. The large backyard is a dream with a grass lawn, outdoor dining areas, built-in bbq, wooden hot tub, and expansive patios for watching sunsets or the golfers below. Other features of this stand out home are custom closets and, zoned HVAC, a 3-car garage with a workshop, and low maintenance landscaping with drip system and plenty of storage. Prime location with easy access to the best shopping, schools, and entertainment in Rancho Palos Verdes. Experience privacy, peacefulness, and world class views from this beautiful and timeless home on the hill!","","Family Room, Formal Entry, Kitchen, Laundry, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Suzanne","Dyer","Vdyersuz","V8407","2.5","%","Strand Hill Properties","3000000","False","Full Service","Text agent to show property 310-528-7480.  Please allow 24 hour notice to show.","","Private","True","True","3290","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Avenida Classica","","30125","","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","27114","","Single Family Residence","","","Catalina, Coastline, Ocean, Panoramic, Water","True","https://kuula.co/share/collection/7Kb03?logo=0&info=0&fs=1&vr=1&sd=1&initload=0&thumbs=1","","","1976","90275","5416","RPRA1*"
