ity. The adjacent dining room is light-filled and inviting?perfect for both intimate meals and larger gatherings. The expansive primary suite is a true retreat, featuring a private balcony with ocean views, generous proportions, and his-and-hers closets. Thoughtfully designed for versatility, the home?s layout is ideal for multi-generational living, offering space, comfort, and privacy. Other features include a large separate laundry room, 3 car garage, and a fireplace in both living room and family room. Set on a generous 20,000-square-foot lot, the property offers a large backyard ideal for entertaining, outdoor dining, and gatherings of any size. This rare offering combines timeless elegance, panoramic views, and exceptional indoor-outdoor living. Perfectly located for convenient access on and off the Hill, this home is moments from award-winning Palos Verdes schools, parks and trails, pristine beaches, and dining and shopping. Here, the ultimate coastal lifestyle awaits in one of Palos Verdes? most coveted neighborhoods.","Tile","Family Room, Foyer, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite, Multi-Level Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","June","Shim","sbshimjun","SB1288550","","","Coldwell Banker Residential Br","3050000","False","Full Service","Please TEXT Chrissy  at 310-991-5926 for all showings. No lock box.","True","","","","4197","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Alta Vista","","6977","","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","32673","","Single Family Residence","","","Ocean","True","","","","1985","90275","",""
