private cul-de-sac, offers breathtaking ocean and sunset views. With 5 bedrooms and 4.5 bathrooms, this residence radiates charm and curb appeal, featuring a semi-circular driveway and an impeccably maintained yard. Step through the front door into a formal entryway adorned with elegant travertine floors and a stunning chandelier. The home?s open and easy-flowing floor plan, mostly on one level, includes a formal living room with high ceilings, dramatic beam ceilings, and a cozy fireplace, a family room complete with a wet bar and another fireplace, a well-appointed kitchen, a formal dining room, a breakfast room, and a charming atrium. The Chef?s kitchen is a culinary dream, boasting stainless steel appliances, beautiful wood cabinets, double Sub-Zero refrigerator/freezers. two pull-out dishwashers, two ovens, with a2 warming drawers,, a walk-in pantry, and two additional pull-out pantries, plus a six-burner range. The South wing of the house features the spacious master suite, complete with its own fireplace and stunning ocean views. The luxurious master bath includes double sinks, a spa tub, a separate shower, and an expansive walk-in closet. There is another en-suite bedroom on that level. In the opposite wing, you?ll find two more bedrooms, a study, and a multi-purpose room. There?s even more to love with a large bonus room in the garage that?s perfect for a home gym. The outdoor spaces are equally impressive, with multiple French doors leading to the front yard, featuring a pool, and spa, plus a back patio area with an outdoor kitchen-complimented with a large synthetic turf yard, and a sports court on the upper terrace that backs up to the Los Verdes Golf Course (2nd Fairway). Additional highlights of this home include three AC units, a three-car garage, a laundry room, an updated epoxy floor in the garage, beautiful wood and travertine flooring throughout, and a convenient location close to PV schools with a walking path to Pt Vicente Elementary School, shops both at the Peninsula Shopping Center, Golden Cove Shopping Center, Trader Joes, and award winning restaurants. Don't let this incredible opportunity pass you by?call your real estate broker today to schedule a private tour and experience this stunning property in person! Your dream home awaits!","","Bonus Room, Dressing Area, Entry, Exercise Room, Family Room, Formal Entry, Foyer, Game Room, Great Room, Guest/Maid's Quarters, Home Theatre, Kitchen, Laundry, Library, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Media Room, Office, Retreat, See Remarks, Separate Family Room, Two Primaries, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Point Vicente","Palos Verdes Peninsula","Palos Verdes","","Michelle","Accetta","SBACCEMIC","S6107","","","Beach City Brokers","4450000","False","Full Service","just go and show.  Supra box on stair railing leading to the front door","","Private","True","","5185","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Calle De Suenos","","30666","","","Mediterranean, Spanish","Cash, Conventional","","33034","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Available, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Catalina, Golf Course, Ocean, Panoramic","True","https://vimeo.com/1006709809","https://youtu.be/SsD44bnRKx0","","1983","90275","4528","RPRA1A*"
