ng room will keep your meals and serving organized with ease. On the first floor there is also a spacious bedroom suite, as well as a classic, wood-paneled private office.  Leading up from the elegant wood staircase, you will find the remaining four bedroom suites, three of the bedroom suites all with breathtaking views of the Pacific. The primary bedroom has a truly panoramic view featuring windows and balconies on two sides. Hand-painted details lead to two lavish walk-in closets, the en-suite primary bathroom features rare pink stone counter top with meticulous details.  Backyard features view seating and grassy lawn, perfect place to unwind basking in the unobstructed ocean view and California sunshine.   Imagine waking up every morning to the sights of ocean and the golf course below, feeling like the King of the Hill, this is truly a one of a kind experience.","","Atrium, Den, Entry, Family Room, Formal Entry, Foyer, Kitchen, Laundry, Library, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Rahul","Bhagat","SBHAGRAH","SB1338520","","","eXp Realty of California Inc","5200000","False","Full Service","Supra on front door. Go direct. Please feel free to contact Mingli for questions: 310-293-0250.","True","","","","5551","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Le Blanc","","6454","Place","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional, Submit","","25160","","Single Family Residence","","","Catalina, Coastline, Golf Course, Ocean, Panoramic","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=oiaUYiSs3ik","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=oiaUYiSs3ik","","2002","90275","5728","RPRS20000*"
